<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Yaburin Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Dawudaa Bɛtine</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaburina</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yaburina</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Dawudaa Bɛtine</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila manga Dawuda nan Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi naxan xili “Nabi Dawudaa Yaburina.” Sora yo sora bɛti keden na a ra muxune yi naxan bama Ala batu waxatine yi. Yamaan yi salima waxatin naxan yi, e Ala batu, e yi bɛtina ndee bama nɛn Ala Batu Banxin kui. Dɛnkɛlɛya muxu kedenna fan yi nɔɛ nɛn bɛtine bɛ a konni a nɛma Ala maxandɛ waxatin naxan yi. Bɛtini itoe findixi Ala matɔxɔn nun Ala maxandin nan na.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɛti kɛmɛ tonge suulun nan malanxi Kitabun yireni ito kui Isirayila fonne yi naxanye bama salideni. Dawuda mi na ndee sɛbɛxi, koni e malanxi a xinla bun bayo a tan nan a wuyaxi sɛbɛ, a mɔn yi muxune yamari e xa bɛtine yitɔn a mangaya waxatini.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iki a yitaxunxi dɔxɔde suulun nan na. Yaburin Yire Singena: Keli a sora 1 ma han 41. A Yire Firindena: Keli a sora 42 ma han 72. A Yire Saxandena: Keli a sora 73 ma han 89. A Yire Naanindena: Keli a sora 90 ma han 106. A Yire Suulundena: Keli a sora 107 ma han 150.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yaburin sora kɛmɛ tonge suulunna yɛ, falana nde sɛbɛxi sora kɛmɛ nun nde xunna ra naxan e keliden yitama en na hanma e ba kiina hanma maxa seen naxanye lan e ma. Falan bun tiina nde mɔn sɛbɛxi ndee tagini naxan e ba kiin yɛbama. Ne bunne mi fa kolon ki faɲi bayo e sɛbɛn bata ɲɛɛ wuli saxan ti fayida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɛti siya fu nun firin nan kolonxi Nabi Dawudaa Yaburin kui:</para>
  <para style="ip">1) Tantun bɛtin naxanye Alaa gboon nun a fanna fe falama. (Misaala: sora 8, 19, 33, 100, 103-105, 111, 113, 114, 117, 135, 136, 145-149)</para>
  <para style="ip">2) Alaa mangayana fe bɛtine, naxanye a falama e naxa, “Mangan nan Alatala ra.” (Misaala: 47, 93, 96 han 99)</para>
  <para style="ip">3) Mangana bɛtine, Ala maxandina mangan xa hanma mangana Ala maxandina. (Misaala: 2, 18, 20, 21, 45, 72, 89, 101, 110, 144)</para>
  <para style="ip">4) Ala Batu Banxini so bɛtine. (Misaala: 15, 24)</para>
  <para style="ip">5) Isirayila kaane yi Higi yisiga bɛtini itoe nan bama e nɛma yi sigɛ sanla nde rabadeni Yerusalɛn taani. (Misaala: 84, 91, 121, 122)</para>
  <para style="ip">6) Siyon geyaan bɛtini itoe findixi yiren matɔxɔn nan na dɛnaxan sugandixi Ala Batu Banxin tiden na Yerusalɛn taani. (Misaala: 46, 48, 76, 87, 132)</para>
  <para style="ip">7) Bɛtini itoe findixi kawandin nan na tinxin muxune xa. (Misaala: 14, 50, 53, 75, 81, 95)</para>
  <para style="ip">8) Bɛtini itoe findixi xaranna nan na dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xa. (Misaala: 1, 37, 49, 73, 78, 112, 119, 127, 133)</para>
  <para style="ip">9) Yamaan bɛtini itoe bama tɔrɔ waxatin nin, naxanye findixi Ala maxandin na ɲaxankatani. (Misaala: 12, 44, 58, 60, 74, 79, 80, 83, 85, 90, 94, 106, 108, 123, 126, 137)</para>
  <para style="ip">10) Tɔrɔn sifan birin nɔɛ a ligɛ nɛn dɛnkɛlɛya muxun yi fa Ala ma. Mawuga bɛtini itoe nan wuya Yaburin kui. (Misaala: 5-7, 13, 17, 22, 25, 26, 28, 31, 35, 38, 39, 41-43, 51, 54, 57, 59, 61, 63, 64, 69-71, 86, 88, 102, 109, 120, 130, 140-143)</para>
  <para style="ip">11) Dɛnkɛlɛya muxuna Ala nuwali sama wali faɲin kolon bɛtini itoe nan na, a na a xunba hanma a na a yulubin xafari. (Misaala: 9-10, 30, 32, 34, 40.1-12, 92, 107, 116, 118)</para>
  <para style="ip">12) Dɛnkɛlɛya muxun limaniya bɛtini itoe nan bama, a yi a sɛwan nun a bɔɲɛ xunbenla mayita. (Misaala: 3, 4, 11, 16, 23, 62, 131, 139)</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="ip">Marigi Yesu fan Yaburin tantun bɛtine ba nɛn. (Maraka 14.26) A mɔn nde a fe fala nɛn a xaranna kui. (Maraka 12.10 nun 36) A mɔn yi nde fala a Ala maxandini. (Maraka 15.34, e nun Luka 23.46)</para>
  <para style="ip">Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu a fe sɛbɛxi Yaburin yire wuyaxi yi. Yesu a tɔrɔne sɛbɛxi yireni itoe yi: Yaburin 22 e nun Yaburin 69. Na feene fan sɛbɛxi Matiyu yire wuyaxi yi, alo Matiyu 27.34-48. Yesu keli fena sayani e nun a binyena fe sɛbɛxi yireni itoe yi: Yaburin 16, nun Yaburin 110 e nun Yaburin 118. Xɛra Piyɛri ne nan ma fe falaxi Kɛwanle sora 2 nun 4 kui. Yaburi Kitabun yirena fe falaxi Ningila Yesu kui dangu dɔxɔɲa ma kɛmɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito nɔɛ dɛnkɛlɛya muxune maliyɛ nɛn ki faɲi. A fe firin yitama en na. A singena, a lanma en xa Ala matɔxɔ, bayo a xanuntenyaan nun a sɛnbɛn gbo. A ɲɔxɔn mi na. A firindena, a lanma adamadiin xa a tɔrɔn birin yita Ala ra alogo a xa en madɛndɛn. Ala waxi a xɔn en xa en kui feene yita a ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dawudaa Yaburin findixi Isirayila kaane Ala maxandine nun Marigi Yesu Ala maxandine nun dɛnkɛlɛya muxu singene Ala maxandine nan na. (Xɛrane 4.24-26) Yaburin mɔn nɔɛ findɛ nɛn en fan ma Ala maxandine ra en na e fala Ala xa waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Yaburin Yire Singena: Keli Sora 1 ma han 41</para>
  <para style="s">Kira firinna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Sɛwan na kanna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxan mi muxu ɲaxine maxadi xuine suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxan mi birama yulubitɔne kiraan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxan mi a sama magele tiine fari.<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>Na kanna sɛwama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">Alatalaa sariyan suxudeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">a a xaxili lu Alaa sariyan xɔn kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>A sabatima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">alo wudi binla naxan xude dɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">a bogima nɛn a waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">a dɛɛne mi xarɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Na kanna na fefe suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">a sɔnɔyama nɛn a xa.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Koni muxu ɲaxine mi na kiini mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">e luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">alo foyen se dagin naxan xalima.<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Nanara, muxu ɲaxine yalagima nɛn kiti sa waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">yulubitɔne mi tiyɛ tinxin muxune yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>Alatala a ɲɔxɔ luma nɛn tinxin muxune xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">koni muxu ɲaxine kiraan sigama gbalon nin.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa manga sugandixina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Nanfera siyane murutɛma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">Nanfera yamanane muxune yanfa fuune soma?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Dunuɲa mangane bata tondi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">kuntigine bata e malan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">Alatala nun a muxu sugandixin xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>E naxa, “En xa en yɛtɛ ba e nɔɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">en xa en xunna ba e yamarin bun.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Marigin naxan ariyanna yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">na gelema e ma.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>A fitinaxin yi falan ti e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">a e magaxu a xɔlɔni,<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>a naxa, “N bata n ma mangan dɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">n ma geya sariɲanxin fari Siyon yi.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Mangan fan naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">“Alatala bata naxan nagidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">n na a ralima nɛn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">a naxa n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">‘N ma dii xɛmɛn nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">N bata findi i fafe ra to.<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>N maxɔdin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">n siyane soma nɛn i yii i kɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">bɔxɔn danne birin yi findi i gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>I e nɔma nɛn mangaya wure dunganna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">i yi e rayensenɲɛ ayi alo fɛɲɛna.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Nayi, ɛ tan mangane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">ɛ xaxili fen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">Ɛ tan dunuɲa kuntigine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">ɛ kawandin namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>Ɛ Alatala batu, ɛ gaxu a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">ɛ sɛwa, ɛ xuruxurun.<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>Ɛ dii xɛmɛn mafan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">alogo a nama xɔlɔ, a yi ɛ raxɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Bayo, a bɔɲɛn mafura tɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Sɛwan ne xa, naxanye e yigiya a ma.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan marakisi tiin na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, a to a gi a dii Abisalomi bun.<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Alatala, n yɛngɛfane bata wuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">E gbegbe bata keli n xili ma!<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>E n ma fe falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">e naxa, “Ala mi a malima.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:3">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Koni, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">i tan nan n ma yɛ masansan wure lefaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">I binyen fima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">e nun xunna kenla.<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>N na n xuini tema Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">a yi n yabi keli a geya sariɲanxini.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>N na n sa, n yi xi, n yi xulun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">bayo Alatala n kantanma.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>N mi gaxuɛ yaxu wuli wuyaxin yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">naxanye n nabilinxi yiren birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Alatala keli! N nakisi, n ma Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">N yaxune birin dɛɛne bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">i yi muxu ɲaxine ɲinne magira.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 3:9"/>Marakisi Tiin nan Alatala ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:9">Ala xa a yamaan baraka.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 3:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yigi sana Ala yi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba maxase luti kanne ra.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>N ma Ala tinxinxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">n na i xili, i xa n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">N ma tɔrɔni, i xa n mali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">i yi n ma maxandin namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Ɛ tan adamadiine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">ɛ n ma binyen findima yagin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">han waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Ɛ fatama fe fuune nun wulene ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 4:3">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>Ɛ xa a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">a Alatala bata muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine sugandi a yɛtɛ xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">N na Alatala maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">a n xuiin mɛma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Ɛ gaxu, ɛ fata yulubi ligan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">Ɛ na ɛ sa, ɛ raxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">ɛ bɔɲɛn namiri.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 4:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>Ɛ saraxan ba Ala xa tinxinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Ɛ yigin sa Alatala yi.<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Muxu wuyaxi naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">“Nde hɛrin yitɛ en na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">Alatala, i nɔrɔn xa godo nxu ma!”<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Koni i bata n bɔɲɛn nasɛwa han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">dangu se xaba waxatin lugon sɛwan na.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 4:9"/>N na n sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:9">n xima bɔɲɛ xunbenla nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:9">amasɔtɔ i tan Alatala nan tun n makantanma.<verse eid="PSA 4:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa en natanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba xulenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Alatala, i tuli mati n fala xuine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">i yi i tuli mati n kutun xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>N ma Ala nun n ma mangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">i tuli mati n ma wuga xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">N ni i tan nan maxandima.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Alatala, xɔtɔnni i n xuiin namɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">Xɔtɔnni, n na n yitama i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">n yi i ya yabin mamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Ala mi i tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">fe ɲaxin nafan naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">I mi tinɲɛ muxu ɲaxi yo ra i yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Wasodene mi tiyɛ i yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">I fe ɲaxi rabane birin naɲaxuma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>I wuledene halagima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">Alatala faxa tiine nun yanfantenne raɲaxuma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Koni n tan soma nɛn i konni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">i ya hinan gbeen xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">n ni i batuma nɛn i ya Banxi Sariɲanxini.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Alatala, ti n yɛɛ ra i ya tinxinni n yaxune e fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">I ya kiraan yita n na.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>N mi lɛ n yaxune fala xui yo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">e waxi fe kalan nan tun xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">E kɔɛ yinle rabixi alo gaburuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">yanfa falane nan e lɛnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>Ala, e yalagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">e kɔtɛne xa findi e yɛtɛ bira xunna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">E kedi i yɛtagi e matandine fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">bayo e bata murutɛ i ma.<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Koni ne birin xa ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">naxanye e luxunxi i yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">E xa bɛtin ba sɛwani habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">Na muxune ratanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">i xinla rafan naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">e yi sɛwa i ya fe ra!<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 5:13"/>Alatala, i tinxin muxune barakama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:13">i yi e rabilin fanna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:13">i yi e ratanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:13">alo yɛ masansan wure lefana.<verse eid="PSA 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandin tɔrɔ waxatini</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba maxase luti kanne ra e nun kondenna luti solomasɛxɛ kanna ra.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Alatala, i nama n maxadi xɔlɔni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">I nama fitina n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">i n ɲaxankata!<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Alatala, kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">n bata xadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Alatala, n nakɛndɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">bayo fanga mi fa n na.<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>N niin tɔrɔxi han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">Alatala, han waxatin mundun yi?<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Alatala, fa n kantan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">N niin nakisi i ya hinanni.<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Muxe mi e mirɛ i tan ma sayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">Nde nɔɛ i tantunɲɛ laxira yi?<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>N bata xadan kutundeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">n ma sadeni kunxi yɛɛgen na kɔɛ yo kɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">n wugama han n ma xunbunsaan yi yikun.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Sunun bata n yɛɛni fɔrɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">Wugan bata n yɛɛne buturun n yaxune fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Ɛ makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">ɛ tan fe ɲaxi rabane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">Bayo Alatala n wuga xuiin mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Alatala bata n ma mayandi xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">Alatala mɔn bata n ma maxandin suxu.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 6:11"/>N yaxune birin yagima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:11">e yarabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:11">E kuisanxin xɛtɛma nɛn mafurɛn!<verse eid="PSA 6:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandin malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Dawudaa mawugan bɛtina, a naxan baxi Alatala xa Kusi Bunyamin kaana fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Alatala n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">n bata n luxun i yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">N xunba, i yi n nakisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">ne birin ma naxanye n fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>Yaxune nama n yibɔ alo yatana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">naxan ma se suxi mi xunbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>Alatala n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">e n kansunma naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">xa n sɔnna na a ra,<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>xa n bata fe ɲaxin dɔxɔ muxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">nxu nun naxan dɔxi bɔɲɛ xunbenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">xa n bata n yɛngɛfaan muɲa tɔɲɛgɛni,<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>nayi, i xa tin n yaxune xa n kedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">e yi n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">e yi n mabodon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">e yi n fatin lu saxi gbangbanni.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 7:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Alatala keli i ya xɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">keli n yaxu xaɲɛne xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">Keli, n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">i sariya kɛndɛn sa!<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Siyane malanxin xa i rabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">i mangayaan liga e xunna.<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Alatala xa siyane makiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">Alatala, i xa n ma kitin sa n ma tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">bayo fɛ yo mi n na.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Danna sa muxu ɲaxine gbalone ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">I xa tinxin muxune ratanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">i tan Ala tinxinxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">i tan naxan muxun bɔɲɛne nun sɔndɔmɛne rakɔrɔsima.<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>Ala nan n yɛ masansan wure lefaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">A muxu sɔndɔmɛ faɲine rakisima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>Ala nan kitisa tinxinxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">Ala na a ra naxan xɔlɔma waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>Xa muxu ɲaxin mi tubi Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">a silanfanna raxanxanma nɛn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.13</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">a yi a xanla ba a woli xinla ma.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Ala bata a faxa ti seene tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">a a xalimakunle findi tɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Naxan lugoxi tinxintareyaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">a mɔn nafexi gbalon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">a raɲanna nan wulen na.<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>A yinla gema a a ratilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">a yɛtɛɛn yi bira a kui.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>A tɔrɔn nun gbalon nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">ne yi xɛtɛ a ma.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 7:18"/>N na Alatala tantunma a tinxinna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:18">N bɛtin bama nɛn Kore Xɔnna Alatala xinli.<verse eid="PSA 7:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa binyena adamadiin xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba Gati kaane kondenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Nxu Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">i tan nan xili gbee kanna ra bɔxɔn birin yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">I bata i ya nɔrɔn nate</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">han kore xɔnna ma!<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>I bata diidine nun dii ɲɔrɛne yamari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">e yi i matɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">alogo i yaxune xa e dundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">e nun yɛngɛfane nun gbeeɲɔxɔ tiine.<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>N na koren mato</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">i naxan nafalaxi i yiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">kiken nun sarene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">i naxanye dɔxi e yirene yi, n naxa,<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>“Nanse daɲɔxɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">i to i yengi dɔxi a xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">Nanfera i ɲɔxɔ luxi adamadiin xɔn?”<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>I a daxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">a nɔrɔn yi maso malekane ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">I binyen nun xunnayerenna fi a ma.<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>I bata yamarin so a yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">i ya dali seene birin xunna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">I bata seen birin lu a sanna bun:<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>alo xuruse kurune nun ɲinge kurune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">nun burunna subene<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>nun xɔline nun yɛxɛne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">e nun niimaseen naxanye fɔxɔ igeni.<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 8:10"/>Nxu Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:10">i tan nan xili gbee kanna ra bɔxɔn birin yi!<verse eid="PSA 8:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s">Barika birana Ala xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo “Dii Xɛmɛ Faxan” bɛtina.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>Alatala, n ni i tantunma nɛn n bɔɲɛn ma feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">N ni i ya kabanako feene yɛbama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>N ɲaxanma nɛn n sɛwa i ya fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">Kore Xɔnna Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">n tantun bɛtin bama i xa nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>N yaxune xɛtɛma e giyɛ nɛn i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">e dagalanɲɛ ayi, e ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Bayo i bata n xun mayɛngɛ kitin bolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">i bata dɔxɔ i ya mangaya gbɛdɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">i yi kitin sa tinxinni.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>I bata falan ti siya gbɛtɛne xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">i mɔn yi muxu ɲaxine raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">muxe mi fa e mirima e xinle ma sɔnɔn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Yaxune bata ɲan fefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">i bata e taane kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">Ɲinan bata ti e ma feu!<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>Koni Alatala nan mangan na habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">a mangaya gbɛdɛn dɔxi kiti sa xinla ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>A dunuɲa makitima tinxinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">A sariya kɛndɛn sama yamane xa.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Muxu yigbɛtɛnxine faran makantanxin nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">e luxundena tɔrɔ waxatine yi.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>Naxanye i tan kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">ne e yigi sama i yi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">bayo naxan na i fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">Alatala, i mi i mɛ na ra mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun bɛtin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">naxan dɔxi Siyon yi, a manga taani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">Ɛ a wali faɲine rali siyane ma!<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Ala nan wuli bɔxɔnxin gbeeɲɔxɔ tiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">A mi ɲinanɲɛ a xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">A yengi dɔxi yiigelitɔne wuga xuiin xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>Alatala, kininkinin n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">A mato</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">n yaxune n nayarabima kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">i tan naxan n bama faxan dɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>Nanara, n ni i tantunɲɛ Siyon kaane yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">n yi sɛwa i ya marakisina fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Siyane bata yinla ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">e bira a kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">e bata e suxu e yɛtɛ luti ratixine ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Alatala bata a yɛtɛ yita a kiti kɛndɛne xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">Muxu ɲaxin tan suxuma a kɛwanle nan na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 9:17">Maxase xuina. Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Muxu ɲaxine sigama laxira yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">e nun siyaan naxanye birin e mɛxi Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Ala mi tɔrɔ muxune rabeɲinɲɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">Yiigelitɔne mi yigitɛgɛma.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Alatala, keli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">Adamane nama nɔɔn sɔtɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">Siyane xa makiti i yɛɛ xɔri!<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 9:21"/>Alatala, gaxun nagodo e ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:21">E xa a kolon fa fala daɲɔxɔn nan tun e ra.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 9:21">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>Alatala, nanfera i makuyaxi nxu ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">I luxunma nxu ma tɔrɔ waxatine yi nanfera?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Muxu ɲaxine bata waso ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">e mɔn yiigelitɔne bɛsɛnxɔnyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">A e suxu a kɔtɛne ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>A kanbama a nata ɲaxine yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">Kumadena Alatala raɲaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">a a mɛ a ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Muxu ɲaxina a falama dɛ ɲaxun na, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">“Ala mi muxe yulubine saranma e ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">Ala mi na!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">A a miriyaan birin nan na ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>A feen birin nasɔnɔyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">A mi i ya kitine suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">a mɔn yoma a yaxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>A a falama a yɛtɛ ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">“N mi fulɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">n mi luyɛ tɔrɔni mumɛ!”<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>A dɛɛn nafexi dangane nun wulene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">nun fala xui xɔlɛne nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">A fe ɲaxin nun tɔrɔ feen nan tun falama.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>A a luxunma banxidɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">a sɔntarene legedenma e faxa feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">A yɛɛ masama fangatarene ma wundoni.<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>A legedenna tima a luxundeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">alo yatana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">A saxi, a yiigelitɔne legedenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">a e suxu a lutin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">a e bubu, a e xali.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Fangatarene e felenma e bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">e lu a nɔɔn bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>A yi a fala a yɛtɛ ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">“Ala a fe mi a yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">A bata a yɛɛne raxi. A mi n toɛ!”<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Alatala, keli! I fangan mayita, Ala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">I nama ɲinan yiigelitɔne ma!<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Nanfera muxu ɲaxina Ala raɲaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">a yi a fala a yɛtɛ ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">“Ala mi n ɲaxankatɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Koni i tan Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">i tɔrɔn nun sɔxɔlɛn toma yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">I xaxili luma nɛn ne xɔn ma mali xinla ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Fangatarene bata e yɛtɛ taxu i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Kiridi mali tiin nan i tan na.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Muxu ɲaxin fangan kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">i yi a ɲaxankata a fe ɲaxine fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">han i yi a raxɔri.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Alatala nan mangan na habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Suxure batune raxɔrima nɛn a bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Alatala, i yiigelitɔne maxandi xuiin mɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">i yi e bɔɲɛn sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">I yi e wuga xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>I xa sariya kɛndɛn sa kiridine xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">e nun muxu ɲaxankataxine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">Nanara, daɲɔxɔn mi fa magaxun tiyɛ sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala en yigina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina bɛti baane kuntigin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">N bata Alatala findi n luxunden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">I mɔn a falama n xa nanfera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">nayi fa fala, “Tugan alo xɔlina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">i siga geyaan ma,<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>amasɔtɔ a mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">muxu ɲaxine bata e xanle ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">e e xalimakunle ti muxu sɔndɔmɛ faɲine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">e bun xinla ma dimini.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Xa sariya mi fa na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">tinxin muxune nɔɛ nanse ligɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Alatala a Batu Banxi Sariɲanxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Alatala a manga gbɛdɛni ariyanna yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">A adamadiine xun matoma a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">a e rakɔrɔsima a yɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Alatala tinxin muxune nun muxu ɲaxine rakɔrɔsima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">Gbalo feen nafanxi naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">a ne raɲaxuma a niin birin yi nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>A tɛɛ wolonna nun dole tɛɛn nagodoma nɛn muxu ɲaxine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">A e tɔrɔma foye wolonna ra nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Alatala tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">tinxinyaan nafan a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">Muxu faɲine a yɛtagin toma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba kondenna luti solomasɛxɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Alatala, nxu mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">bayo muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine bata ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">Dɛnkɛlɛya muxu yo mi fa adamadiine yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Birin wulen falama a boden xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">E e bode yanfa wule matɔxɔn xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Alatala, na muxune dɛɛn suxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">naxanye wule matɔxɔn tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">e nun muxu dɛ raɲaxuxine,<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>naxanye a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">“Nxu nɔɔn sɔtɔma nxu fala xuine nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">Nxu dɛɛn fatan han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">Nde nxu nɔɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Awa, Alatala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">“Bayo yiigelitɔne ɲaxankataxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">e nun tɔrɔ muxune wugama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">nba iki, n bata keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">n na e ratangama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">naxanye raɲaxuxi.”<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Alatalaa falane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">fala sariɲanxin nan e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">alo gbeti fixɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">naxan nasɛnsɛnxi sulun tɛɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.7</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note> na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">han sanɲa ma solofere.<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Alatala, i nxu kantanɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">i nxu ratanga muxu sifani itoe ma habadan.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 12:9"/>Na muxu ɲaxine e kanbama yiren birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:9">bayo Adamadiine fe fuune yatɛxi.<verse eid="PSA 12:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Alatala, han waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">I ɲinanɲɛ n xɔn han habadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">I yɛtagin luxunɲɛ n ma han waxatin mundun yi?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>N niin xa tɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">n bɔɲɛn yi fɛriɲɛn sunuxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">han waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">N yaxuna n fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">han waxatin mundun yi?<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Alatala n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">n mato, i n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">N fangan xun masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">xa na mi a ra, n faxama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>N yaxun yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">a naxa, “N bata a nɔ.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">N yaxune sɛwama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">n na bira waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>N tan n yigin saxi i ya hinanna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">sɛwana n bɔɲɛni i ya kisina fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">Alatala, n bɛtin bama i xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">amasɔtɔ i bata fe faɲin liga n xa.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s">Muxuna ɲaxuyana</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 53.1-6</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina bɛti baane kuntigin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Xaxilitarena a falama a bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">a naxa, “Ala mi na.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">E birin yifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">e haramu feene ligama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Muxu yo mi a faɲin nabama.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Alatala a yɛɛn nagodoma adamadiine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">keli ariyanna yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">a xa a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">xa nde na naxan xaxili sɔtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">a yi Ala fen.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Koni birin bata kiraan beɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">e ɲaxu ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">Muxu yo mi a faɲin nabama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">hali muxu keden pe!<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Fe ɲaxi rabane mi fe kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">E n ma yamaan tɔnɔn donma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">alo donsena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">koni e mi Alatala xandima mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Awa nayi, e gaxuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">e xuruxurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">Amasɔtɔ Ala tinxin muxune xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Ɛ tan fe ɲaxi rabane yiigelitɔne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">fe yitɔnxine kalama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">koni Alatala nan e maratangaden na.<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Nde kelɛ Siyon yi a Isirayila rakisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Alatala mɔn na a yamaan sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna sɛwama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Isirayila yi ɲaxan!<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa muxuna</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Alatala nde nɔɛ luyɛ i ya yire sariɲanxini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Nde luyɛ i ya geya sariɲanxin fari?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Fɛ mi naxan kɛwanle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">a tinxin, a ɲɔndin falama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">fata a sɔndɔmɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>A mi bonne xili kalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">a mi fe ɲaxi yo ligama a dɔxɔ boden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">a mɔn mi a rayagima.<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>Ala bata naxanye raɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">a mɛma nɛn ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">Koni a Alatala yɛɛragaxu muxune binyama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">Hali a tɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">a fala xuiin nakamalima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>A muxune dolima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">koni e mi se sama a fari a raxɛtɛdeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">A mi dimi yi seene rasuxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">alogo a xa wulen sa sɔntaren xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Naxan na feni itoe liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">na mi mamaxɛ mumɛ.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina yigina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Dawuda Ala maxandi faɲina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">Ala, n kantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">bayo n bata n luxun i yi.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>N bata a fala Alatala xa, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">“N Marigin nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">Se faɲi gbɛtɛ mi n yii ba i tan na.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>N sɛwaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">yamanan muxu sariɲanxi gbeene nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Naxanye suxurene batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">ne tɔrɔyaan gboma ayi nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Koni n tan mi saraxan bɛ e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">n dɛ mi e xinle falɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Alatala, i tan nan keden pe n yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">i maragidi faɲin fima n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">N ma dunuɲa yi gidina i tan nan yii.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Ala naxan soxi n yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">na rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">n bata sɛwa n ma kɛɛ sɔtɔxin na.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>N barikan birama Alatala xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">naxan n kawandima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">Hali kɔɛɛn na, n xaxili sɔtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>N xaxili Alatala xɔn ma waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">bayo a n dɛxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">sese mi n mamaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>Nanara, n bɔɲɛn sɛwaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">n niin yi yifan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">n yi n matabu bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Amasɔtɔ, i mi i mɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">n siga laxira yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">I mi tinɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">i ya muxu tɔgɔndiyaxin yi kun gaburun kui.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>I nii rakisi kiraan yitama n na nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">nanara n sɛwama nɛn i yɛtagi han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">Nii fanna mi ɲanɲɛ i dɛxɔn ma habadan!<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s">Sɔntarene Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Dawudaa Ala maxandina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">Alatala, n ma maxandin namɛ tinxinyana fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">I tuli mati n wuga xuiin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">I tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">wule mi naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>I n xun mafala kitin bolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">amasɔtɔ naxan tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">i na kolon.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>I na n bɔɲɛni feene fɛsɛfɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">i na n nakɔrɔsi kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">i na n kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">i mi fɛ yo toɛ n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">N mi tinɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">fala ɲaxin yi mini n dɛ<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>alo muxu gbɛtɛne kɛwanle kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">N bata i ya yamarin suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">N mɔn mi biraxi gbalotɔne kirane fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>N sigan tima i ya kirane nan xɔn ma tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">han iki, n munma dagalanɲɛ ayi singen.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Ala, n na i maxandima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">amasɔtɔ i n yabima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">nanara i firifiri n xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">i yi i tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>I ya kabanako hinanna yita nxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">i tan naxan muxune rakisima e yaxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">naxan na a luxun i yi.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>N natanga alo i yɛɛne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">N luxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">alo tɔxɛ diin soma a nga gabutɛne bun ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>Nanara, muxu ɲaxine mi n liyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">n yaxu ɲaxin naxanye n nabilinni.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Kininkinin yo mi e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">e falan tima yandan na.<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>E bata fa n fɔxɔ ra iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">e n nabilinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">E yɛɛne tixi n na e fɛrɛn fenma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">e n nabira bɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>E ligaxi alo yatana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">xɔɔyi se xɔnla naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">alo yata gbeen naxan n legedenma luxunni.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Keli Alatala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">N yaxune yɛngɛ, i yi e nɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">N natanga muxu ɲaxine ma i ya silanfanna ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Alatala, n natanga na dunuɲa muxu sifane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">naxanye e kɔntɔnna sɔtɔma e siimayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">E ralugo na kɔntɔnna ra ken</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">i naxan namaraxi e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">e diine fan xa wasa a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">a dɔnxɛn mɔn yi lu e mamandenne xa!<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Koni n na i yɛtagin toma nɛn tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">n na xulun, n wasa i yɛtagin na.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s">Barika birana nɔ sɔtɔna fe ra</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 22.1-51</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Alatalaa walikɛɛn Dawudaa bɛtin bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A bɛtini ito baxi nɛn Alatala to a ba a yaxune birin yii e nun Sɔli yii.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>Alatala n fangana, n bata i xanu!<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>Alatala nan n kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">n ma yinna, n xunba muxuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">N ma Ala nan n kantan gɛmɛ gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">n na n luxunma naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">A tan nan n yɛ masansan wure lefaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">e nun marakisi tiina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">alo n ma faran makantanxina.<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Alatala xa tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">N na a xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">a yi n nakisi n yaxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>Sayaan gbalon bata yi n nabilin nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">halagin bata yi lu n xun ma nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">alo ige xunfanna.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Laxira gbalon bata yi n nabilin nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Bilinganna bata yi a lutin nati n yɛɛ ra nun.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>N na Alatala xili nɛn n ma tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">n yi n xuini te n ma Ala ma malina fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">A yi n xuiin mɛ a Batu Banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">a yi a tuli mati n gbelegbele xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Nanara, bɔxɔn yi xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">a yimaxa, geyane bunne yi siga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">e xɛtɛ, e xuruxurun Ala xɔlɔn bun.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>A liga alo tutin nan minima a ɲɔɛ yinla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">Halagi ti tɛɛ dɛgɛn nun tɛɛ wolonne yi mini a dɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>A yi kuyeni bɔ firinna ra, a godo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">a sanne tixi kunda fɔrɛn fari.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>A te maleka gubugubu kanna fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">a tugan xulɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">a siga foyeni.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>A a luxun dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">kunda fɔrɛn nun tule igen yi a rabilin kore.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Kundaan yi mini a nɔrɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">Balabalan kɛsɛne nun galanna yi godo.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Alatala yi a galanna xuiin namini keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">Kore Xɔnna Ala yi a xuiin namini.<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>A yi a xalimakunle woli a yaxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">a e raxuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">A e birin nagi kuye sarinna ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Alatala to falan ti e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">a sɔnxɔ e ma xɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">fɔxɔ igen xɔnna yi mini kɛnɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">bɔxɔ xɔnne yi to.<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Ala yi a yiini bandun keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">a n suxu, a yi n ba igen tilin yireni.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>A n xunba n yaxu sɛnbɛ kanne yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">n yɛngɛfaan naxanye fangan yi gbo n xa nun.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>E n yɛngɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">n yi gbaloni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">koni Alatala yi n natanga.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>A n ba nɛn gbalo yireni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">a n nakisi amasɔtɔ n tan a kɛnɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>Alatala bata n kɔntɔnna fi n ma tinxinyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">a n saren fi amasɔtɔ n kɛwanle sariɲan.<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>N bata sigan ti Alatala a kirane xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">n mi n makuyaxi Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>N bata a kitine birin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">n mi tondixi a tɔnne suxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Fɛ yo mi n na a yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">bayo n bata n yɛtɛ ratanga hakɛn ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Nanara, Alatala bata n kɔntɔnna fi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">amasɔtɔ n tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">n kɛwanle sariɲan a yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>Naxan na tinxin i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">i tinxinma nɛn na kanna xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">Fɛ yo mi naxanye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">i ya fɛtareyaan yitama nɛn ne ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>I sariɲanma nɛn ne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">naxanye na sariɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">koni i ɲaxuma nɛn na muxune ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">naxanye ɲaxu.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Bayo i tan nan yiigelitɔne rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">i mɔn yi wasodene ragodo.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Alatala, i tan nan kɛnɛnna fima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">n ma Ala, i yi n ba dimini.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>N ganla yɛngɛma nɛn i tan barakani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">I tan yi, n tuganma yinna xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>Alaa kirane kamalixi feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Alatalaa falane tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Naxanye na e luxun a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">a ne kantanma nɛn alo wure lefana.<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Alatala nan keden Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">Nde en kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">ba en ma Ala ra?<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>A tan nan Ala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">naxan fangan fima n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">naxan n kantanma kira yi.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>A n sanne sɛnbɛ soma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">alo xɛnla, a n nate geyane fari.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>A bata n maxaran yɛngɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">nanara n nɔxi sulan xali xɔdɛxɛn bandunɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>I bata n yɛ masansan wure lefaan so n yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">i yi n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">I bata i yengi sa n xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">i ya maliin bata n nagbo.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>I kirani tɔn n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">alogo n nama bira.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Koni n biraxi n yaxune fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">n yi e suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">N mi xɛtɛ e fɔxɔ ra han e ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>N na e rabirama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">han e mi fa kelɛ sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">e yi bira n sanna bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>I sɛnbɛn soma n yii yɛngɛ so feen nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">i n yaxune sa n bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>I a liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">n yaxune yi e gi n bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">n bata ne kala naxanye yi n naɲaxuma.<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>E wugama nɛn malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">koni muxu yo mi e rakisɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">E Alatala xilima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">koni a mi e yabima.<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>N na e yilunburunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">alo gbangbanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">foyen sigama naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">N mɔn yi ti e fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">alo bɛndɛna kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>I bata n natanga yama murutɛxin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">i yi n findi siyane xunna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">N mi yi muxun naxanye kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">n bata nɔɔn sɔtɔ ne xun na.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Xɔɲɛne e xinbi sinma n bun ma iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">e na n fala xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">e yi a suxu.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>E yii xudin tuma ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">e fa xuruxurunɲɛ keli e yinne ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>Alatala na yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">Tantunna xa fi n natangamaan ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">N nakisimana Ala xa batu!<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>A tan Ala nan n gbeen ɲɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">naxan siyane luma n sɛnbɛn bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>A n natangama n yaxune ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">I tan nan n natexi n yaxune xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">i mɔn yi n xunba gbalotɔne yii.<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Nanara, n na i tantunma siyane tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">Alatala, n na i xinla tantunma nɛn bɛtini.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 18:51"/>Ala nɔ sɔtɔn nagidima a mangan ma han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:51">A a hinanna yita a muxu sugandixin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:51">Dawuda nun a yixɛtɛne habadan.<verse eid="PSA 18:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa nɔrɔn nun a sariyana</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Kore xɔnna nan Ala a nɔrɔn mayitama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">Koren nan Ala a wanla makɛnɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Yanyin kawandin bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">Dimin xaxili fima kɔɛ yo kɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>Xui yati mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">falane fan mi a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Tunla mi e xuiin mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>Koni, hali na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">e fala xuiin bɔxɔn birin lima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">e falane yi siga han dunuɲa danna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">Ala nan banxin nafalaxi sogen xa kore.<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Sogen minima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">alo xɛmɛn naxan minima a banxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">siga futu xidideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">alo fangamaan naxan sigan tima a yɛtɛna a kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>A minima sogetedeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">a sa ɲan sogegododeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">Sese mi luxunɲɛ a xɔlɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 19:7">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Alatalaa sariyan kamalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">a muxun nii yifanma a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">Ɲɔndin nan Alatalaa maxadi xuine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">E xaxilitarene findima xaxilimane ra.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Alatala fe ragidixine tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">A muxun bɔɲɛn nasɛwama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Alatalaa yamarine nɔrɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">A muxun xaxinla rabima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Alatala a yɛɛragaxun sariɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">A buma habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">Ɲɔndin nan Alatalaa kitine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">e tinxin feu!<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>E fisa xɛmaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">e fan xɛma faɲine birin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">E ɲaxun kumin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">dangu kumi xinden na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 19:11">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>I ya walikɛɛn xaxili sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">A tɔnɔn gbegbe sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Nde nɔɛ a yɛtɛna tantanne birin kolonɲɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">I xa n ma hakɛ luxunxine mafelu.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>N natanga tondin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">a nama n nɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Nayi, n findima muxu dɛfexin na nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">naxan mi matandi ɲaxin tiyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 19:15"/>Falan naxanye minima n dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">e nun miriyaan naxanye n bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">Alatala xa ne rasuxu sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">n kantan fanyena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">e nun n xunbamana.<verse eid="PSA 19:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa mangan baraka</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Alatala xa i yabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">i tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">Yaxubaa Ala xa i ratanga.<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Ala xa a maliin nagodo i ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">keli a yire sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">a xa i mali keli Siyon Geyaan fari.<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>Ala xa i ya kiseene birin nasuxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">a mɔn yi sɛwa i ya saraxa gan daxine birin na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 20:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>Ala xa i bɔɲɛn waxɔn feene so i yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">a mɔn yi i ya fe yitɔnxine birin nasabati.<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Nanara, nxu sɔnxɔɛ sɛwani i ya nɔ sɔtɔna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">En yi en gbee taxamaseri dugine rate Ala xinli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">Alatala xa tin i ya maxandin birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>N na a kolon yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">Alatalaa muxu sugandixin nakisima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">A a yabima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">keli a ariyanna sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">a yi a rakisi a sɛnbɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Ndee yigin sama e yɛngɛ so wontoroni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">bonne yi e yigin sa e soone yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">koni en tan yigin saxi Alatala xinla nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">en ma Ala.<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Na kanne tantanma nɛn e bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">koni en tan kelima nɛn, en ti ken!<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 20:10"/>Alatala xa mangan nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:10">I xa nxu yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:10">nxu na i maxandi waxatin naxan yi!<verse eid="PSA 20:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantunna mangan xɔn</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Alatala, mangan bata sɛwa i fangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">A sɛwan gbo bayo i bata a rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>A waxi naxan xɔn, i tinxi na ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">I bata a maxandin yabi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 21:3">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>I bata a rasɛnɛ duba faɲine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">i mɔn yi xɛma mangaya taxamasenna so a xun na.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>A maxɔdinna ti nɛn a siimayana fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">i yi sii xunkuyen so a yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">naxan luma habadan.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>A binyen bata gbo ayi fata i ya marakisin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">I nɔrɔn nun xunnayerenna fixi nɛn a ma.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>I a barakama habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">I a ralugoma sɛwan na i yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Bayo Mangan yigin saxi Alatala nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">a kantanxi Kore Xɔnna Ala hinanna nan baraka yi.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>I tan i yaxune birin suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">Naxanye i raɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">i ne suxuma nɛn i fangan na.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>I na mini kɛnɛnni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">i e ɲanma nɛn alo sulun tɛɛna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.10</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">Alatala xɔlɔxina e halagima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">tɛɛn yi e gan.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>I e yixɛtɛne raxɔrima nɛn dunuɲa yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">e nun e bɔnsɔnne adamadiine yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Hali e fe ɲaxini tɔn i xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">e mɔn yi e miri kɔtɛ ɲaxine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">e fulama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Bayo, i na i ya xalimakunle ti e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">e e xun xanbi soma nɛn, e yi e gi.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 21:14"/>Alatala xa batu a sɛnbɛ gbeena fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:14">Nxu bɛtin bama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:14">nxu yi i tantun i fangana fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 21:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s">Wugan nun tantunna</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “Xɔtɔnna Xɛli Gilɛna.”<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>N ma Ala! N ma Ala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">I n nabeɲinxi nanfera?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">Nanfera i ya marakisin makuyaxi n na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">Nanfera i mi n kutun xuiin namɛma?<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>N ma Ala, n ni i xilima yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">koni i mi n yabima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">Hali kɔɛɛn na, n mi n dundɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Koni i tan sariɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">i ya mangaya gbɛdɛn nabilinxi Isirayilaa tantunna ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Nxu benbane yigin saxi i tan nan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">E e yigin sa i yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">i yi e ratanga.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>E to e xui ramini i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">i yi e xɔrɔya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">E yigin saxi i yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">nanara, e mi yagixi.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Koni daɲɔxɔ mi fa n tan na sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">N ligaxi nɛn alo kunla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">adamadiin naxan naɲaxuxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">yamaan naxan bɔtɛ raba.<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>Naxanye na n to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">e yo n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">E yi e dɛɛn bɛtɛxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">e e xunne yimaxa.<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>E naxa, “A tan naxan Alatalaa fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">Alatala a ratangama ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">Xa a rafan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">a xa a xunba.”<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Koni i tan nan n naminixi nga kuini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">i yi n sa nga kanken ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Xabu n bari lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">n taxuxi i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">N ma Ala nan i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">xabu n yi nga kuini waxatin naxan yi han iki.<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>I nama i makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">Tɔrɔn bata maso n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">muxu yo mi na yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">naxan n maliyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>N yaxune n nabilinxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">alo turane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">alo Basan yamanan tura xaɲɛne.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>E dɛɛne yibixi alo yatane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">e wurundunma n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">e xa n yibɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>N fangan bata ɲan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">alo ige bɔxɔnxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">N xɔnne birin bata ba e bode ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">N bɔɲɛn bata liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">alo dolen na yilo.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>N fangan bata ɲan feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">N lɛnna xaraxin bata kankan n dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">I bata n sa faxa bɛndɛni.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Muxu ɲaxi ganla bata n nabilin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">alo barene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">E bata n yiine nun n sanne mabɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>N xɔnne birin kɛnɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">E yɛɛne kankanxi n na.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>E bata masɛnsɛnna ti n ma dugine fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">e xa e yitaxun e bode tagi.<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Alatala, i nama i makuya n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">N ma sɛnbɛmaan nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">N mali iki sa!<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>N niin xunba silanfanna yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">N natanga bareni itoe ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>N nakisi yatani itoe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">N nakisi burunna turaan fenne ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>N na i xinla ralima nɛn ngaxakedenne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">N ni i matɔxɔ nɛn yamaan yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Ɛ tan naxanye gaxu Alatala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">ɛ a matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Ɛ tan Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">ɛ a binya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Ɛ tan Isirayila kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">ɛ gaxu a yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>Bayo, a mi a mɛxi yiigelitɔne tɔrɔne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">a mi a rabeɲinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">A mi a yɛtagin luxunma a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">Fɔ a a xandi xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>N ni i tantunma yamaan malan gbeeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">N na n ma dɛ ti xuine rakamalima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">i yɛɛ ragaxu muxune yɛɛ xɔri.<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Yiigelitɔne xa e dɛge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">e lugo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">Naxanye Alatala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">ne xa a matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">Ala xa siimayaan fi ɛ ma habadan!<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>Bɔxɔn danna muxun birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">e xaxili luma nɛn Alatala xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">e yi e yɛɛ rafindi a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">Siyane bɔnsɔnne birin a batuma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Bayo, Alatala nan mangan na siyane xun na.<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Nafulu kanne fan fama nɛn e dɛgedeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">e a batu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">Naxanye birin xɛtɛma bɛndɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">ne xinbi sinma nɛn a bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">naxanye mi nɔɛ e niin nakisɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>Waxati famatɔɔn muxune walima a xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">Marigina a fe falama nɛn mamandenne xa.<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 22:32"/>A tinxinyaan fama nɛn nalideni muxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:32">naxanye munma bari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:32">Ala bata na ragidi.<verse eid="PSA 22:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala nan n kantanma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">Alatala n masuxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">alo xuruse rabana a xuruseene kantanma kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">Nanara, n mi dasɛ sese ra.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>A matabuden fi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">sɛxɛ ɲingi faɲin dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">A yi siga n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">ige xunbenla dɛxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>A bata n nii yifan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">A n xalima kira tinxinxin xɔn ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">a xinla fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Hali n so sayaan tilinna dimin xɔrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">n mi gaxuɛ sese yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">amasɔtɔ i tan Ala n xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">I ya gbengbetenna n nakantanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">i ya dunganna n gbɛngbɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>I bata donseen nafala n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">n yaxune yɛɛ xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">i yi n masuxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">alo xɔɲɛ binyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">i turen sa n xunni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">I bata n ma igelengenna rafe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">han a bɔxɔnɲɛ a ma.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Yati, i ya fanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">nun i ya hinanna birama n fɔxɔ ra nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">n siin sogen birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">N luma nɛn Alatalaa banxin kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">han n siin soge dɔnxɛna.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s">Manga binyena</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">Alatala nan gbee bɔxɔn nun ayi seene birin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">e nun dunuɲa nun muxun naxanye birin dɔxi a yi.<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Amasɔtɔ a tan nan bɔxɔn dɔxi igen tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">A yi a dɔxɔ igene fari.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Nde lan a te Alatala geyaan fari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Nde tiyɛ a yire sariɲanxini?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Naxanye sariɲan e kɛwanle nun e sɔndɔmɛne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">naxanye mi suxurene batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">xanamu naxanye mi e kɔlɔma wuleni,<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Alatala ne barakama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">Marakisi Tiina Ala yoon fima e ma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>Muxu sifani itoe nan Ala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">naxanye Yaxubaa Ala yɛtagin fenma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 24:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Yinna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">24.7</char> Ala Batu Banxin nabilinna <char style="fk">yinna</char> nan na ra.</note> dɛɛne xa rabi fefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">dɛ fonne xa rabi mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">nanara Manga Binyen soɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Nde Manga Binyeni ito ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Alatala na a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">fangamaan nun sɛnbɛmana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Alatala na a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">naxan sɛnbɛn gbo yɛngɛni.<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Yinna dɛɛne xa rabi fefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">dɛ fonne xa rabi mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">nanara Manga Binyen soɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Nde Manga Binyeni ito ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">a tan nan manga binyen na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 24:10">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s">Maxandina maratanga fena</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:1">Alatala, n bata i maxandi n niin birin na.<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>N ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">n yigin saxi i tan nan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">N nama yagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">I nama tin n yaxune yi n nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">e sɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Naxan na a xaxili ti i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">na kanna mi yarabima mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">Koni naxanye yanfan soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">ne yagin sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Alatala, kiraan yita n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">i xa n xaran i ya kiraan ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>N xa sigan ti i ya ɲɔndini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">n xaran.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">Amasɔtɔ n nakisima Ala nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">N xaxili tixi i ra fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Alatala, i xaxili lu i ya kininkininna nun hinanna xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">bayo e yi na xabu a fɔlɔni.<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>I nama i miri n ma foningeya yulubine nun matandine ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">N suxu i ya hinanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">amasɔtɔ i fan, Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Alatala fan, a mɔn tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">nanara a yulubi kanne xaranma a kirane ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Naxan a yɛtɛ magodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">a a sariyan nabirama na ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">A mɔn a xaranma a sagoon na nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Naxanye a layirin maxadine suxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">Alatala hinan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">a mɔn lannayaan nabama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">ne nan xa kiin birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Alatala, n hakɛne mafelu i xinla a fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">amasɔtɔ a gbo.<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Nde gaxuma Alatala yɛɛ ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">A kiraan yitama na kanna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">a lan a xa sigan ti naxan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Na kanna sabatima nɛn a siimayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">bɔxɔn yi findi a diine kɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Alatala a wundone makɛnɛnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">a yɛɛ ragaxu muxune xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">A a layirin yitama e ra nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>N yɛɛn tixi Alatala ra waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">bayo a tan nan n natangama suxu yalaan ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Ala, yandi, kininkinin n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">amasɔtɔ n kedenna na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">n tɔrɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Nii yifɔrɛn bata n yili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">n namini na tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>I miri n ma tɔrɔne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">nun n ma sɔxɔlɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">i yi n ma yulubine xafari.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>A mato, n yaxune wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">e n naɲaxuxi kati!<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>N niin nakantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">i yi n xunba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">N nama yarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">amasɔtɔ n bata n luxun i yi.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>N ma fɛtareyaan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">nun tinxinyaan xa n kantan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">amasɔtɔ n xaxili tixi i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Ala, i xa Isirayila xunba a tɔrɔne birin yii!<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s">Sɔntarena Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">Alatala, n ma kitin sa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">amasɔtɔ fɛ yo mi n kɛwanle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">n yigin mɔn i yi feu!<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Alatala, n fɛsɛfɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">i yi n mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">n sɔndɔmɛn nun bɔɲɛn nakɔrɔsi.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>I ya hinanna n yi waxatin birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">n sigan tima i ya lannayani!<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>N tan mi n magodɛ fuyantenne fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">nxu nun nafigine mi fe kedenni.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Fe ɲaxi raba yamaan mi rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">N mi dɔxɛ muxu ɲaxine fɛma.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Alatala, n bata n yiin naxa sɔntareyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">n yi so i batudeni,<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>n barikan bira i xa n xui yitexin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">n yi i ya kabanako feene fala.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Alatala, i ya banxin nafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">i nɔrɔn dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>I nama nxu nun hakɛ kanne faxa nxu bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">i nama nxu nun faxa tiine raɲanna findi kedenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>Na muxune fe ɲaxin ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">e dimi yi seene rasuxu mayifuni.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Koni, n tan, fɛ yo mi n kɛwanle ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">N xunba, i diɲa n ma!<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>N tixi tinxinni ken!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">N na Alatala tantunma nɛn a yama gbeeni.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s">Marakisi Tiina Alatala</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Alatala nan n ma kɛnɛnna nun n ma kisin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">N xa gaxu mundun yɛɛ ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Alatala nan n ma dunuɲa yi gidin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">xun mayɛngɛ muxun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Nde n magaxuɛ?<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Muxu ɲaxine na keli n xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">alogo e xa n halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">yaxune na n yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">e tan nan dagalanma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">e bira.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Hali sofa ganla na n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">n bɔɲɛn susuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">Hali yɛngɛ gbeen na keli n xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">n yigin tixi.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>N bata Alatala maxɔdin fe keden ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">N fe keden peen nan fenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">N lu Alatalaa banxin kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">han n siin soge danna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">N Alatala wali faɲin kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">n yi lu a batuɛ a banxini.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Amasɔtɔ a n namarɛ nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">a banxini tɔrɔ waxatini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">A n luxunɲɛ nɛn a Batu Banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">A n natema nɛn geyaan xuntagi.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>A xunna kenla fima n ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">n yaxune tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">N saraxane bama nɛn Ala Batu Banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">n sɔnxɔ sɛwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">N bɛtin bama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">n na Alatala tantun.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Alatala, i tuli mati n xuiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">n na i xili waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">Kininkinin n ma, i yi n yabi!<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>N bɔɲɛn waxi i fen feni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Alatala, n ni i fenma,<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>i nama i yɛtagi luxun n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">I nama i ya walikɛɛn kedi xɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">I bata findi n mali muxun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">I nama n nabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">i nama i mɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">n nakisimana Ala.<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Hali nga nun n fafe n nabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">Alatala n yisuxuma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Alatala, n xaran sigati kiin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">Ti n yɛɛ ra kira faɲin xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">amasɔtɔ n yaxune wuya.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>I nama n so n yaxune yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">amasɔtɔ wule serene bata keli n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">e e kɔnkɔma n ma.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>N mɔn laxi ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">n na Alatalaa nɛmaan toma nɛn dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>I xaxili ti Alatala ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">I sɛnbɛ so! I bɔɲɛn xa limaniya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">I xaxili ti Alatala ra!<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Alatala n ma fanyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">n bata i xili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">I tuli mati n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Xa i mi n yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">n sama laxira faxa muxune fari nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>N ma mayandi xuiin mɛ malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">n bata n yiini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">i Batu Banxin yire sariɲanxin mabinni.<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>I nama nxu nun muxu ɲaxine yalagi nxu bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">fe ɲaxi rabane naxanye fala faɲine tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">koni maraɲaxuna e bɔɲɛne yi.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>E kɛwanle saranna fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">e nun e wali ɲaxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">e bata naxanye liga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">A liga e ra naxan lan e kɛwanle ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">E lan e xa naxan sɔtɔ, na so e yii!<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>E xaxili mi luxi Alatalaa wanle xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">hanma a yiine bata naxan da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">Nanara, a e kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">a e ɲan habadan.<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Barikan bira Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">a bata n ma mayandi xuiin mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Alatala nan n sɛnbɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">A n xun mayɛngɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">alo wure lefana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">N yigin saxi a fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">bayo a n malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Nanara, n bɔɲɛn bata rafe sɛwan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">N na a tantunma nɛn bɛtine yi.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Alatala nan a yamaan sɛnbɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">e nun yigiya kantanxina a muxu sugandixin xa.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>I ya yamaan nakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">i mɔn yi e baraka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">Findi e gbɛngbɛn muxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">i yi i yengi dɔxɔ e xɔn ma habadan!<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">Ɛ tan malekane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">ɛ fa Alatala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">ɛ a tantun a binyen nun a sɛnbɛna fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Ɛ binyen fi Alatala ma a xinla fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">ɛ Alatala batu a nɔrɔ sariɲanxini.<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Alatala xuiin mɛma fɔxɔ igene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Ala binye kanna sarinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Alatala a xuiin nasigama ige gbeene xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Alatala xuiin sɛnbɛn gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">Alatala xuiin nɔrɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Alatala xuiin suman binle yigirama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">hali suman wudin naxanye Liban yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>Ala Liban geyane ratuganma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">alo ɲinge diina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">e nun Siriyon geyana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">alo burunna ɲingena.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Alatala xuiin sigama ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:7">alo kuye sarinna.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Alatala xuiin tonbon yirene yimaxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">a Kadesi tonbonni maxa.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Xɛnle diin xalima Alatala xuiin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">a mɔn yi warine dɛɛne rayolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">yamaan birin sɔnxɔma a Batu Banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">e naxa, “Binyen xa fi a ma!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Alatala dɔxi fufane xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">A mangayaan na habadan!<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Alatala nan sɛnbɛn fima a yamaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">a bɔɲɛ xunbeli barakan sa e yi.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s">Barika birana Ala xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina. Sigi sariɲanxina. Batu Banxin nasariɲan bɛtina.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Alatala, n ni i batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">amasɔtɔ i bata n yite.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">I mi tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">n yaxune yi e xunnayeren n xun na.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Alatala n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">n ni i mafan nɛn malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">i yi n nakɛndɛya.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Alatala i n niin masiga nɛn laxira ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">i n faxamatɔɔn nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>Alatalaa tɔgɔndiya muxune birin xa bɛtin ba a xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">Ɛ a matɔxɔ a wali sariɲanxine fe ra!<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Bayo, a xɔlɔn mi xunkuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">koni a marafanna luma nɛn muxun siin sogen birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">Wuga xuiin minima nɛn kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">koni sɛwan fama nɛn xɔtɔnni.<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>N yi laxi n ma hɛrin na waxatin naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">n naxa, “Sese mi n yimaxɛ!”<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>Alatala, n to yi i ya xanuntenyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">i n lu nɛn fangani alo geyana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">Koni i to i yɛtagin luxun n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">na yi n kɔntɔfili.<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>N yi i tan Alatala xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">n yi Marigin mafan,<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>n naxa, “N na faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">i tɔnɔn mundun sɔtɔma nayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">N na sa gaburun kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">tɔnɔn mundun na ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Faxa muxune nɔɛ i tantunɲɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">E nɔɛ i ya lannayaan matɔxɛ ba?<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Alatala, i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">i kininkinin n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">Alatala, n mali!”<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>I bata n ma nimisan maxɛtɛ sɛwan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">I n makininkininna ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">i yi n nabilin sɛwan na.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 30:13"/>Nanara, n mi n dundɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:13">n bɛtin bama i xa nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:13">Alatala n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:13">n barikan birama i xa nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 30:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yigi sa fena Ala fari</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 71.1-3</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>Alatala, n bata n luxun i yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">I nama tin n yi yarabi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">N natanga i ya tinxinyana fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>I tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">i yi n xunba iki sa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">Findi n yigiya gɛmɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">e nun n makantan yinna.<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>N ma gɛmɛ gbeen nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">n ma yinna nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">Ti n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">i yi n maxaran i xinla a fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>N natanga na luti ratixin ma n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">bayo i tan nan n xun mayɛngɛma.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>N bata n niin so i yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">n xunba Alatala, lannaya Ala.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>N bata ne raɲaxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">naxanye suxure fufafune batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">koni n tan yigin saxi Alatala nan fari.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>N sɛwama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">n ɲaxan i ya hinanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">bayo, i bata n ma tɔrɔne to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">i n sɔndɔmɛna sɔxɔlɛn kolon.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>I mi n soxi n yaxune yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">koni i n xɔrɔyaxi nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Alatala, kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">amasɔtɔ n tɔrɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">N bata xadan wugɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Sunun bata n niin nun n fatin natagan.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Sunun bata n ma dunuɲa yi gidin ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">wugan yi nde ba n siin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">N fangan bata ɲan n yi n ma tɔrɔne fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">N xɔnne bata yelefu ayi.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>N yaxune birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">katarabi n dɔxɔ bodene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">ne n nayarabima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">N xɔyine bata gaxu n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">e na n to kiraan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">e e gi n yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>E birin bata ɲinan n xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">alo n faxaxin na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">N bata lu alo fɛɲɛ kalaxina.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>N bata yaxu wuyaxi kɔyɛkɔyɛn xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">gbalona n nabilinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">E feene yitɔnma lan n faxa feen ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Alatala, n tan yigin saxi i tan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">n naxa, “I tan nan n ma Ala ra.”<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>N ma waxatine i sagoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">N natanga n yaxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">naxanye n bɛsɛnxɔnyama.<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>I nɔrɔn xa godo i ya walikɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">n nakisi i ya hinanni.<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Alatala, n bata n xui ramini i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">i nama tin n yi rayarabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">Ala xa muxu ɲaxine yarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">Ala xa e dunduxin nagodo laxira yi.<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Na wule xɛlɛne radundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">na wasode yandaxine birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">naxanye fala ɲaxin tima tinxin muxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>I ya nɛmaan makabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">i bata naxan namara i yɛɛragaxu muxune xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">Muxun birin yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">i ya fanna fima ne ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">naxanye luxunxi i yi.<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>I bata e yigiya i fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">i e kantanma muxune fe yitɔnxine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">I bata e ratanga wule xɛlɛne ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Barikan bira Alatala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">N yi rabilinxi yaxune ra waxatin naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">n yɛngɛ xinla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">a yi a hinanna yita n na.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>N ma gaxuni, n yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">n naxa, “I bata n kedi i yɛtagi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Koni n to n xuiin namini i ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">i yi n ma mayandi xuiin mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Ɛ tan tɔgɔndiya muxune birin xa Alatala xanu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">Alatala dɛnkɛlɛya muxune ratangama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">koni a yandadene sare fima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">alo a lan kiinde.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 31:25"/>Ɛ tan naxanye birin yigi saxi Alatala fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:25">ɛ sɛnbɛn so, ɛ bɔɲɛ ragidi.<verse eid="PSA 31:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s">Yulubi xafari fena</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Dawudaa fala ɲaxumɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">Sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">naxan ma matandine bata mafelu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">naxan yulubine bata xafari.<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Sɛwan na adaman xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">Alatala bata diɲa naxan hakɛn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">e nun mayifu mi naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>N to munma yi n ti n hakɛne ra nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">fɛriɲɛn gbɛn kutunne yi n nayelefuma.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>I ya tɔrɔn yi n fari kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">Fangan yi ɲan n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">a liga alo n tonbon yiren nin.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Awa, n yi n ti n yulubine ra i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">N mi n ma hakɛ yo luxun i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">N naxa, “N na n tima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">n ma matandine ra Alatala xa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Awa, i yi n hakɛne nun yulubine birin ba n ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>Nanara, muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine birin xa i mafan a waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">alogo fufaan na fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">a nama e li.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>N luxunden nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">I tan nan n natangama tɔrɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">yamaan birin yi xɔrɔya bɛtine ba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:7">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>Nanara, n na ɛ xaranma kiraan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">ɛ birɛ naxan fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">N na ɛ kawandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">n yi n yengi sa ɛ xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>I nama findi daxun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">alo soona hanma sofanla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">naxanye mi sigɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">fɔ karafen na bira e ma.<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Muxu ɲaxine tɔrɔn gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">Koni naxanye e yigi saxi Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">a ne rabilinma nɛn hinanna ra.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Ɛ tan tinxin muxune xa ɲaxan Alatala a fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">ɛ sɛwa, ɛ bɛtin ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">ɛ tan muxu sɔndɔmɛ faɲine.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Ɛ bɛtin ba sɛwani Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">ɛ tan naxanye tinxin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">Muxu faɲine lan e xa a tantun.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Ɛ barikan bira Alatala xa bɔlɔnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">ɛ barikan bira a xa kondenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Ɛ bɛti nɛnɛn ba a xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">Ɛ maxa seene maxa ki faɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">ɛ yi ɛ xuini te a ma.<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>Ɲɔndin nan Alatalaa falan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">A kɛwanle birin kamalima tinxinna nin.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Tinxinyaan nun sariya suxun nafan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">dunuɲa birin wasaxi a hinanna ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Alatala kore xɔnna daxi a fala xuiin barakan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">e nun yanban seene a dɛ xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>A fɔxɔ igene birin malanma yire kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">a fufane ramara.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Bɔxɔn birin xa gaxu Alatala yɛɛ ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">Dunuɲa muxune birin xa a binya!<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>A falan nan tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">dunuɲa yi da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">A yamarin fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">seen birin yi taran na.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Alatala siyane natane kalama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">A mi tinɲɛ siyane yi e miriyane rawali.<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Koni Alatalaa fe ragidixine luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">A miriyane yi lu habadan!<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Sɛwan na siyaan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">naxan ma Ala findixi Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">Sɛwan na muxune xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">Alatala bata naxanye sugandi!<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Alatala a yɛɛ ragodoma keli ariyanna yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">a muxune birin mato.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>Keli a mangaya yireni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">a dunuɲa muxune birin xun mato a ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>A e sɔndɔmɛne rafixa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">a a xaxili lu e kɛwanle birin xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Manga yo mi kisɛ a ganla sɛnbɛn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">Sofa yo mi ratangɛ a fangan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Xunba se mi soon na yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">a fangan na gbo ki yo ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">a mi marakisin tiyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Koni Alatala yɛɛn tixi a yɛɛragaxu muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">naxanye e xaxili tixi a hinanna ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>A ne rakisima sayaan ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">a mɔn yi e niine rakisi fitina kamɛn ma.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>En xaxili tixi Alatala nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">A tan nan en mali muxun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">e nun en yɛ masansan wure lefana.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>En bɔɲɛne sɛwaxi a tan nan ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">bayo en bata en yigi sa a xili sariɲanxini.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Alatala, i ya hinanna xa lu nxu xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">bayo nxu nxu yigi saxi i tan nin.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s">Ala fan</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Dawuda gbeena. A to a yɛtɛ findi fatɔɔn na Abimeleki fɛma, naxan a kedi.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>N barikan birama Alatala xa waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">n lu a tantunɲɛ!<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>N na Alatala matɔxɔma n sɔndɔmɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">Tɔrɔ muxune yi a mɛ, e ɲaxan.<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>En xa Alatala gbona fe fala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">En na a xinli te en bode xɔn!<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>N bata Alatala xandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">a yi n yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">a gaxun birin ba n yi.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Naxanye yɛɛn tixi a tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">ne sɛwama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">e mi yarabɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>N tan yiigelitɔna n xui ramini nɛn Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">a yi n xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">a yi n nakisi gbalon ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Alatalaa malekana a yɛɛragaxu muxune rabilinma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">a yi e kantan.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">i a kolonɲɛ a Alatala fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">Sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">naxan na a luxun i tan yi.<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>Ɛ gaxu Alatala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">ɛ tan a yama sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">bayo naxan na gaxu a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">na makoon fanma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Hali yatane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">kamɛna e suxuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">koni naxanye Alatala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">ne mi dasɛ se faɲi yo ra.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>N ma diidine, ɛ fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">ɛ fa ɛ tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">N xa ɛ xaran Alatala yɛɛragaxun ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>Ndee waxi siimayaan xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">Ndee waxi siimaya xunkuyen nun sɛwan xɔn?<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>Nayi, ɛ fala ɲaxine yiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">e nun wulena.<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Ɛ ɛ xun xanbi so fe ɲaxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">ɛ fe faɲin liga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">Ɛ bɔɲɛ xunbenla fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">ɛ lu a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>Alatala yɛɛn muxu tinxinxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">a tuli matixi e xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Alatala xun xanbi soxi fe ɲaxi rabane yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">E na faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">ɲinan tima e xɔn nɛn sinma!<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Tinxin muxune na e mawuga Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">a tuli matima e ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">a e xunba e tɔrɔne birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Alatala luma nɛn ne xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">naxanye bɔɲɛn kalaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">A yigitɛgɛtɔne rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Tɔrɔ wuyaxi tinxin muxun lima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">koni Alatala a bama nɛn e birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Ala a xɔnne birin kantanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">hali keden, a mi girɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Fe ɲaxin nan muxu ɲaxin faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">Tinxin muxune yaxune yalagima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 34:23"/>Alatala a walikɛne niin xunbama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:23">Naxan na a luxun a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:23">na mi yalagɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 34:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">Alatala, n kiti muxun makiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">I n yɛngɛfaan yɛngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Keli, i ya wure lefane tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">i fa n mali.<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>I ya tanban nun bunbini te ne xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">naxanye n fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">A fala n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">a i tan nan n nakisima.<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Ala xa ne rayagi a e rayarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">naxanye katama n faxa feen na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Naxanye fe ɲaxine yitɔnma n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Ala xa ne yɛ yifu a e raxɛtɛ!<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>E xa liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">alo foyen sigama se dagin naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">Alatalaa malekan xa e kedi.<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Ala xa e kirani fɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">a salaxunɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">Alatalaa malekan yi e sagatan.<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>E lutin natixi nɛn n yɛɛ ra fuu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">E yili ratilinxin ge n suxu feen na.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Nanara, e xa e tɛrɛna halagin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">e suxu e luti ratixin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">e bira, e faxa.<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Nayi, n niin sɛwama nɛn Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">N ɲaxan a marakisina fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>N na falɛ n bɔɲɛn ma feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">N naxa, “Muxu yo mi luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">alo i tan Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">I yiigelitɔne ratangama fanga kanne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">I tɔrɔ muxune ratanga ne ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">naxanye e yigbɛtɛnxi.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Muxu ɲaxine n kansunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">E sɔnne sama n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">n mi naxanye fe kolon mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>E n ma fanna ɲɔxɔ a ɲaxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">N yifuxin yi lu.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Koni e yi furaxi waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">n yi n maxidima sunun nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">N yi n yɛtɛ magodo sun suxuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">N ma maxandi xuiin to mi yabi,<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>n sunuxin yi lu e fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">alo n xɔyina hanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">alo ngaxakedenna nan yi e ra nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">N xun sinxin yi lu nimisani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">alo n nga nan yi a ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Koni tɔrɔn to n tan li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">e birin yi ɲaxan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">E e malan n xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">N yɛngɛfane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">n mi yi naxanye kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">ne yi lu n tɔrɛ tun!<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>E n naɲaxu, e n magele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">E e ɲinne raxinma n xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Marigina, i yɛɛn sama e xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">han waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">N niin natanga e yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">i n nakisi yatani itoe ma!<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Nayi, n barikan birama nɛn i xa yamani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">N ni i matɔxɔ e birin yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>I nama tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">n yaxu wuledene yi ɲaxan n ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">Naxanye n naɲaxuxi fuuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">ne nama gele n ma.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>E mi ngaxakedenya fala tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">fɔ e yi bɔɲɛ xunbelitɔne kansun wulen na.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>E feene falama n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">e sɔnxɔ, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">“Yɔ! I naxan ligaxi nxu bata a to!”<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Alatala, i tan bata ne to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">nayi, i nama i dundu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">Marigina, i nama i makuya n na!<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Marigina, keli, i yi n xun mayɛngɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">N ma Ala, n ma yɛngɛn so.<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Alatala n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">yoon fi n ma bayo i tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">I nama tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">n yaxune yi ɲaxan n ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>I nama tin e yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">“Yɔ! Nxu bata a manɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">Nxu yi waxi na nan tun xɔn ma!”<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Muxun naxanye sɛwama n tɔrɔ feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Ala xa ne rayagi, a e yifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Ala xa ne rayagi, a yi e rayarabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">naxanye e yɛtɛ yitema n ma.<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Naxanye waxi n xɔrɔyaxin to feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">ne xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">e naxa, “Alatala gbo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">A bata sɛwa a walikɛna yɛɛ ra sigan na.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Nayi, n ni i ya tinxinyana fe falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">n yi i tantun fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s">Muxu ɲaxina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Alatalaa walikɛɛn Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Yulubin falan tima muxu ɲaxin xa a bɔɲɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">A mi gaxuma Ala yɛɛ ra mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Bayo a lugoxi a yɛtɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">a mi nɔɛ a yulubine kolonɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">a a mɛ e ra.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>A falane ɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">wulen nan gbansan e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">A mi fa xaxilimaya feeye rabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">A mi fe faɲi ligama.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>A nɛma saxi a saden ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">a fe ɲaxine mirima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">a kira kobine natama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">a mi a mɛma fe ɲaxi yo ra.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Alatala, i ya hinanna gbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">han ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">i ya lannayaan gbo han kore.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>I ya tinxinna gbo alo geyane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">I ya kiti sa kiin tilin alo fɔxɔ igena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">Daɲɔxɔne nun subene i tan nan yii, Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Ala, i ya hinanna kɛndɛ han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">Adamadiine birin luxunden sɔtɔma nɛn i yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">alo tɔxɛ diine e nga gabutɛne bun kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>E lugoma i ya donse gbeen nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">E e min i ya fanni alo xudena.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Niin binla i tan nan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">Nxu bata kɛnɛnna to i ya kɛnɛnna xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>I xa hinan ne ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">naxanye i kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">I ya tinxinyaan yita sɔndɔmɛ faɲi kanne ra.<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>I nama tin yandadene yi n yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">hanma muxu ɲaxine yi n kedi.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 36:13"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:13">fe ɲaxi rabane bata bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:13">E saxi, e mi nɔɛ kelɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s">Muxu ɲaxin nun muxu faɲin kɔntɔnna</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">I nama xamin muxu ɲaxine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">I nama i sa fe ɲaxi rabane ma.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>E tununma nɛn xulɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">alo sɛxɛ xarena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">E faxama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">alo si seen naxan bata lisi a ra.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>I yigin sa Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">i yi fe faɲin naba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">Nayi, i luyɛ yamanani nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">i yi sabati bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>I xa sɛwa Alatala yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">nanara a i bɔɲɛn waxɔn feene ligɛ i xa.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>Bira Alatalaa kiraan nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">I yigin sa a yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">Nanara a i maliyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>I ya tinxinyaan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">nun sariya suxun makɛnɛnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">a tan barakani alo yanyi tagi sogena.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>I xa diɲa, i Alatala legeden.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">I nama xamin na muxune ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">naxanye sabatima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">naxanye e fe yitɔnxine rasɔnɔyama a ɲaxin na.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>I nama xɔlɔ, i nama fitina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">i nama xamin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">Ne i birama tɔrɔni nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Muxu ɲaxine ɲanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">koni naxanye e yigin sama Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">bɔxɔn luma ne nan xa.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>A mi buma muxu ɲaxine yi tunun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">Ɛ ɛ yɛɛ rakoɲinma e ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">koni ɛ mi e toɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Naxanye limaniyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">bɔxɔn luma ne xa nɛn, e yi sabati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">e bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Muxu ɲaxin fe ɲaxin nan yitɔnma tinxin muxun xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">a a ɲinne raxin a xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Koni Marigin gelema muxu ɲaxine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">amasɔtɔ a a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">e fitina lɔxɔn mi fa buma.<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Muxu ɲaxine bata e silanfanne botin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">e e xanle ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">e xa yiigelitɔne nun tɔrɔ muxune yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">e xa muxu faɲine faxa.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Koni, e sɔxɔnma e gbee silanfanne nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">E xanle yi gira.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Se xurin naxan tinxin muxun yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">na fisa muxu ɲaxine bannayaan xa.<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>Amasɔtɔ muxu ɲaxine sɛnbɛn kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">koni Alatala tinxin muxune ratangama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Alatala yengi dɔxi sɔntarene xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">E kɛɛn luma nɛn habadan.<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>E mi tɔrɛ waxati xɔdɛxɛne yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">Fitina kamɛn na so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">e tan lugoma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Koni muxu ɲaxine faxama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">Alatala yaxune yi tunun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">alo xɛɛn fugene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">E lɔma ayi nɛn alo tutina.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Muxu ɲaxin donla tongoma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">a mi a fiyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">Koni tinxin muxun kiin tima fonisireyaan nin.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Ala naxanye barakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">bɔxɔn luma ne xa nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">Koni a naxanye dangama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">ne ɲanma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Alatala nan muxun sigati kiin nagidima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">a lu na kiraan xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">naxan nafan a ma.<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Xa a dagalanɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">a mi birɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">amasɔtɔ Alatala a malima.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Dii mɛsɛn nan yi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">koni iki n bata fori.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">N siin bata waxati xunkuye sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">Koni n munma tinxin muxun nabeɲinxin to singen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">hanma a diine yi donseen maxandi.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>A kiin tima fonisireyaan nan na waxatin birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">a mɔn bonne dolima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">Dubana a diine xa.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Ɛ xun xanbi so fe ɲaxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">ɛ fe faɲin naba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">nanara i mamandenne luyɛ bɔxɔn ma habadan!<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Amasɔtɔ sariya suxun nafan Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">A mi a muxu tɔgɔndiyaxin nabeɲinɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">A a kantanma nɛn habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">Koni muxu ɲaxine mamandenne tan ɲanma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Tinxin muxune bɔxɔn sɔtɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">alo kɛɛna, e lu na yi habadan.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Tinxin muxun xaxilimaya falane nan tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">Sariyan nan a falan na.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>A Alaa sariyan namarama a bɔɲɛni nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">A mi tantanma a fe yi mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Muxu ɲaxin tinxin muxun legedenma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:32">a faxa feen nan na.<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Koni Alatala mi a luyɛ a yaxune sɛnbɛn bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">A mi tinɲɛ a yalagi feen ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">a na kiti waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Ɛ ɛ xaxili ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">ɛ yi lu a kiraan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">A ɛ yitema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">a yamanan so ɛ yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">Ɛ a toma nɛn nayi muxu ɲaxine bata ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>N yi muxu ɲaxina nde kolon nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">gbalotɔɔn nan yi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">naxan bata yi sabati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">alo wudi gbeena.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Koni a danguxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">a lɔ ayi feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">N yi a fen, koni n mi a to.<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>I xaxili lu sɔntaren xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">I yɛɛn sa muxu faɲin xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">Bɔɲɛ xunbelitɔɔn mayixɛtɛne sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Koni yulubi kanne kalama nɛn feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">E bɔnsɔnna birin yi raxɔri.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Alatala tinxin muxune rakisima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">E yigiya makantanxin nan a tan na tɔrɔ waxatine yi.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Alatala e malima nɛn a e ratanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">A e ratanga muxu ɲaxine ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">a e rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">amasɔtɔ e luxunxi a yi.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔ muxuna maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina. Maxandina.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Alatala, i nama n maxadi xɔlɔni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">I nama fitina n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">i n ɲaxankata.<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>I bata n maxɔlɔ i ya xalimakunla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">I yi n nabira.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Kɛndɛya mi fa n fatini i ya xɔlɔna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">N gbindin mi yalan n yulubina fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>N hakɛne bata gbo ayi n xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">han a radangu ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">alo goronna naxan binya n mi a nɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>N ma korone bata kun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">e xirin yi mini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">Amasɔtɔ daxun nan yi n na nun.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>N bɔɲɛn bata kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">han n yi n xun sin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">N lu wugɛ n bɔɲɛni fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>N fatin birin wolonxi n ma kati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">Kɛndɛya yo mi fa n fatini.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>N bata yelefu bɔxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">n bata kala feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">N bɔɲɛn tɔrɔxi, n kutunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">amasɔtɔ n sɔxɔlɛxi.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Marigina, n naxan fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">i na kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">I bata n kutun xuiin birin mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>N bɔɲɛn dinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">n fangan bata ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">N yɛtagin bata yitɔɲɔn.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>N xɔyine nun n dɔxɔ bodene mi fa fama n fɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">amasɔtɔ n ma furen xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">Hali n kon kaane bata e makuya n na.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Naxanye waxi n faxa feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">ne bata lutin nati n yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">Naxanye waxi n maxɔlɔ feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">ne n kala feen falama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">E mi xadanma fe ɲaxi yitɔndeni.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>N bata liga alo tuli xɔrina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">n mi fe mɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">N bata liga alo bobona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">n mi fala tima.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>N bata liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">alo muxun naxan mi yabin tiyɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">amasɔtɔ a mi fe mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Koni Alatala, n xaxili tixi i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">I n yabima nɛn, Marigina n ma Ala.<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>N naxa, “I nama tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">n yaxune yi e xunnayeren n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">e nama ɲaxan n ma tɔrɔn na.”<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>N biramatɔɔn na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">N xɔlɛni waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>N bata n ti n hakɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">n yulubine bata n naxamin kati!<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>N yaxune tan kɛndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">e yixɔdɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">E wuya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">naxanye n naɲaxuxi fuu!<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Naxanye fe faɲin saranma fe ɲaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">ne n tɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">amasɔtɔ n tan a faɲin nan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Alatala, i nama n nabeɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">N ma Ala, i nama i makuya n na.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 38:23"/>N Marigina, n nakisimana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:23">n mali iki sa!<verse eid="PSA 38:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔ muxun ti fena a hakɛn na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa, Yedutun xa.<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>N bata a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">“N na n kɛwanle rakɔrɔsima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">alogo n dɛ xuiin nama n bira yulubini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">N mi fa fala yo tiyɛ muxu ɲaxine yɛɛ xɔri.”<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>N yi n dundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">n yi n naxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">n mi yi fala yo tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">hali fe faɲina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">koni n ma sɔxɔlɛn yi siga fari sɛ tun!<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>N bɔɲɛn yi wolon n kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">N to yi n mirima a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">a yi n kuiin gan fɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">alo tɛɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">N yi falan ti fɔlɔ, n naxa,<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>“Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">n siin soge dɔnxɛn yita n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">e nun a yatɛ saxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">I xa n nakolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">a n ma siimayaan mi buma.”<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>I tan nan n ma lɔxɔne yatɛn nadungixi ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">Sese mi n siin waxatin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">i yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">Adamadiin birin buma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">alo foyedin gbansan!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 39:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>Nininna nan gbansan a tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Muxuna a masigama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">a feen ligama koni fuyan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">A nafunla malanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">koni naxan a sɔtɛ a xanbi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">a mi na kolon.<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Marigina, n fa n xaxili tima nanse ra nayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">N na n yigin sama i tan nan yi.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>N nakisi n yulubin birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">I nama tin daxune yi gele n ma.<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>N yi dunduxi nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">N mi yi fala yo tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">Amasɔtɔ i tan nan ito ligaxi n na.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>I ya furen ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">benun i xa n naɲan tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>I muxun maxadima a hakɛna fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">i yi a hakɛn saran a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">I muxuna nafunle kalama alo xiine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Adamadi yɛtɛɛn ligaxi nɛn alo foyedina.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 39:12">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Alatala, n ma maxandi xuiin mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">I yi i tuli mati n ma mawuga xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">N na wuga, i nama i dundu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">I ya xɔɲɛn nan tun n tan na sigatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">alo n benbane yi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 39:14"/>N yiba singen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:14">alogo n xa sɛwa benun n xa dangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:14">benun n xa faxa.<verse eid="PSA 39:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun Bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>N diɲa nɛn Alatala maliin legedendeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">a yi a tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">a yi n ma mawuga xuiin mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>A n ba yili ɲaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">a n ba boron nun bɛndɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">A yi n ti fanyen fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">a san tide faɲin fi n ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>A yi n xaran bɛti nɛnɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">n na en ma Ala tantunma naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">Muxu wuyaxi na toma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">e yi gaxu a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">e mɔn yi e yigin sa Alatala yi.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Sɛwan na kanna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naxan na a yigi sa Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naxan mi kidene batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naxan mi a sama suxure batune ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>I ya wali faɲine wuya ayi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">Alatala, n ma Ala, i ɲɔxɔn mi na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">I bata kabanako fe wuyaxi yitɔn nxu xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">N mi nɔɛ e fe falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">e yatɛn bata gbo ayi!<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>I mi waxi saraxan nun kiseen xɔn gbansan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">fɔ i n tunle raba ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">I mi yi saraxa gan daxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">nun yulubi xafari saraxane gbansan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>Nanara, n naxa, “N tan ni i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">N bata fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">N ma fe sɛbɛxi Kitabuni.<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>N ma Ala, i sagoon nafan n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">I ya sariyan namaraxi n bɔɲɛni.”<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>N tinxinyaan nalima nɛn i ya yamani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">Alatala, i a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">n mi n dundɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>N mi i ya tinxinyaan namaraxi n kedenna xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">N ni i ya ɲɔndin nun marakisina fe falama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">N mi i ya hinanna nun i ya lannayaan luxunɲɛ yamaan ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>I nama tondi kininkininɲɛ n ma, Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">I ya hinanna nun lannayana n marama nɛn waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 70</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Amasɔtɔ, n ma tɔrɔne bata wuya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">han e mi yatɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">N hakɛne bata n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">n mi fa se toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">E wuya dangu n xunsɛxɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">Bɔɲɛ yixɔdɛxɛ mi fa n yi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Yandi, Alatala, n nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">Alatala, fa n mali iki sa!<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Ala xa ne yarabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">naxanye katama n faxa feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">a e yɛ yifu fefe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">Ala xa ne raxɛtɛ marafɛyani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">n ma tɔrɔyaan nafanxi naxanye ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Ala xa ne ratɛrɛna e yagin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">naxanye a falama n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">e naxa, “Yɔ! I suxi yati!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Naxanye birin i tan fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">i xa ne birin nasɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">I ya kisin xɔnla naxanye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">ne xa lu a falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">e naxa, “Alatala gbo!”<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 40:18"/>Koni, yiigelitɔɔn nun tɔrɔ muxun nan n tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">N Marigin nama ɲinan n xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">I tan nan n maliin nun n ma maratanga tiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">Ala, i nama buyɛ ayi.<verse eid="PSA 40:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s">Furetɔna Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">naxan yengi dɔxi sɛnbɛtarene xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Alatala na kanna xunbama tɔrɔ waxatine yi nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Alatala a ratangama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">a a niin nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">A a barakama nɛn bɔxɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">A mi a luyɛ a yaxune sɛnbɛn bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Alatala a malima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">furen na a li waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">a a rakɛndɛya.<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>N na a fala nɛn, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Alatala, diɲa, i n nakɛndɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">bayo n bata yulubin liga i ra.”<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>N yaxune fala ɲaxine tima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">e naxa, “A faxama waxatin mundun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">a xinla yi lɔ ayi?”<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Naxanye fama n xɔntɔndeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">ne fala faɲine nan tima n xa nafigiyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">Koni, a dɛntɛgɛ ɲaxini tɔnma n ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">a yi mini a ralideni yiren birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>Naxanye birin n naɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">ne kɔyɛkɔyɛnma e bode xa n ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">E mirixi a ɲaxin nan ma n ma fe yi.<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>E naxa, “Fure ɲaxin bata a suxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">A mi fa kelɛ a sadeni feu!”<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Hali n lanfa faɲina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">n yi laxi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">nxu nun naxan yi donseen donma nxu bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">na bata keli n xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Alatala, kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">i yi n nakeli sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">nanara n na n yaxune donla saranɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>N na a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">fa fala n bata i kɛnɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">bayo e mi n nɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>I n malima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">amasɔtɔ n tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">I yi n lu i yɛtagi habadan!<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 41:14"/>Barikan xa bira Alatala xa, Isirayilaa Ala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:14">Habadan han habadan! Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 41:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="ms">Yaburin Yire Firindena: Keli Sora 42 ma han 72</para>
  <para style="s">Yigi sana Ala yi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>Koraa diine fala ɲaxumɛna. Bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Ala, i xɔnla n niin suxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">alo ige xunbenla xɔnla xɛnla suxun kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>Habadan Ala xɔnla n niin suxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">alo min xɔnla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">N sigama waxatin mundun yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">n sa ti Ala yɛtagi?<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>N wugama kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">N baloma yɛɛgen nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">N yaxune n maxɔdinma waxatin birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">e naxa, “I ya Ala minɛn yi?”<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Waxati danguxine fe na rabira n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">n bɔɲɛn yi kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Nxu nun yamaan nan yi sigama Alaa banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">n yi tima e yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">e sɛwaxin sɔnxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">e barikan birama Ala xa ɲaxan nin.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Nanfera n niin sɔxɔlɛxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">Nanfera n bɔɲɛn sunuxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">N xa n yigi sa Ala yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">N mɔn a tantunma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">N kisi muxun nun n ma Ala nan a ra.<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Koni iki, n niin sɔxɔlɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">nanara n na n mirima i ma Yurudɛn bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">Xerimon geyane xuntagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">e nun Misari geyaan ma.<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Fufaan sama fufaan fari n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">igen xuxu xuiin yi gbo ayi a surundeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">I xunfan gbeene radangu n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">gbalon yi keli n xili ma alo walanna.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Alatala xa a hinanna mayita yanyin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">alogo n yi xi bɛtin bɛ a xa kɔɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">N ma dunuɲa yi gidin Ala nan maxandima.<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>N na a falama n natangamana Ala nan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">n naxa, “Nanfera i ɲinanxi n xɔn ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">Nanfera n luma tɔrɛ n yaxune yii?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>N niin tɔrɔxi n yaxune xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">amasɔtɔ e fɛriɲɛnma n maxɔdinɲɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">e naxa, “I ya Ala minɛn?”<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 42:12"/>Nanfera n niin sɔxɔlɛxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">Nanfera n bɔɲɛn sunuxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">N xa n yigin sa Ala yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">N mɔn a tantunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">n ma Ala, n nakisimana.<verse eid="PSA 42:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>Ala, yoon fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">i n xun mayɛngɛn so dɛnkɛlɛyatare yamaan xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">N natanga wuledene nun muxu ɲaxine ma!<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>N kantan muxun nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Nanfera i n nabeɲinma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Nanfera n sunuxin luma tɔrɛ muxu ɲaxine xɔn?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>I ya kɛnɛnna nun i ya ɲɔndin nafa n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">E xa ti n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">siga i ya geya sariɲanxin fari i yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>Nayi, n sigama nɛn Alaa saraxa ganden dɛxɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">Ala naxan findixi n ma sɛwan nun n ma ɲaxanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">N na n ma bɔlɔnna maxa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">n tantun bɛtin ba i tan Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">n ma Ala.<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Nanfera n niin sɔxɔlɛxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Nanfera n bɔɲɛn sunuxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">N xa n yigin sa Ala yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">N mɔn a tantunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">n ma Ala, n nakisimana.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s">Maratangana Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Koraa diine fala ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Ala, nxu bata a mɛ nxu tunle ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">Nxu benbane bata yi a fala nxu xa nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">i fe gbeen naxanye liga e xa na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">lɔxɔn naxanye bata xunkuya.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>I tan nan siya dɛnkɛlɛyatarene kedi i sɛnbɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">i mɔn yi nxu benbane radɔxɔ na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">I siya gbɛtɛne raxuya ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">i yi nxu benbane rasabati.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>E mi na bɔxɔn sɔtɔxi e silanfanne xa ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">E mi a nɔxi e yɛtɛ fangan xan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">E a nɔxi i yɛtɛ fangan nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">i fangana, e nun i lu fena e xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">bayo e rafan i ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>N ma mangan nun n ma Ala nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">I tan nan nɔ sɔtɔn nagidima Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xa.<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Nxu nxu yaxune raxɛtɛma i tan nan baraka yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">Nxu e nɔ i xinli.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>N yigin mi saxi n ma xanla xan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">N ma silanfanna mi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">naxan nɔɔn fima n ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Koni i tan nan nɔɔn fima nxu ma nxu yaxune ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">I tan nan ne rayarabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">naxanye nxu raɲaxuxi.<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Nxu Ala nan matɔxɔma waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">nxu i tan nan xili tantunma habadan!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 44:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Koni iki, i bata i mɛ nxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">i yi nxu rayarabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">I mi fa minima nxɔ ganle fɔxɔ ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>I bata nxu ragi nxu yaxune yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">e yi nxu yii seene birin tongo.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>I bata nxu rabeɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">alogo e xa nxu faxa alo yɛxɛɛne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">I bata nxu raxuya ayi yamana gbɛtɛne ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>I bata i gbee muxune mati sare xurin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">alo dɛ mi seen naxan na.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>I bata nxu rayarabi nxu dɔxɔ bodene yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">nxu rabilin muxune yi nxu makonbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">e nxu magele.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>I bata nxu findi gelema seen na siyane yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">E e xunne yimaxama nxu mageledeni.<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>N fɛyani waxatin birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">N bata yagi<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>xɔnnantenne falane xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">naxanye n bɛsɛnxɔnyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">e nun n yaxun naxanye e gbeen ɲɔxɔma n na.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Ito birin ligaxi nxu ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">hali nxu to mi ɲinanxi i xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">hanma nxu yi i ya layirin kala.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>Nxu mi xɛtɛxi i fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">Nxu munma yi fata i ya kiraan na.<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>Koni hali na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">i nxu lu nɛn kankone bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">I nxu rabeɲin banban dimini.<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>Xa nxu yi ɲinan nxɔ Ala xinla ma nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">nxu yi ala gbɛtɛne batu,<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>i yatin yi na kolonma nɛn nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">amasɔtɔ i nxu miriya wundone kolon.<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Koni e nxu faxama i tan nan ma fe ra fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">E nxu ligama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">alo yɛxɛɛn naxan faxa daxi a ra!<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Xulun Marigina! Nanfera i xima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">Keli, i nama i mɛ nxu ra habadan!<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Nanfera i i yɛtagin luxunma nxu ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">I nama ɲinan nxɔ tɔrɔne nun marayarabine xɔn!<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Nxu niine bata bira gbangbanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">nxu gbindin mi fa nɔɛ kelɛ bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 44:27"/>Keli, i fa nxu mali!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:27">Nxu xunba i ya hinanna nin!<verse eid="PSA 44:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s">Mangana ɲaxalandin ti bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Koraa diine fala ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “Fuge Faɲine.” Xanuntenya sigina.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Fala faɲine bata n bɔɲɛn nasɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">Nanara, n bɛtini ito bama mangan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">N dɛni xaxi bɛtina fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">alo sɛbɛli ti faɲina xayen kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>I tofan adamadiine birin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">i fatan fala ɲaxumɛn tiyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">bayo Ala i barakama nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>I ya silanfanna sɔti i dɛxɔn, sɛnbɛmana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">Xunnayerenna nun binyena i tan nan xa!<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Siga soon fari xunnayerenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">i sa nɔɔn ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">ɲɔndin nun yɛtɛ magodon nun tinxinyana fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">I fangan xa fe magaxuxine makɛnɛn!<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>I ya xalimakuli ralemunxine xa i yaxune bɔɲɛne yisɔxɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">Siyane birama nɛn i sanne bun.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Ala, i luma nɛn i ya mangaya gbɛdɛni habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">I ya mangaya taxamasenna nan tinxinyaan na.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Tinxinna nan nafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">A ɲaxin mi rafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">Na nan a toxi Ala, i ya Ala bata i sugandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">A mɔn bata i ya sɛwan fari sa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">dangu bonne ra.<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Latikɔnɔnna nun se xiri ɲaxumɛne i ya dugine yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">Maxa se maxane i rasumunma mangane banxine yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">naxanye maxidixi sama ɲinne ra.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Mangane dii tɛmɛne ɲaxalandi tiine yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">I ya batɛn tixi i ya mangaya gbɛdɛn yii fari fɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">A maxidi seene rafalaxi xɛma faɲin nan na.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Mangana ɲaxalandina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">i tuli mati n ma falan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">Ɲinan i kon kaane nun i bari bodene xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>I xɔnla bata mangan suxu i ya tofanna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">I ya kuntigin na a ra, i xa a binya.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Tire kaane fama kiseene ra i xa nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">Nafulu kanne i ya fanna fenma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Binyen birin mangana dii tɛmɛn xa mangayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">A doma gbeen nafalaxi xɛma dugin nan na.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>E nun a doma rayabuxin nan sigan mangan fɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">ɲaxalandi tiine biraxi a fɔxɔ ra a tideni.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>E so mangana genla ma sɛwan nun ɲaxan nin.<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>I tan mangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">i dii xɛmɛ wuyaxi sɔtɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">naxanye luma mangayani i benbane funfuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">I e findima kuntigine ra nɛn bɔxɔn birin xun na.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 45:18"/>N ni i findima xili kanna ra habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:18">Muxun birin i matɔxɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:18">habadan han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 45:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s">En fangana Ala nan na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Koraa diine Ala tantun sigina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. Sungutunne xa a ba.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>Ala nan en yigiyaan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">e nun en fangana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">A yitɔnxi mali ti feen na tɔrɔ waxatine birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>Nanara, hali bɔxɔn xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">geyane yi bira fɔxɔ ige tilinxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">en mi gaxuɛ.<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>Hali fɔxɔ igene xuxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">geyane fan yi yimaxa gbaloni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">en mi gaxuɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Xudena Alaa taani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">naxan a muxune rasɛwama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">naxan findixi Kore Xɔnna Ala dɔxɔde sariɲanxin na.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>Ala na taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">a mi yimaxɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">Kuye nɛma yiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">Ala bata taan mali,<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>siyane yi sɔnxɔn nate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">mangayane yi yimaxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Ala na a xuini te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">bɔxɔn yi xuruxurun.<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan en xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">Yaxubaa Ala nan en ma faran makantanxin na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:8">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>Ɛ fa Alatala a wanle mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">a gbalon naxanye rakelixi bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>A yɛngɛne ɲanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">han bɔxɔn danna birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">A xanle yigirama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">a tanbane kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">a yi yɛ masansan wure lefane gan.<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">“Ɛ ɛ raxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">ɛ yi a kolon a n tan nan Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">N batuma nɛn siyane tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">N yi batu bɔxɔn birin yi.”<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 46:12"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna en tan nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:12">Yaxubaa Ala nan en ma faran makantanxin na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:12">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 46:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s">Ala fisamanten mangana</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Koraa diine bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Ɛ tan, siyane birin xa ɛ yiin bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">ɛ sɔnxɔ, ɛ xuini te sɛwani Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Alatala, Kore Xɔnna Ala magaxu han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">Manga gbeen na a ra dunuɲa birin xun na!<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>A bata nɔɔn fi en ma siyane xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">a yamane raso en ma nɔɔn bun.<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>A bɔxɔn sugandi nɛn nxu xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnne sabatima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">a naxanye xanuxi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 47:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>Ala bata dɔxɔ a mangaya gbɛdɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">Yamaan sɔnxɔma sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">xɔta xuine yi mini Alatala xa.<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>Tantun bɛtin ba Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">bɛtine ba han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">Tantun bɛtin ba en ma mangan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">bɛtine ba han!<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Ala nan mangan na dunuɲa birin xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">ɛ a tantun bɛtini.<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Ala dɔxi a manga gbɛdɛ sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">a mangayaan nabama siyane xun na.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 47:10"/>Siyane mangane sama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">Iburahimaa Alaa yamaan fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">A tan nan gbee dunuɲa ganle birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">Ala gbo han!<verse eid="PSA 47:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s">Siyon Ala gbee taana</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Koraa diine bɛtina. Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>Alatala gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">a lan a xa matɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">a gbee taani geya sariɲanxin fari.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Siyon, Alaa geyana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">a mate, a tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">dunuɲa birin sɛwama a fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">A mate</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">alo bɔxɔne birin manga taana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">Manga Gbeen dɔxi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Ala a yengi sama nɛn a taa makantanxin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">a bata a yɛtɛ findi a kantanmaan na.<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>Mangane to e malan Siyon yɛngɛ xinla ma,<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>e yi a to, e kabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">e gaxu, e yi e gi.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Xuruxurunna nun kuisanna yi e suxu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">alo ɲaxanla kuiin na keli a ra,<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>alo kunkibane na kɔntɔfili foye gbeena fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Ala kabanako feen naxanye ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">nxu bata ne mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">Iki, nxu bata ne to Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">A na taan nakisima nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 48:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Nanara, Ala nxu nxu mirima i ya hinanna ma i Batu Banxini.<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>I tan xili kanna tantunma dunuɲa yiren birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">I mangayaan ligama tinxinyaan na.<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Yamaan xa ɲaxan Siyon geyaan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">Yuda taa kaane xa sɛwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">i ya kitisana fe ra!<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Ɛ bilin Siyon ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">ɛ yi a kondene yatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>Ɛ ɛ xaxili lu a yinna xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">ɛ mɔn yi a sangansone mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">nanara ɛ a falɛ mayixɛtɛ famatɔne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">ɛ naxa, <verse eid="PSA 48:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 48:15"/>“Ala ito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:15">nxɔ Ala na a ra habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:15">A tima nxu yɛɛ ra nɛn han a raɲanni.”<verse eid="PSA 48:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s">Nafulu fuyanna fe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Koraa diine bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>Ɛ ito mɛ, ɛ tan siyane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">ɛ tuli mati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">ɛ tan muxun naxanye birin dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Fanga kanne nun tɔrɔ muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">nafulu kanne nun yiigelitɔne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">birin xa a tuli mati.<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>N fekolonna falane nan tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">n mirine xaxili faɲin nan fima.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>N na n xaxinla rasigama sandan nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">n yi a yɛba, n nɛma n ma bɔlɔnna maxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Nanfera n gaxuma gbalo lɔxɔne yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">hakɛ kan yanfantenne n nabilinma waxatin naxan yi?<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>E yigin saxi e se kanyaan nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">e mɔn yi e kanba e nafulu kanyani.<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>Muxun mi nɔɛ a boden xunbɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">A mi nɔɛ a niin saren soɛ Ala yii.<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>Amasɔtɔ muxun niin xunbaan xɔdɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">A mi nɔɛ a saren fiyɛ,<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>alogo a xa bu habadan, a mi faxa.<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Amasɔtɔ, en birin a kolon xaxilimane fan faxama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">e nun daxune nun kɔmɔne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">E birin e nafunle luma muxu gbɛtɛne nan yii.<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Gaburun yi findi e habadan banxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">e luma dɛnaxan yi, dan mi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">hali bɔxɔn to yi e yii e yɛtɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Muxuna gboon mi a rabuyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">A fan faxama nɛn alo subene.<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Muxun naxanye laxi e yɛtɛ ra fuyan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">e sigaden nan na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">naxanye wasaxi e nafunle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">ne raɲanma na kii nin.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 49:14">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>E rasigama laxira yi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">alo yɛxɛɛn naɲanna to faxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Sayaan yi e gbindine don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Muxu faɲine nɔɔn sɔtɔma nɛn e xun na sinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">e tofanna yi kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">e siga gaburuni.<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Koni Ala n niin xunbama nɛn laxira yi yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">A yi n xali.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 49:16">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>Muxun na nafunla sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">a nafunli gbo ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">i nama gaxu,<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>bayo a mi sese xalima a yii laxira yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">A hɛrisigɛn mi birama a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>Hali duba diin nan yi a ra a dunuɲa yi gidini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">hali a to matɔxɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">a yi sabatixi waxatin naxan yi,<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>a sama a benbane fari nɛn laxira yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">Ne mi fa dunuɲa toma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 49:21"/>Nafulu kanna naxan xaxili xurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:21">na maliga xuruseen nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:21">naxan faxamatɔ a ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxan naxan Ala kɛnɛn</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">Fangamana, Marigina Alatala falan tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">a dunuɲa muxune birin maxili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">sa fɔlɔ sogetedeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">han sa dɔxɔ sogegododen na.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>Alaa nɔrɔn mayilenma keli Siyon yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">na taa kamalixi tofaɲina.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>En ma Ala fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">a mi dunduxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">Kala ti tɛɛ gbeena a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">foye gbeena a rabilinxi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>A koren nun bɔxɔn xilima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">e xa findi seren na a yamaan makitideni.<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">“N ma muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine malan n fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">naxanye layirin xidixi n xɔn ma saraxa baan na.”<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Koren xɔnna a tinxinyaan nalima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">bayo Ala yɛtɛɛn nan kitisaan na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 50:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>“N ma yamana, ɛ ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">n falan tima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Isirayila, n na ɛ maxadima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">bayo Ala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>N mi ɛ maxadima ɛ saraxane xan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">Ɛ saraxa gan daxine bama n xa waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Koni, n mi turaan xa tongoma ɛ sansanne yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">xanamu kɔtɔn naxan ɛ kulane yi.<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Amasɔtɔ n gbeen nan burunna subene birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">N gbeen nan ɲingene ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">naxanye geya wuli wuyaxine ma.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>N tan nan xɔline ngaan kanna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">naxanye geyane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">e nun niimaseen naxanye birin fixɛne ma.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>Xa kamɛn yi n suxun nɛn nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">n mi na falɛ i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">amasɔtɔ n tan nan gbee dunuɲa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">nun ayi seene birin na.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>N ɲinge suben donɲɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">Ɛn-ɛn de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">Xanamu n siin wunla min?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">Ɛn-ɛn de!<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Nanara, barika biran xa findi ɛ saraxan na Ala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">Ɛ ɛ dɛ ti xuine rakamali Kore Xɔnna Ala xa.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>N xili tɔrɔ waxatini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">N ni i kantanma nɛn, i yi n binya.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>Koni Ala a falama muxu ɲaxine xa nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ xɛtɛma n ma tɔnne falan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">ɛ yi n ma layirina fe fala,<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>koni n ma xaranna mi rafan ɛ ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">Ɛ mɛxi n ma falane ra!<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Ɛ nun muɲadene na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">Ɛ nun yalundene na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>Ɛ fala ɲaxin nan tun tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">Ɛ wulen nan tun falama.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Ɛ ngaxakedenne kansunma waxatin birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">Ɛ katama e tɔɲɛgɛdeni.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>Ɛ bata ito birin liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">n mi fala ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Nanara, ɛ mirixi a n fan ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">alo ɛ tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Koni iki, n na ɛ maxadima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">n yi a yɛba ɛ xa.”<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>“Iki, ɛ ito famu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">ɛ tan naxanye Ala bɔtɛ rabaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">Xa na mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">n na ɛ raxɔrima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">Muxu yo mi ɛ xunbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Naxan na saraxa baan findi barika biran na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">na nan n binyaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">Naxan na siga kira faɲin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">n na Ala kisin yitama nɛn na ra.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s">Yulubi ratina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. <verse eid="PSA 51:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>A naxan ba Nabi Natan to fa a fɛma a yalunyaan ligaxina e nun Batiseba.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Ala, diɲa n ma i ya hinanna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">N ma matandine mafelu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">i ya kininkinin gbeeni!<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>N hakɛne birin ba n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">I yi n yulubine xafari.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>N na n ma matandine kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">N na n mirima n yulubine ma waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>N na i tan nan keden yulubi tongoxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">N naxan nabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">na ɲaxu i yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">Nanara, i na falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">i tan nan tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">i na kitin sa, i yoon sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>N barixi hakɛn nin yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">Yulubi kanna nan yi n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">xabu nga fudikan na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>I waxi ɲɔndin nan xɔn ma n sɔndɔmɛni yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">I n xaranma fekolonna ma n bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>N yulubin ba n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">nanara n sariɲanɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">I xa n maxa nanara n fixɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">dangu balabalan kɛsɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>N mɔn xa sɛwa n ɲaxan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">I bɔɲɛn naxan kalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">na mɔn xa sɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>I yɛɛn ba n yulubine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">i yi n mafelu n hakɛne birin na.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Ala, bɔɲɛ sariɲanxin sa n yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">I mɔn yi n xaxili ragidi.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>I nama n kedi i yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">I nama i ya Nii Sariɲanxin ba n yi.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>I mɔn xa kisin sɛwan fi n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">Xaxili faɲin xa n mali.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Nanara, n matandi tiine xaranɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">i ya kirane ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">yulubi kanne yi xɛtɛ i ma.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>N nakisimana, Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">n nakisi n ma faxa tixin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">Ala, yandi n xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">alogo n xa i ya tinxinyaan nali bɛtini.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Marigina, na liga n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">n xa i tantun.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Saraxan mi rafan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">xa na mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">n yi a bama i xa nɛn nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">Saraxa gan daxin mi i kɛnɛnɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Yɛtɛ magodon nan Ala rafan saraxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">Ala, i mi na kanna rabeɲinɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">naxan nimisaxi a bɔɲɛni a tubi.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 51:20"/>Tin, i Siyon nasabati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:20">I mɔn xa Yerusalɛn yinna ti.<verse eid="PSA 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 51:21"/>Na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">tinxin saraxane rafanma i ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">Saraxa gan daxine yi i kɛnɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">Na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">nxu yi turane rali i xa i ya saraxa ganden fari.<verse eid="PSA 51:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa wuleden makiti</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Dawudaa fala ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. <verse eid="PSA 52:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>A naxan ba, Dowegi Edɔn kaan to siga Sɔli fɛma, a naxa, “Dawuda bata siga Aximeleki a banxini.”<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Ee! Muxu gbeena!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">Nanfera i kanbama i ya fe ɲaxine yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">Alaa hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>I feene yitɔnma bonne kala xinla ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">I lɛnna luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">alo filɛ xɛnxɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">Ee! Yanfantenna!<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Fe ɲaxin nafan i ma dangu fe faɲin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">Wulen nafan i ma dangu ɲɔndin na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 52:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Ee! Wuledena!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">Fala xɔlɛne rafan i ma!<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>Nanara, Ala i raxɔrima nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">A i suxuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">a i ba i konni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">A i bama nɛn kɛndɛ muxune yɛ dunuɲa yi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 52:7">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Tinxin muxune ito toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">e gaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">Nayi, e gelema i ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">e naxa, <verse eid="PSA 52:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>“Na xɛmɛn mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">naxan mi Ala findi a kantanmaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">Koni a yigin saxi a nafulu gbeen nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">A fangan sɔtɔxi a boden kalan nan xɔn.”<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 52:10"/>Koni, n tan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:10">alo Oliwi wudin naxan sabatima Alaa banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:10">N yigin saxi a hinanna nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:10">habadan han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 52:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 52:11"/>N ni i tan Ala tantunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">i ya wanla a fe ra habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">N ni i xinla binyama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">i ya tɔgɔndiya muxune yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">bayo i tan fan!<verse eid="PSA 52:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s">Muxuna ɲaxuyana</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 14.1-7</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Dawudaa fala ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba xulenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Xaxilitarena a falama a bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">a naxa, “Ala mi na.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">E birin yifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">e haramu feene ligama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">Muxu yo mi a faɲin nabama.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Ala a yɛɛn nagodoma adamadiine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">keli ariyanna yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">a xa a to xa nde na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">naxan xaxili sɔtɛ, a Ala fen.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Koni birin bata kiraan fata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">e ɲaxu ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Hali keden pe mi a faɲin ligama.<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Fe ɲaxi rabane mi fe kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">E n ma yamaan tɔnɔn donma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">alo donsena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">koni e mi Ala xandima mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Awa nayi, gaxun ne suxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">e tan naxanye mi yi gaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Ala e kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">a e rayarabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">bayo e raɲaxu a ma.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 53:7"/>Nde kelɛ Siyon yi a Isirayila rakisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Ala mɔn na a yamaan sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna sɛwama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Isirayila yi ɲaxan!<verse eid="PSA 53:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandin maratanga feen na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Dawudaa fala ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba kondenne ra. <verse eid="PSA 54:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Dawuda bɛti naxan ba, Sifi kaane to siga Sɔli fɛma e naxa, “Dawuda luxunxi nxu tagi.”<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Ala, n nakisi i sɛnbɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">N xun mafala kitin bolon!<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Ala, n ma maxandi xuiin namɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">I tuli mati n fala xuine ra!<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Xɔɲɛne bata keli n xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">Gbalotɔne katama n faxa feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">E mi e mirima Ala ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 54:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Koni Ala nan n mali muxun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">Marigin nan n niin kantanma.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>A n yaxune fe ɲaxine raxɛtɛ e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">E halagi amasɔtɔ i lannayaan nabama.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 54:8"/>Nayi, n ɲɛnige ma saraxan bama i xa nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:8">n yi i tan Alatala tantun amasɔtɔ i fan.<verse eid="PSA 54:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 54:9"/>Bayo, i tan nan n baxi n ma tɔrɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:9">n yi n yaxune biraxin to.<verse eid="PSA 54:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s">Muxu yanfaxina Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Dawudaa fala ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba kondenne ra.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Ala, n ma maxandi xuiin namɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">I nama i xun xanbi so n ma mawugani!<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>I tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">i yi n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Xaminna bata n suxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">han n kuisan<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>n yaxune fala xuine fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">Muxu ɲaxine n yigbɛtɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">e n tɔrɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">E bata xɔlɔ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">e yi n naɲaxu.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>N bata kɔntɔfili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">Sayaan gbalon bata n xun matugan.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Gaxun nun xuruxurunna bata n suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">Gbalon yi n nabilin.<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Xa gabutɛɛn yi n ma nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">alo ganbana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">n yi tuganma nɛn nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">n sa dɔxɔden fen.<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>N yi n gima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">n siga yire makuyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">N yi lu burunna ra.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 55:8">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>N yi maratangaden fenma nɛn mafurɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">n keli foye gbeen nun gbalon bun.<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Muxu ɲaxine raxuya ayi, Marigina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">e fala xuine yifu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">Bayo, n gbalon nun yɛngɛn toma taani han!<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">e taan nabilinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">hakɛn nun yɛngɛne nan taani.<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Kala tiin gboma ayi taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">Bɛsɛnxɔnyaan nun mayifuun nan taani.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Xa yaxun nan tun yi n makonbima nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">n yi diɲama a bun ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">Xa n naɲaxu muxun nan tun yi a yɛtɛ yigboma n yɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">n yi n luxunma a ma nɛn nun.<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Koni i tan na a ra, n lanfana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">n bodena, n xɔyi kɛndɛna!<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>En ma lanfamayaan yi ɲaxun Alaa banxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">en yi sigan tima yamaan yɛ waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Sayaan xa n yaxune ratɛrɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">e kɛndɛn yi siga laxira yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">Bayo fe ɲaxina e yi e konni.<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Koni n bata Ala xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">Alatala n nakisima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>N ma mawugan nun kutun xuina a lima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">Xɔtɔnna nun yanyin nun ɲinbanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">a n xuiin mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>A n niin natangama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">n yi keli yɛngɛni hɛrini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">hali n yaxune to yi wuya!<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Habadan mangana Ala a tuli matima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">a yi n yaxune rabira.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 55:20">Bɛti xuini te.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">Amasɔtɔ e bata tondi tubɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">E mɔn mi gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>N lanfana a xɔyine yɛngɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">A a layiri xidixine kalama.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>A fala xuiin ɲaxun fɛnɛn xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">koni maraɲaxuna a bɔɲɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">A fala xuine salaxun alo turena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">Koni e sɛgɛn tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">alo silanfan xɛnxɛna.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>I ya kɔntɔfinle lu Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">A i malima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">A mi tinɲɛ tinxin muxun yi bira mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 55:24"/>Koni i tan, Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">i na muxu faxane nun wuledene faxama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">benun e siin tagiin xa a li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">N tan mabinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">n na n yigi sama i tan nin.<verse eid="PSA 55:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s">Yigi sana Ala yi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Dawudaa maxandi ɲaxumɛna. Bɛti baane kuntigin xa: a xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili, “Ganban Wudi Makuyeni” a naxan ba Filisitine to a suxu Gati taani.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Ala, kininkinin n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">amasɔtɔ e n yɛngɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">N yaxune n bɛsɛnxɔnyama fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Fɛriɲɛn gbɛn n yaxune n yɛngɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">N yɛngɛfane bata wuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">e waso.<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>N na gaxu waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">n na n yigi sama i tan nan yi.<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>N na Alaa fala kamalixine matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">n yi n yigi sa a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">nanara n mi gaxuɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">Daɲɔxɔn dɔrɔnna nanse ligɛ n na?<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Fɛriɲɛn gbɛn n yaxune n tɔrɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">E n ɲaxankata feni tɔnma waxatin birin!<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>E e malanma luxundene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">e yɛɛne tixi n na, n nɛɛn dɛdɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">E yengi a ma e n faxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>I nama tin e rakisi feen ma e fe ɲaxine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Ee! Ala! I xɔlɔxin xa na muxune rabira.<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>N ma sunun yatɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">N yɛɛgena fe xa rabira i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">I xaxili mi dɔxi e xɔn ba?<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>N na i xili waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">n yaxune xɛtɛma n fɔxɔ ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">n yi a kolon a Ala n xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>N na Ala matɔxɔma a falane fe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">N na Alatala matɔxɔma!<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>N yigi saxi Ala nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">n mi gaxuɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">Adamadiin nanse ligama n na?<verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Ala, n dɛ xuiin naxan tongoxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">n na a rakamalima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">N na barika bira saraxan bama i xa nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 56:14"/>Amasɔtɔ i bata n ba sayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">i yi n natanga biran ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">Nanara, n sigan tima Ala yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">n ma siimayani.<verse eid="PSA 56:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 108.1-5</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Dawudaa maxandi ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili, “I Nama Halagin Ti” Dawuda naxan ba a to a gi Sɔli bun, a sa a so faran yinla ra.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Kininkinin n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Ee! Ala! Kininkinin n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Amasɔtɔ n niin marakisin fenma i tan nan yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">N xa luxunden sɔtɔ i gabutɛɛn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">han yihadin yi dangu.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>N bata Kore Xɔnna Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">naxan n ma feene rasɔnɔyama.<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>A n yabima nɛn keli ariyanna yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">a n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">A ne mafalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">naxanye n yɛngɛma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 57:4">Bɛti xuini te.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">Alaa hinanna nun a lannayaan yitama n na nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Yatane bata n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">n saxi adamadi ɲaxine tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">E ɲinne ligaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">alo tanbane nun xalimakunle.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">E lɛnne ligaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">alo silanfan xɛnxɛne.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Ala, i ya binyen xa mayita kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">a yi bɔxɔn nafe!<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>E bata yalaan nati n yɛɛ ra n suxu xinla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">e yi n nayagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">E bata yinla ge n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">koni e tan yɛtɛɛn bata bira a kui.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 57:7">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Ala, n xaxili ragidixi yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">N bɛtin bama nɛn, n yi i tantun!<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>N xulunma nɛn sinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">n yi n ma bɔlɔnna nun kondenna maxa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">N kurunma bɛtin bɛ nɛn subaxa!<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Marigina, n ni i tantunma nɛn siyane yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">N bɛtin bama i xa nɛn bɔnsɔnne tagi.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>I ya hinanna gbo han ariyanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">I ya lannayaan texi han kore xɔnna.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 57:12"/>Ala i ya binyen xa mayita kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:12">a yi bɔxɔn nafe!<verse eid="PSA 57:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan kitisa tinxinxin na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Dawudaa maxandi ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “I Nama Halagin Ti.”<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Ɛ tan muxu gbeene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">ɛ falane mi tinxin feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">Ɛ nɔɛ adamadiine makitɛ tinxinni ba?<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Ɛn-ɛn de! Tinxintareyana ɛ bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">ɛ gbalon nakelima bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Xabu e bari waxatini, e ɲaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">Wuledene lɔxi ayi xabu e bari lɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>E xɔlɛn luxi nɛn alo saɲin xɔlɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">alo fɔdɔgɔɔn naxan mi saɲi suxun xuiin mɛma,<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>naxan mi a kanna xuiin namɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">Saɲi suxun na fatan kiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">a mi nɔɛ a suxɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 58:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Ala, i xa e ɲinne magira e dɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">Alatala, i xa na yatane dɛɛn kala!<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>E xa ɲan alo igen naxan bɔxɔnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">E tanbane xa yelefu ayi.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>E xa liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">alo korosiraan naxan fati tununma ayi lingini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">alo diin naxan faxaxi barixi, a mi sogen to.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Tansin xindena hanma a xarena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">ne ganma nɛn tunden bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">Foyen ɲaxudene fan xalima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">a e raxɔri.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 58:10">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Tinxin muxune ɲaxanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">bayo a gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">E fama e sanna maxadeni nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">muxu ɲaxine wunla ra.<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 58:12"/>Nayi, adamadiine yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:12">“Ala tinxin muxune saren fima yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:12">Ala na yatigi, naxan dunuɲa makitima!”<verse eid="PSA 58:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina marakisina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Dawudaa maxandi ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “I Nama Halagin Ti,” a naxan ba Sɔli to sofane xɛ e xa sa e luxun Dawuda yɛɛ ra a banxini a faxa xinla ma.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>N ma Ala, n xunba n yaxune yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">N natanga ne ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">naxanye kelixi n xili ma!<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>N xunba fe ɲaxi rabane yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">N nakisi na muxu faxane ma!<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">e n legedenma n faxa feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Sɛnbɛmane e malanma n xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">N mi i matandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">n mi yulubi ligaxi, Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>N sɔnna mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">koni e yitɔnxi e xa n yɛngɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Keli, i fa n mali!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Yandi n mato!<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Alatala, Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">Isirayilaa Ala, keli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">I yi siya dɛnkɛlɛyatarene fe ɲaxine saran e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">I nama diɲa yanfanten ɲaxine ma mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 59:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>E fama ɲinbanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">E xaɲɛ alo barene taan xun xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>I tuli mati e konbi ti xuine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">E lɛnne luxi nɛn e dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">alo silanfanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">e mɔn a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">“Nde nɔɛ en ma falan mɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Koni Alatala, i gelema e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">I siya dɛnkɛlɛyatarene birin magelema.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Ala n sɛnbɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">n xaxili tixi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">I tan nan n ma faran makantanxin na.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>N ma hinantenna Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">a tima n yɛɛ ra nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">A a liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">n na n yɛɛn nagodo n yaxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Koni, i nama e faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">Marigina, nxu yɛ masansan wure lefana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">Nanara, n ma muxune mi ɲinanɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">E raxuya ayi i sɛnbɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">i yi e nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>Bayo yulubi falane e dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">e xa suxu e yɛtɛna wasona fe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">Bayo e dangane tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">e wulene falama,<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>e ɲan i ya xɔlɔni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">E ɲan fefe! Sese nama lu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">Nayi, birin a kolonma nɛn fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">Ala mangayaan nabama Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">han bɔxɔn danna birin.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 59:14">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>E fama ɲinbanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">E xaɲɛ alo barene taan xun xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>Barene nɛma donse fenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">xa e mi lugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">e wurundunma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Koni n tan i sɛnbɛn matɔxɔma nɛn bɛtini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Xɔtɔnni, n na n ma bɛti xuini tema nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">i ya hinanna fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Bayo, n ma faran makantanxin nan i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">n na n yigiyama dɛnaxan yi tɔrɔ waxatine yi.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 59:18"/>N sɛnbɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">n bɛtin bama i xa nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">I tan Ala nan n ma faran makantanxin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">n ma hinantenna Ala.<verse eid="PSA 59:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina nɔ ti fena</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 108.7-14</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Dawudaa maxandi ɲaxumɛna, bɛti baane kuntigin xa, a xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “Gabalan Fugaxina Sereyana.” A xa ba xaran feen na. <verse eid="PSA 60:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Dawuda bɛtini ito nan ba a to Arami kaane yɛngɛ naxanye keli Mesopotamiya yamanan nun Soba yamanani, Yowaba yi xɛtɛ, a Edɔn kaa wuli fu nun firin faxa Fɔxɔ Lanbanni.<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Ala, i bata i mɛ nxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">i yi gbalon nakeli nxu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">I bata xɔlɔ nxu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">Koni iki, i mɔn xa nxu yitɔn.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>I bata bɔxɔn naxuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">a yibɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">I mɔn xa a tugun a bode ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">a nama xuya ayi.<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>I bata waxatine raxɔdɔxɔ i ya muxune ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">Nxu dagalanma ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">alo nxu minxin na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>Koni naxanye gaxuxi i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">i bata taxamasenni te ne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">naxan e ratangama xalimakunle ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 60:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>I xa i xanuntenne kantan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">i yi e rakisi i sɛnbɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">I yi nxɔ maxandin yabi.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Ala bata falan ti a yire sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">a naxa, “N nɔɔn tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">n Siken taani taxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">n yi Sukɔti lanbanna danne sa.<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>N tan nan gbee Galadi bɔxɔn nun Manase ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Efirami kaane findixi n ma yɛngɛsone nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Yuda luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">alo n ma mangaya dunganna.<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Koni n ma konyin nan Moyaba yamanan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">N tan nan Edɔn yamanan kanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">N yɛngɛ sɔnxɔni tema Filisiti yamanani.”<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Ala, nde sigama n na na taa makantanxini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">Nde tima n yɛɛ ra siga Edɔn yi?<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Ala, i tan xa mi i mɛxi nxu ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">I mi fa nxɔ ganla fɔxɔ ra sɔnɔn ba?<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 60:13"/>Nxu mali yaxune yɛngɛdeni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:13">Sese mi adamana maliin na.<verse eid="PSA 60:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 60:14"/>Koni Ala na lu en xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:14">en nɔɔn sɔtɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:14">A tan nan en yaxune halagima.<verse eid="PSA 60:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s">Ala, n xa lu i fɛma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba kondenne ra.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Ala n ma mawuga xuiin mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">I tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>N yigitɛgɛxin bata n xui ramini i ma wulani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">N xali na geyaan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">naxan mate n xa.<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Amasɔtɔ i tan nan n yigiyaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">e nun yinna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">naxan n natangama n yaxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>N waxi lu feni i konni waxatin birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">N xa luxunden sɔtɔ i gabutɛne bun ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 61:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Ala, i bata n dɛ ti xuine mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">I bata na kɛɛn so n yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">i naxan namaraxi i ya yɛɛragaxu muxune xa.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Ala xa mangan siin xun masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">a xa bu han!<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>Ala xa mangan sabati a yɛtagi habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">A ratanga i ya hinanna nun i ya lannayaan nin.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 61:9"/>Nanara, n tantun bɛtin bɛ i xinli waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:9">n yi n dɛ ti xuine rakamali lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 61:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa Yedutun xa.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>N bɔɲɛn saxi Ala nan baraka yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">a tan nan n nakisima.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>A tan kedenna nan n kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">n nakisimana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">N ma faran makantanxin nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">Yaxune mi n nɔɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Han waxatin mundun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">ɛ luyɛ fuyɛ muxune ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">Ɛ tan e rabirama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">alo banxi xɔnna hanma langa fonna?<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>E waxi muxune ragodo feni tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">keli a binyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">E e yoron wuleni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">E duban tima e dɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">koni e dangan tima e bɔɲɛni.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 62:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>N bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔma Ala nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">A tan nan n yigin na.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>A tan nan n kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">n nakisimana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">N ma faran makantanxin nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">Yaxune mi n nɔɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>N ma kisin nun n ma binyena Ala nan yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">N kantan fanyen sɛnbɛmaan nan Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">N ma yigiyana a tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Yamana, ɛ ɛ yigin sa a yi waxatin birin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">Ɛ yi ɛ kɔntɔfinle so Ala yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">amasɔtɔ en yigiyaden nan Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 62:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Adamadiine ligaxi nɛn alo foyedina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">A xungbeen nun a xurina, sese mi e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">Hali e rate sikeela fari, e yelefu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">E malanxin yelefu foyedin xa.<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>I nama i yigin sa gbalo feene yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">I nama i waso se muɲaxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">Hali nafunla gbo i yii han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">i nama i yigin sa a yi!<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>Ala luma a falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">fa fala a tan nan gbee fangan na.<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 62:13"/>I gbeen nan hinanna ra, n Marigina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:13">Bayo i tan muxun kɔntɔnna fima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:13">alo a kɛwanla.<verse eid="PSA 62:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa hinanna fisa siimayaan xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, a yi Yuda tonbon yireni waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Ala, n ni i fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">n ma Ala nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">I xɔnla n sɔndɔmɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">I xɔnla n fati bɛndɛn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">alo min xɔnla n suxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">tonbonni ito yi kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">bɔxɔ magenla, ige mi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>N xa i to i ya yire sariɲanxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">N yi i sɛnbɛn nun binyeni gbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>I ya hinanna fisa siimayaan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">Nanara, n na i batuma.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>N barikan birama i xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">n ma siimayaan birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">n na n yiine yite i maxandideni.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>N nii yifanma n ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">alo n na wasa donse hagigɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">N yi i tantun sɛwa bɛtine yi.<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>N nɛma saxi n ma saden ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">n na n mirima i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">N xaxili luma i xɔn nɛn kɔɛɛn birin na.<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Amasɔtɔ i tan nan n mali muxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">n sɛwa bɛtin ba i nininna bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>N bata kankan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">i yiin nan n natangama.<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Naxanye katama n faxa feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">ne faxama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>E faxama silanfanna ra nɛn yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">kankone yi e binbine don.<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 63:12"/>Nayi, Mangan sɛwama nɛn Ala yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">Naxanye e kɔlɔma Ala xinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">ne a matɔxɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">Koni wuledene dɛɛne raxutuma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 63:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandin maratangana fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Ala, i tuli mati n ma mawuga xuiin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">N bata gaxu n yaxune yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">N niin natanga!<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>N luxun muxu ɲaxine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">naxanye e bode toma wundoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">e nun fe ɲaxi raba ganla.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>E lɛnne xanxan alo silanfanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">Fala ɲaxine minima e dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">alo xalimakuli ralemunxina.<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>E e xanle tima sɔntaren na wundoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">E mafura bunna tiyɛ, e mi gaxuma.<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>E e bode rawɛkilɛma kɛwali ɲaxin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">E e bode toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">e lutine ratima dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">E naxa, “Nde nɔɛ e toɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>E tinxintareyani tɔnma, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">“En ma kɔtɛ yitɔnxin mi fulɛ mumɛ!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">Muxun kui feene kolon naxɔlɔ!<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Koni Alaa xalimakunle wolima e ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">a e li keden na.<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>E gbee fala xuine xɛtɛma e ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">e yi halagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">Naxan yo na e to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">ne e xunne yimaxama nɛn e mageledeni.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Nayi, gaxun adaman birin suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">E e xaxili lu Ala a wanla xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">e yi a fe rabaxine famu.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 64:11"/>Tinxin muxune xa sɛwa Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:11">e yi a findi e luxunden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:11">Muxu sɔndɔmɛ faɲin birin xa a matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 64:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s">Tantunna nun barika birana</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Ala, a lan yamaan yi i tantun Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">nxu mɔn yi nxu dɛ ti xuine rakamali.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>I tan naxan maxandi xuine ramɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">muxun birin fama nɛn i fɛma.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Hakɛne to sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ nxu xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">i yi nxɔ matandine mafelu.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Sɛwan ne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">i bata naxanye sugandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">e xa lu i konni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">Nxu bata lugo i ya banxin fe faɲine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">i Batu Banxi Sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>I nxɔ maxandin yabima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">kabanakoon nan na tinxinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">Ala nxu rakisimana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">bɔxɔn danna muxun birin yigina i tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">e nun naxanye fɔxɔ igen kidi ma pon!<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>I sɛnbɛn bata geyane da</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">bayo fangamaan ni i ra.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>I bata baan xuini ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">i yi a walanne raxara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">I mɔn yi siyane masabari.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Dunuɲa birin gaxuma i ya kabanakone yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Keli sogetedeni han sogegododeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">e birin bɛtin bama i xa sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>I yengi dɔxi bɔxɔn xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">i yi tule igen sa a ma, han a ramɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">Alaa xuden nafexi igen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">alogo donseen xa sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">I tan nan na ragidixi.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>I tule gbeen nafama xɛɛ bixine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">bɔxɔn yi xunbeli, a yogon igen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">I tan barakan sama xɛɛni, a sabati.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Xɛɛ xaba waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">i ya fanna warama ayi nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">I na dangu dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">mɛnna yi sabati.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Fixɛne fanma e nun fiile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">Geyane rayabuma nɛn han!<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 65:14"/>Xuruseene yiriwama nɛn fixɛne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">Lanbanne yi rafe siseene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">Na birin yi findi bɛti ba xunna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">e nun sɛwa sɔnxɔna.<verse eid="PSA 65:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s">Barika birana Ala xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Sigi sariɲanxina. Tantun bɛtina. Bɛti baane kuntigin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:1">Dunuɲa muxun birin xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>Ɛ a xinla binya bɛtin ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">Ɛ tantun gbeen fi a ma!<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>Ɛ a fala Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">“I ya kabanako wanle magaxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">I sɛnbɛn gbo han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Nanara, i yaxune gaxuxin felenxi i bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>Muxun birin i batuma dunuɲa yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">e tantun bɛtin ba i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">E i xinla tantunma bɛtini.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>Ɛ fa be!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">Ɛ a mato Ala bata naxan liga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">A wanle magaxu adamadiine yɛ han!<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>A fɔxɔ igen findi nɛn yire yixaren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">en benbane yi gidi baan tagi e sanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Nayi, en xa ɲaxan a tan yi.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>A mangayaan nabama a sɛnbɛni habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">A yɛɛn tixi siyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">nanara muxu yo nama murutɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:7">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Siyane, ɛ barikan bira en ma Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">Ɛ a tantun xuini te!<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>A bata siimayaan fi en ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">a mi tin en yi bira.<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Ala i nxu rasariɲanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">sulun tɛɛni alo wure gbetina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">66.10</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note><verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>I a liga nɛn nxu yi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">i mɔn yi goron gbeen sa nxu xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>I tin nɛn nxu yaxune yi ti nxu fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">Nxu yi dangu ige tilinxin nun tɛɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">Koni, i fa nxu ra dahamu bɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>N fama saraxa gan daxin na nɛn i ya banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">N bata dɛ xuiin naxan tongo i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">n na rakamalima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>Dɛ ti xuini itoe falaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">n yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>N sube turaxine bama saraxa gan daxin na nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">n yi kontonne ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">e tutin yi te kore.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">N turane nun kɔtɔne fan bama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:15">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Ɛ fa be! Ɛ ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">ɛ tan naxanye birin gaxu Ala yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">A bata naxan liga n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">n na a falama ɛ xa nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>N bata a xili malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">n yi a batu n dɛ xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Xa hakɛn yi ramaraxi n bɔɲɛni nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Marigin mi yi a tuli matima n xuiin na nun.<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>Koni Ala yatin bata n namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">a a tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>N barikan birama Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">amasɔtɔ a mi a mɛxi n ma maxandi xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">A mi a hinanna baxi n yii.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s">Siyane birin xa Ala tantun</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Tantun bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba kondenne ra. Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>Ala xa kininkinin en ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">Ala xa en baraka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">Ala nɔrɔn xa godo en ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 67:2">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Nanara, dunuɲa birin i ya kiraan kolonɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">siyane birin yi i ya marakisin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Siyane xa i tantun Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">siyane birin xa i tantun!<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Muxune xa ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">e bɛtin ba sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">amasɔtɔ i siyane makitima tinxinna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">I tixi dunuɲa muxune birin yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 67:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>Siyane xa i tantun Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">siyane birin xa i tantun!<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Nayi, bɔxɔn donse gbegbe fima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">Ala, en ma Ala en barakama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 67:8"/>Ala en barakama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:8">bɔxɔn danna muxun birin yi gaxu a yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 67:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa nɔna Isirayila xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Ala xa keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">a yi a yaxune raxuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">Naxanye a raɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">ne yi e gi a bun.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>E kedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">alo foyen sigama tutin na kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">E xa ɲan Ala yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">alo dolen na lo tɛɛni.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Koni tinxin muxune xa ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">e sɛwa Ala yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">E xa gele ɲaxanni.<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>Bɛtin ba Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">a xinla xa tantun bɛtini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">Naxan fama kundani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">ɛ na rasɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">A xili nɛn Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">En xa en sɛwa xuini te a yɛɛ ra!<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Ala naxan a kon sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">kiridine fafe na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">kaɲa gilɛne xun mayɛngɛn na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>Ala denbayaan fima denbayatarene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">A kasorasane xɔrɔyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">e mini bɛtin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">Koni murutɛ muxune luma bɔxɔ yidunduxin nin.<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>Ala, i to ti i ya yamaan yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">i siga na tonbon yireni.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:8">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>Bɔxɔn yi xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">koren yi rabi Ala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">Sinayi Geyana Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">Isirayilaa Ala.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Ala, i tule gbeen nafa nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">i ya bɔxɔn mɔn yi xɛtɛ a kiini.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>I ya yamaan yi dɔxɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">I yi yiigelitɔne ki i ya nɛmana fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>Marigin bata feni ito xibarun fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">ɲaxalan gali gbeen yi siga a ralideni, e naxa,<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>“Mangane nun sofane e gima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">E e gima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">Nxu tan ɲaxanle yi yɛngɛ yi se tongoxine yitaxun.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Ɛ tan naxanye fan luxi xuruseene dɛxɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">ɛ a mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">Ala a yamaan suturama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">alo ganba tofaɲina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">naxan gabutɛye rafalaxi gbetin nun xɛma faɲin na.”<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna to na mangane raxuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">e yolon alo balabalan kɛsɛna Geya Fɔrɛn ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Basan yamanan geyane gbo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Yire matexi wuyaxi e ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Nanfera ɛ Alaa geya sugandixin matoma xɔxɔlɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Ala yɛtɛɛn dɔxi dɛnaxan yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Alatala luma dɛnaxan yi habadan!<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>Marigin bata fa a yire sariɲanxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">keli Sinayi Geyaan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">e nun a yɛngɛ so wontoro wuli wuli wuyaxi.<verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>Marigina Alatala, i bata te kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">muxu suxine biraxi i fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">I yi kiseene rasuxu adamadiine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">hali muxu murutɛxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">i yi dɔxɔ na yi.<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Barikan xa bira Marigin xa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">en ma goronna saxi naxan xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">Ala en nakisimana.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:20">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>En ma Ala, Ala na a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">naxan muxune rakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">En Marigina Alatala na a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">naxan en bama sayani.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Ala yatina a yaxune xunne yibɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">naxanye kankanxi e sɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>Marigin bata a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">“N fama nɛn ɛ yaxune ra keli Basan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">N fama e ra nɛn sa keli fɔxɔ igen xɔnna ma<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>alogo ɛ xa ɛ sanne sin e wunli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">ɛ barene fan yi e wunla kɔn han e wasa.”<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Ala, nxu bata i ya yamaan famatɔɔn to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">I ya yamaan soma yire sariɲanxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">i tan n ma Ala nun n ma mangana.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Bɛti baane yɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">maxa se maxane xanbin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">sungutunne wɔsɔwɔsɔnne maxama ne tagi.<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Barikan bira Ala xa a malan gbeeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">Isirayila bɔnsɔnna birin xa Alatala tantun.<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">dɔnxɛ ra barin tixi e yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">Yuda bɔnsɔnna mangane fan fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">e sɔnxɔma e nun Sabulon mangane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">nun Nafatali mangane.<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Ala, i sɛnbɛn nagodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">i sɛnbɛn mayita, Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">alo waxati danguxini.<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>I Batu Banxin Yerusalɛn taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">mangane fama kiseene ra i xa na yi.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>I xa falan ti Misiran bɔxɔn xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">naxan nun sube xaɲɛn maliga sɛxɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Misiran luxi nɛn alo tura ganla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">siya gbɛtɛne biraxi naxan fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">alo ɲinge diine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">E ragodo han e fa mudu gbetin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Na siya yɛngɛ ralanne raxuya ayi!<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Xɛrane kelima nɛn Misiran yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">Kusi kaane yi e yiine ti Ala xa a maxandideni.<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Dunuɲa yamanane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">ɛ bɛtin ba Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">ɛ Marigin tantun bɛtini.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:33">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>A masiga tima kore xɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">xabu waxati xunkuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">A galan xuiin naminima fangani.<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>Ɛ Ala sɛnbɛna fe rali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">a mangayaan nabama Isirayila xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">A sɛnbɛn kore xɔnna ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 68:36"/>Ala na mini a Yire Sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">a magaxu han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Isirayilaa Ala sɛnbɛn fima a yamaan ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">e nun fangana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Barikan xa bira Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 68:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s">Sɔxɔlɛ maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “Fuge Faɲine.”<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Ala, n nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Igen bata te han n kɔɛɛn bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>N bitinma boro tilinxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">San tide yo mi na yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">N tilinna xɔrɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">N na n maminma fufani.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>N bata xadan xili tideni n mali feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">N kɔɛ yinla nan fa n xɔlɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">N yɛɛne bata xadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">e bata bu i yɛɛ ra kira yi.<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Naxanye n naɲaxuxi fuuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">ne wuya dangu n xunsɛxɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">A gbegbe wama n faxa feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">naxanye n yaxuyaxi fuu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">N mi naxan muɲaxi n na raxɛtɛ ba?<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>N yi daxuyani kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">i na kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">Ala, n sɔnna mi luxunxi i tan ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Marigina Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">n nama ne rayagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">naxanye yigi saxi i yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">Isirayilaa Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">n nama findi ne yarabi muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">naxanye i batuma!<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>E n konbima i tan nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">N bata yagi han!<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>N bata liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">alo xɔɲɛna ngaxakedenne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">alo fa muxuna n xabilani.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>I ya banxina fe xaminna n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">han a n ganma alo tɛɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">Nanara, e i konbin naxanye tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">ne n tan nan lima.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>N na wuga, n yi sunna suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">yamaan yi n konbi.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>N na kasa dugin nagodo n ma sununi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">yamaan yi sabaan so n na.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Naxanye batuma taan so dɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">ne n nafɛyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Dɔlɔ minne sigin sama, e n magele.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Koni Alatala, n na i tan nan maxandima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">I ya hinan gbeen waxatin ni i ra n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">Ala, n yabi i ya marakisi barakaxini.<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>N xunba, n nama bitin boroni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">N xunba n yaxune yii, n ba tilinni.<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>I nama tin fufaan yi sa n xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">I nama tin n yi n mamin tilinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">hanma n bitin gaburun na.<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>N ma Alatala, n yabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">i ya hinanna nun i ya fanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">I firifiri n binni i ya kininkinin gbeeni.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>I nama i yɛtagin luxun i ya walikɛɛn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">N yabi iki sa! Bayo n tɔrɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Fa n fɛma i yi n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">N xunba n yaxune yii.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>I a kolon n konbima kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">n nayagima, n nayarabima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">I n yaxune birin toma.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Konbin bata n bɔɲɛn kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">han n yigitɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">N yengi yi kininkininna a fe ma nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">koni se mi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">N yengi yi madɛndɛnna nan ma nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">koni n mi se to.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>E dabarin sama n ma donseni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">Min xɔnla to n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">e minse xɔlɛn so n yii.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Ala xa e ɲaxaɲaxane findi luti ratixin na e yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">Ala xa e hɛrin findi e suxu xunna ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>E yɛɛne xa rafɔrɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">e yi danxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">E fanne xa ba a ra waxatin birin!<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>I xa fitina e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">i ya xɔlɔ gbeen yi e li.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>E dɔxɔden xa kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">Muxe nama lu e bubune kui.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Bayo, i naxanye tɔrɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">e ne ɲaxankatama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">I naxanye ɲaxankataxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">e ne fe falama sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>I xa e magi e hakɛne birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">E nama i ya kisin sɔtɔ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Ala xa e xinle ba nii rakisin kitabun kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">E nama basan tinxin muxune xinle ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Koni n xɔlɛni, n mɔn yigitɛgɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">Ala, i ya marakisin xa n natanga!<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>N na Ala xinla matɔxɔma bɛtini nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">N yi a gboon nali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">n barikan bira a xa.<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Na Alatala kɛnɛnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">dangu ɲinge baan na a xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">dangu tura kamalixin baan na saraxan na.<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Yiigelitɔne a toma nɛn, e sɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">Ɛ tan naxanye Ala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">Ala xa siimayaan fi ɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Alatala tuli matixi tɔrɔ muxune ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">A mi ɲinanma muxu suxine xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">a gbeen naxanye ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Koren nun bɔxɔn nun fɔxɔ igena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">e nun e yi seene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">e birin xa Ala matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Ala Siyon taan nakisima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">A Yuda taane tima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">A mɔn yi a yamaan nadɔxɔ na yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">e mɔn yi findi a gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 69:37"/>Na findima a walikɛne mamandenne kɛɛn na nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:37">Naxanye Ala xanuxi, ne yi lu na yi.<verse eid="PSA 69:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 40.13-17</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. Maxandina.<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Ala, n nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">Alatala, fa n mali iki sa!<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Ala xa ne yarabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">naxanye n faxa feni tɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">e yifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">Ala xa ne raxɛtɛ marafɛyani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">n ma tɔrɔn nafanxi naxanye ma.<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>E yagixin xa xɛtɛ naxanye a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">e naxa, “Yɔ! I suxi!”<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Naxanye birin i tan fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">i xa ne birin nasɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Naxanye waxi i ya kisi feen xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ne xa lu a falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">“Ala gbo!”<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 70:6"/>Koni, yiigelitɔɔn nun tɔrɔ muxun nan n tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">Ala, fa n fɛma mafurɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">I tan nan n malimaan nun n natangamaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">Alatala, i nama buyɛ ayi.<verse eid="PSA 70:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s">Fonna Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 31.1-4</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>Alatala, i tan nan n luxunden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">I nama tin n yi yagi!<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>N natanga i yi n xunba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">amasɔtɔ i tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">I tuli mati n na i yi n nakisi!<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Ala, findi n kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">n luxundena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">n luma sigɛ dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">Yamarin fi, i yi n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">Amasɔtɔ, n kantan fanyen nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">n ma yinna nan i tan na.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>N ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">n natanga muxu ɲaxine sɛnbɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">i n ba hakɛ kanne nun gbalotɔne yii.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>N Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">n yigin na i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">N bata n yigin sa i yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">xabu n dii ɲɔrɛyani.<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>I n masuxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">xabu n yi n nga kui waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">I tan nan a liga n yi bari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">nanara n ni i tantunma.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>N findixi misaala nan na a wuyaxi xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">amasɔtɔ n yigiya sɛnbɛmaan nan i tan na.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>N ni i tantunma nɛn fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">N yi i ya nɔrɔn matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>I nama i mɛ n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">amasɔtɔ iki, n bata fori.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">I nama n nabeɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">amasɔtɔ n fangan bata ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>N yaxune n mafalama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">Naxanye waxi n faxa feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">ne e bode toma.<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>E naxa, “Ala bata a rabeɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">En siga a fɔxɔ ra en yi a suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">A xunba muxu mi na yi.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Ala, i nama i makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">N ma Ala, i mafura, i fa n mali!<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Ala xa ne yarabi, e ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">naxanye n kansunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">Ala xa ne yagi, e xun nagodo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">naxanye waxi n maxɔlɔ feni.<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>N xaxili tixi i ra tun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">N mɔn sigama i tantunɲɛ tun!<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>N ni i ya tinxinyaan matɔxɔma nɛn fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">E nun i ya marakisina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">hali n to mi e birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">n fama i sɛnbɛn barakani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">n ni i tan keden peen nan ma tinxinyaan matɔxɔma.<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Ala, xabu n xurun waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">i n xaran nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">N mɔn i ya kabanakone matɔxɔma tun!<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Ala, iki, n bata fori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">n xunsɛxɛn fan bata fuga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">Koni i nama n nabeɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">fɔ n xa i sɛnbɛn nali iki muxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">n yi i ya fangana fe yɛba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mayixɛtɛ famatɔne birin xa.<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Ala, i ya tinxinyaan bata kore li!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">I bata kabanako fe wuyaxi liga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Nde ligaxi alo i tan?<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>Hali i to tɔrɔn nun xɔlɛ gbeen nafa n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">i mɔn n niin naxɛtɛma n yi nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">Hali n sa gaburun tilinxini bɔxɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">i n natema nɛn mɔn.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>I n ma xunnayerenna ragboma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">i mɔn yi n madɛndɛn.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>N na i tantunma nɛn kondenna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">i ya lannayana fe ra, n ma Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">N tantun bɛtin bama i xa nɛn bɔlɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">Isirayila Sariɲantɔna.<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>N sɔnxɔma nɛn sɛwani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">n nɛma bɛti baani waxatin naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">amasɔtɔ i bata n xunba.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>N ni i ya tinxinyaan matɔxɔma nɛn fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">Amasɔtɔ naxanye yi waxi n tɔrɔ feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">ne bata yagi, e yarabi.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina mangan xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Sulemani gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">Ala, mangan xaran i ya kitisa kɛndɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">I ya tinxinyaan yita n tan mangana diin na.<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Nanara, a i ya yamaan makitɛ tinxinni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">A sariya kɛndɛn sa yiigelitɔne xa.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Ala xa bɔxɔn nasabati yamaan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">Ala xa tinxinyaan sabati yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Mangan xa sariya kɛndɛn sa yiigelitɔne xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">A xa tɔrɔ muxune diine rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">a yi e yɛngɛfane rayensenɲɛ ayi.<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>I ya mangayaan xa magaxu ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">han mamandenne mamandenne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">fanni sogen tema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">fanni kiken mɔn dɛgɛma.<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Mangan fanna xa liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">alo tulena xɛɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">a xa liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">alo tule igen nɛɛn fɛ bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Tinxin muxune xa sabati mangan waxatini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">Ala xa hɛri gbeen fi fanni kiken dɛgɛma.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>A mangayaan gboma ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">sa fɔlɔ sogeteden na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">han sa dɔxɔ sogegododen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">Fɔlɔ Efirati baan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">han sa dɔxɔ bɔxɔn danna ra.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Naxanye wulani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">ne e xinbi sinma a bun ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">A yaxune e sama bɔxɔn ma nɛn a bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Tarasisi mangane fama kiseene ra nɛn a fɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">e nun fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">Saba nun Sɛba mangane mudun fima a ma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Mangan birin e xinbi sinma a bun ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">Siyane birin wanla kɛma a xa nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>A tɔrɔ muxune xunbama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">naxanye na a xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">e nun yiigelitɔ rabeɲinxine.<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>A kininkininma sɛnbɛtarene nun tɔrɔ muxune ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">A tɔrɔ muxune niin nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>A e xɔrɔyama nɛn mayigbɛtɛnna nun gbalon ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">bayo a e yatɛxi.<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Ala xa mangan bu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Ala xa xɛmaan fi a ma keli Saba yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Yamaan xa Ala maxandi a xa waxatin birin!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">E xa duba a xa fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Ala xa donseen wara ayi bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Geyane xa rafe siseene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">E xa bogi alo naxanye Liban yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Taa kaane xa sabati alo sɛxɛna.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Ala xa mangan findi xili kanna ra habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">A xinla xa bu alo sogena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Siyane birin duban sɔtɔma nɛn a barakani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">E fan yi duba a xa.<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Barikan xa bira Marigina Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">Isirayilaa Ala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">A tan keden peen nan kabanako feene ligama.<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Barikan xa bira a xa habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Ala xa dunuɲa birin nafe a binyen na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Yese a dii xɛmɛn Dawuda maxandine danna ni i ra.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="ms">Yaburin Yire Saxandena: Keli Sora 73 ma han 89</para>
  <para style="s">Alaa tinxinyana fe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">Ala fan Isirayila ra han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">A fan bɔɲɛ sariɲanxi kanne ra.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Koni fayida n bata yi tantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">n kiraan beɲin.<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>Amasɔtɔ n yi wasodene maxɔxɔlɔnma nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">n muxu ɲaxine sabatixin to waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>E mi kɔntɔfilixi sese ra mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">E fatine fan, e kɛndɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>E mi sɔxɔlɛxi sese ra alo bonne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">Adamadiine tɔrɔne mi e tan lima.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Nanara, wasona e yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">alo ɲɛrɛn muxune kɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">Gbalona e yi alo domaan muxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Turena e fatini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">han e yɛtagin bata yikusin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">Fe ɲaxin nan e bɔɲɛni han!<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>E gelen muxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">e fala ɲaxine ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">E muxune ɲaxankatama wasoni.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>E fala ɲaxine tima Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">e dɛ ɲaxu falane dunuɲa birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Nanara, yamaan biraxi e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">e falane xɔnla yi e suxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">alo igen min daxina.<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>E naxa, “Ala nanse kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Kore Xɔnna Ala nɔɛ na kolonɲɛ di?”<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Muxu ɲaxine na kii nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">E bɔɲɛn saxi waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">e lu nafunla sɔtɛ tun!<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Nayi, n luxi tinxinyani nɛn fuu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">N yi n yɛtɛ rasariɲan fuyan!<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>N tɔrɔxi lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">I n hakɛn saranma n na xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn!<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Xa n yi falan ti alo e tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">nayi, n yi i ya muxune yanfama nɛn nun.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Nanara, n yi kata feni ito famudeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">koni, a yi xɔdɔxɔ n ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>Han n so Alaa yire sariɲanxini waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">n yi n miri e raɲan kiin ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Ala, i e tima yire salaxunxin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">e birama dɛnaxan yi, e kala.<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Nba, e halagima nɛn mafurɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">gbalon yi e ɲan sasa!<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>E luxi nɛn alo xiyena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">naxan ɲinanma muxun na xɔtɔnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">Marigina, i na keli waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">e tununma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>N bɔɲɛn yi sɔxɔlɛxi waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">n niin yi sunuxi,<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>n yi daxuyaan nun xaxilitareyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">N yi luxi i yɛɛ ra yi alo subena.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Koni hali na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">n yi i fɔxɔ ra waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">i yi n yii rasuxu,<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>i ti n yɛɛ ra i ya maxadine xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">i yi n nasuxu binyen nin.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Nde n malima kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">ba i tan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Bayo i bata lu n xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">n fa waxi nanse gbɛtɛ xɔn dunuɲa yi?<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>N fati bɛndɛn nun n niin taganɲɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">koni Ala nan n niin sɛnbɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">e nun n kɛɛna habadan!<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Naxanye e makuyaxi i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">ne yatin halagima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">Naxanye e mɛxi i ra, i yi ne raxɔri.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Koni a rafan n tan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">n yi n maso Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">N bata Marigina Alatala findi n yigiyaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">alogo n xa i ya wali faɲine birin nali!<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa Isirayila xunba</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Asafi a fala ɲaxumɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Ala, nanfera i mɛxi nxu ra habadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Nanfera i xɔlɔma i ya yama kantanxin ma?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>I xaxili lu i ya yamaan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">i naxan xunba xabu waxati xunkuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">bɔnsɔnna naxan findixi i gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">I nama ɲinan i dɔxɔden Siyon Geyaan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>I xun ti taa xɔnni ito ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">Nxu yaxune bata kala gbeen ti yire sariɲanxini.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Nxu yi naralanma i ra dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">I yaxune sɛwaxin bata sɔnxɔn nate mɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">E yi e taxamasenne yite na yi.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>E liga mɛnni alo xɛɛ sɛgɛne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">naxanye fɔtɔn wudine sɛgɛma e bunbine ra.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>E na sawura wudi tofaɲine birin kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">e bunbine nun e dɛgɛmane ra.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>E tɛɛn so i ya Yire Sariɲanxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">a gan fefe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">E yi i xinla batuden naharamu.<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>E yi a mirixi, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">“En ne birin naxɔrima nɛn feu!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">E yi Ala batudene birin gan yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Nxu mi fa kabanako taxamasenne toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">Nabi yo mi fa na sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">Nxu mi a kolon na buma han waxatin mundun.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Ala, i yaxune i magelen danma waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">E luma i xili kalɛ nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">han habadan?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>I tondixi nxu maliyɛ nanfera?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">I yiini bandun, i yi e raxɔri!<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Ala, i tan nan nxɔ mangan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">xabu a fɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">I tan nan marakisi tiin na dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>I tan nan fɔxɔ igene yitaxun i sɛnbɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">I mɔn yi ige yi sube ɲaxine xunne yibɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>I tan nan ige yi sube magaxuxin xunne kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">I yi a so burunna subene yii donseen na.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>I tan nan tigine nun xudene ramini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">I tan nan baane yixara.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>I tan nan gbee yanyin nun kɔɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">I bata sogen nun kiken dɔxɔ e yirene yi.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>I tan nan dunuɲa danne rafalaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">I soge furen nun ɲɛmɛn da.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Koni Alatala, i xaxili lu ito xɔn ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">i yaxune gelema i ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">Xaxilitarene i xili kalama!<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>I nama i ya yamaan nabeɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">alo ganbana sube xaɲɛne yii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">I nama ɲinan i ya muxune xɔn mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">naxanye tɔrɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>I xaxili lu i ya layirin xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">bayo bɔxɔn yire yi fɔrɛne rafexi gbalotɔne ra.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>I nama tin muxu ɲaxankataxine yi yarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">alogo yiigelitɔne nun tɔrɔ muxune xa i xinla matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Ala, keli i yi i yɛtɛ xun mayɛngɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">I xaxili lu a xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">a xaxilitarene i magelema fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>I nama ɲinan i yaxune sɔnxɔ xuiin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">i yɛngɛfane e xuini tema mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan kitisaan na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa, a xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili, “I Nama Halagin Ti.” Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Ala, nxu bata i tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">Nxu i tantunma han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">Nxu i maxandima i xinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">nxu yi i ya kabanakone fe fala.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>I naxa, “N bata kiti sa lɔxɔn sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">N kiti faɲin sama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Bɔxɔn xuruxurunma waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">a niimaseene birin yi xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">n tan nan a san bundɔxɔn xɔdɔxɔma ayi ken!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 75:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>N bata a fala wasodene xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">‘Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ yigbo!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">N bata a fala muxu ɲaxine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">‘Ɛ nama ɛ kanba ɛ sɛnbɛn xɔn!<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Ɛ nama ɛ kanba ɛ sɛnbɛn xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">kore xɔnna xili ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">Ɛ nama waso falane ti!’ ”<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>Amasɔtɔ xun mayɛngɛn mi kelima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">sogeteden binna xan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">hanma sogegododen binni hanma burunna ra.<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Ala nan kitin sama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">A yi nde yalagi, a yi nde yoo sa.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Amasɔtɔ igelengenna suxi Alatala yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">a rafexi a xɔlɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">alo dɔlɔ xɔdɛxɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">A a xɛlɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">muxu ɲaxine birin yi a min han a ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Koni n na a fe falama nɛn bɛtine yi habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">N yi tantun bɛtin ba Yaxubaa Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 75:11"/>A muxu ɲaxine birin fangan kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:11">a tinxin muxune xunna keli.<verse eid="PSA 75:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s">Nɔ tiin nan Ala ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba kondenne ra. Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>Yuda kaane Ala kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">A xinla binyaxi Isirayila yi.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>A konna Salemi taan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">a dɔxi Siyon Geyaan nin.<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>A a yaxune xalimakunle yigira mɛnna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">e nun yɛ masansan wure lefane nun e silanfanne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">nun e yɛngɛ so seene birin.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 76:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Ala, i tan nan sɛnbɛn birin kanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">i nɔrɔxi dangu habadan geyane ra.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Sofa wɛkilɛxine birin bata bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">e yii seene yi tongo yɛngɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">E fa saya xixɔnla nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">Na sofa yo mi fa a yiini maxama.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Yaxubaa Ala, i na falan ti xɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">soone nun soo ragine yi bira, e faxa.<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>I tan nan magaxu, Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">I na xɔlɔ, nde nɔɛ tiyɛ i yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>I to kitisa xuiin namini keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">yamanan muxune yi gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">e yi e dundu,<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>i to keli kiti bolondeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">alogo i xa yiigelitɔne rakisi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 76:10">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Hali muxune na xɔlɔ i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">na raɲanma tantunna nan ma i tan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">Naxanye na mini i ya xɔlɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">ne xaxili sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>I na i dɛ ti Alatala xa, i ya Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">i xa a rakamali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">Yamanan naxanye birin be rabilinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">ɛ Alatala ki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">A lan birin xa gaxu a yɛɛ ra!<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 76:13"/>A tan kuntigi wasoxine ragodoma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:13">a yi dunuɲa mangane magaxu.<verse eid="PSA 76:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s">Madɛndɛnna tɔrɔ waxatini</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa, Yedutun xa.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>N bata n xuini te Ala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">N bata n ma mawuga xuini te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">a xa n xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>N yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">n Marigin maxandi nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">Kɔɛɛn birin na, n yi n yiini te Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">koni n mi madɛndɛn.<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Alaa fe to rabira n ma, n kutun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">N to n miri a ma, n xaxinla yi yifu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>N yi xi n yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">N xaminxi, n mi fala tima.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Nayi, n yi n miri waxati danguxine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">e nun ɲɛɛ xunkuyene.<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>Bɛtine yi rabira n ma kɔɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">N yi n miri n bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">n maxɔdinna ti n xaxinli iki:<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>“Marigina a mɛma nxu ra nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">han habadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Nxu mi fa a kɛnɛnma ba?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Marigina hinanna bata ɲan ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">han habadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">A tulisaan bata ɲan ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">han habadan?<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Ala bata ɲinan hinanna xɔn ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Ala bata a kininkininna ɲan a xɔlɔni ba?”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:10">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>N yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">“Naxan n tɔrɔma, na ni ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">Kore Xɔnna Ala mi fa a fangan yitama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">alo a fɔlɔni.”<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">n xa i ya kɛwanle rabira n yɛtɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">I ya kabanako fe fonne yi rabira n ma.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>N xa n miri i ya wanle ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">N yi n xaxili lu i ya wali gbeene xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Ala, i ya kiraan sariɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">Batu se yo mi gbo alo Ala.<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Ala nan i tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">naxan kabanako wanle kɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">I bata i sɛnbɛn mayita siyane tagi.<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>I bata i ya yamaan xunba i sɛnbɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">Yaxuba nun Yusufu bɔnsɔnne.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:16">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Ala, igene to i to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">e yi xuruxurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">Tilinne yi xuruxurun.<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Tulen yi godo keli kore.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">Galanna yi a xuiin namini kore.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">Kuyen yi a ɲinna masɔxɔn yiren birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>I ya kuye sarinna xuiin yi gbo ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">I ya kuyena ɲin masɔxɔnna yi dunuɲa birin yiyalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">Bɔxɔn yi xuruxurun, a yi yimaxa.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>I ya kiraan yi fɔxɔ igeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">I gidi baa tilinxini, i san fɔxɔne mi toɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 77:21"/>I yi Nabi Musa nun Haruna ti i ya yamaan yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:21">alo xuruse rabaan tima yɛxɛɛ kurun yɛɛ ra kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 77:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nun a yamana fe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Asafi a fala ɲaxumɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">N ma muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">ɛ ɛ tuli mati n ma xaranna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">ɛ yi n ma fala xuine ramɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>N sandane nan sama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">N wundo fonne nan yɛbama.<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>En bata feen naxanye mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">en yi e to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">en fafane feen naxanye falaxi en xa,<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>en mi ne luxunɲɛ en ma diine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">En Alatala matɔxɔ feene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">nun a sɛnbɛn nun a kabanako feene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">falama en mamanden famatɔne xa.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>A bata tɔnne so Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">A mɔn yi sariyan so Isirayila yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">A en fafane yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">a e xa e diine xaran na ma,<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>alogo muxu famatɔne xa e kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">Hali diin naxanye munma bari singen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">ne fan yi a fala e diine xa.<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>Nayi, e fan e yigi sama Ala fari nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">E mi fa ɲinanma a wanle xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">e yi a yamarine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>Nayi, e mi luma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">alo e benbane yi kii naxan yi nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">Tengbesendene nun murutɛdene nan yi ne ra nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">naxanye mako mi yi Alaa fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">e mi yi tɔgɔndiyaxi Ala ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Xanla yi Efirami bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">ne e gi nɛn yɛngɛn lɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>E Alaa layirin nabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">e tondi a sariyan suxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>E ɲinan nɛn Ala kɛwanle xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">a kabanako feen naxanye yitaxi e ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>A kabanako feene liga nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">e benbane yɛɛ xɔri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">Misiran yamanani, Soyan yi.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>A yi fɔxɔ igeni taxun a tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">a yi e ragidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">A yi a liga igene yi mate ayi e bode fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">alo banxi kankena.<verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>A ti e yɛɛ ra yanyin na kundani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">A mɔn yi ti e yɛɛ ra kɔɛɛn na tɛɛ dɛgɛni.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>A fanyeni bɔ tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">a yi tigin namini, e yi e min.<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>A yi xuden namini gɛmɛne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">igen yi godo alo baana.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Koni e lu yulubin ligɛ a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">e murutɛ Kore Xɔnna Ala ma tonbonni.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>E yi a nata, a e xa Ala bunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">e yi e waxɔn donseen maxɔdin Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>E yi Ala mafala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">“Ala nɔɛ donseen naminɛ tonbonni ito yi ba?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>A to gɛmɛn bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">igen nan mini ayi yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">koni a nɔɛ burun nun suben soɛ a muxune yii ba?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Na ma, Alatala e xuiin mɛxina, a fitina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">A yi xɔlɔ Isirayila ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">tɛɛn yi mini Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xili ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">78.21</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Yatɛne 11.1 kui.</note><verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>Amasɔtɔ e mi yi laxi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">e mi yi e yigi saxi a marakisini.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>Koni a yi kuyen yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">a koren dɛɛne xa rabi,<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>a yi Manna donseen nagodo e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">a ariyanna donseen so e yii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">78.24</char> <char style="fk">Manna donsena</char> a fe mato Xɔrɔyaan 16.13-15 nun 16.31 kui.</note><verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Adamadiine yi malekane burun don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">Ala yi donseen nasiga e ma han e lugo.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>Ala yi foyen nafa keli sogetede binna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">A mɔn yi foyen namini yiifanna ma a sɛnbɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>A yi xɔline ragodo e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">naxanye yi wuya alo baan mɛɲɛnsinna.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>E yi yolon e daaxaden tagi e bubune rabilinni.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Yamaan yi e dɛge han e lugo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">E yi waxi naxan xɔn ma Ala na so nɛn e yii.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Koni benun e xa wasa, donseen mɔn yi e dɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>Ala yi xɔlɔ e ma, a yi e sɛnbɛmane faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">Isirayila banxulanne.<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>Hali na birin to liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">e mɔn lu nɛn yulubin ligɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">Hali a to kabanako feene liga e mi dɛnkɛlɛya.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>Nayi, a yi e dunuɲa yi gidin lu fuuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">han e yi faxa kuisanni.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>A to ndee faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">a dɔnxɛne yi tubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">e yi Ala fen sɔbɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>A yi rabira e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">fa fala Ala nan e kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">a Kore Xɔnna Ala nan yi e xunba muxun na.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Koni e falane mi yi fixaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">e yi wulen nan falama a xa.<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>E mako mi yi Alaa fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">e mi yi tinxinxi Ala layirini.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Koni bayo a kininkinin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">a yi e hakɛne mafelu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">A mi e halagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">A xɔlɔn lu dɔxɔɲa ma wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">a mi fitina e xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>A a kolon fa fala daɲɔxɔn nan tun e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">e siimayaan luxi nɛn alo foyedina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">naxan danguma a mi xɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>E murutɛ Ala ma nɛn tonbonni sanɲa ma wuyaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">A yi sunu e fe ra burunna ra sanɲa ma wuyaxi!<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>E yi Ala bunbama yɛ yo yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">E yi a liga Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin yi xɔlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>E ɲinan nɛn a sɛnbɛ gbeen xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">e nun a e xunba e yaxune yii lɔxɔn naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>E ɲinan nɛn a taxamasenne xɔn Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">e nun a kabanako feen naxanye liga Soyan yi.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>A yi e baane findi wunla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">Ige yo mi yi na nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">Misiran kaane yi naxan minɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>A tugetuge xɔlɛne rasiga e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">naxanye e don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">Xunɲɛne fan yi e bɔxɔn kala.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>A e siseene so suɲɛne yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">A bogiseen birin so tuguminne yii.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>A yi e wudi binle kala balabalan kɛsɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">A yi e xɔdɛ binle kala xunbenla ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>A yi e ɲingene faxa balabalan kɛsɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">Galanna yi e xuruseene faxa.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>A fitinaxin yi a xɔlɔ ɲaxin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">nun a bɔɲɛ teen nun a maraɲaxun nagodo e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">Halagi ti ganla nan yi ne ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>A mi xɛtɛ a xɔlɔn fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">a mi tin e niine yi rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">a yi e faxa fitina furene ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>A yi dii sarane faxa Misiran denbayaan birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">Xami a denbayane dii singene birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">naxanye singe e fangan mayita.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>A yi fa a yamaan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">keli Misiran yi alo xuruse kuruna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">A yi e kantan burunna ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>A yi ti e yɛɛ ra, sese mi e sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">nanara e mi gaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">Koni fɔxɔ igen yi a ragali e yaxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>A yi fa e ra a bɔxɔ sariɲanxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">na geyaan ma a naxan sɔtɔ a sɛnbɛn xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>A siya gbɛtɛne kedi nɛn a yamaan yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">a yi e bɔxɔne yitaxun e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">A yi Isirayila bɔnsɔnne rasabati e konne yi.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Koni e yi murutɛ Kore Xɔnna Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">e yi a bunba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">E mi e xaxili lu a maxadi xuine xɔn,<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>e yi e masiga a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">e yanfan ti alo e benbane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">E mi fa tinxinxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">alo xalimakuli yidɔxina.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>E Ala raxɔlɔ nɛn e suxure batudene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">E yi Ala raxɔxɔlɔn e ala sawurane xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>Ala to na mɛ, a yi xɔlɔ han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">Nanara, a yi a mɛ Isirayila ra feu!<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>A yi a banxin nabeɲin naxan Silo yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">a yi dɔxi adamadiine tagi dɛnaxan yi nun.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>A yi tin a sɛnbɛ kankiraan yi suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">A nɔrɔn misaala yi so yaxune yii.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>A yi tin a muxune yi faxa silanfanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">a yi a xɔlɔ gbeen nagodo a muxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Tɛɛn yi e banxulanne gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">han ɲaxalan dii ti sigine yi dan na fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Saraxaraline yi faxa silanfanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">Koni yɛngɛn mi tin kaɲa gilɛne yi e wuga.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Dɔnxɛn na, Marigin yi keli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">alo a yi xiin nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">A yɛngɛn so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">alo sofa sɛnbɛmaan na manpaan min.<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>A mɔn yi a yaxune kedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">A yi e rayarabi habadan!<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>A yi a mɛ Yusufu bɔnsɔnna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">A mi Efirami bɔnsɔnna sugandi.<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>A Yuda bɔnsɔnna nan sugandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">e nun a Siyon Geyaan naxan xanuxi.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>A yi a Yire Sariɲanxin ti mɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">alo kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">naxanye na habadan!<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>A yi a walikɛɛn Dawuda sugandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">A yi a ba yɛxɛɛ kulan dɛxɔn.<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>A yi a tongo xuruse kantandeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">a yi a findi a yamaan kantanmaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">a gbee muxune Isirayila.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Dawuda yi a ɲɔxɔ lu e xɔn ma ɲɛnige faɲini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">A ti e yɛɛ ra ki faɲi.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina Yerusalɛn taan xunba feen na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">Ala, siya gbɛtɛne bata i ya bɔxɔn yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">e so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">E bata i Batu Banxi Sariɲanxin naharamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">E bata Yerusalɛn findi taa xɔnna ra.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>E bata i ya walikɛne binbine so xɔline yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">e yi e don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">I ya muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine binbine bata lu burunna subene bun.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>E bata e wunla ramini Yerusalɛn birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">alo igen bɔxɔnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">Muxu yo mi luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">naxan faxa muxune maluxunɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Nxu rabilinna siyane fala ɲaxin tima nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">e nxu makonbi, e nxu magele.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Alatala, i luma xɔlɔxi nxu ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">han waxatin mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">I ya xɔlɔn luma nɛn alo tɛɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">han waxatin mundun yi?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>I ya xɔlɔn nagodo siyane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">naxanye mi i batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">e nun yamanan naxanye mi i xinla binyama.<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Amasɔtɔ e bata Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">e a bɔxɔn kala.<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>I nama nxu tɔrɔ nxu benbane hakɛne fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">I ya kininkininna xa nxu ralan iki sa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">Amasɔtɔ nxu makona a ma han!<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Ala, nxu rakisi muxuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">nxu mali i xinla binya feen na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">Nxu xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">i yi nxu mafelu nxu yulubine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">i xinla a fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Nanfera siyane maxɔdinna tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">e naxa, “E Ala minɛn?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">A yita siyane ra nxu yɛɛ xɔri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">a i ya walikɛne faxa feen ɲɔxɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>I tuli mati suxu muxune kutun xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">Naxanye yalagin bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">ne ratanga i sɛnbɛ gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Na siyane konbin naxanye ti i ma Marigina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">ne saranna fi na ra dɔxɔ solofere.<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Nanara, nxu tan i ya yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">i naxan kantanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">alo i ya xuruse kuruna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">nxu i tantunɲɛ na yi habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">nxu i matɔxɔ waxati famatɔne birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa en ma yamanan natanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina bɛti baane kuntigin xa, sereyana, a xa ba alo bɛtin naxan xili: “Fuge Faɲine.”<verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>Isirayila kantan muxuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">i tuli mati nxu ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">I tan naxan tixi Yusufu bɔnsɔnna yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">alo xuruse kuruna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">i tan naxan dɔxi maleka gubugubu kanne tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">i yɛtɛ makɛnɛn nɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>I sɛnbɛn yita</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">Efirami nun Bunyamin nun Manase bɔnsɔnne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">Keli, i fa nxu rakisi!<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Ala, i mɔn xa nxu sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">i nɔrɔn nagodo nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">alogo nxu xa kisi.<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Alatala, Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">i luma xɔlɔxi i ya yamaan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">han waxatin mundun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">i tondi a maxandin yabɛ?<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>I bata e balon findi sɔxɔlɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">i yi e igelengenne rafe yɛɛgen na.<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>I bata nxɔ bɔxɔn findi yɛngɛ so xunna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">nxu rabilinna siyane xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">Nxu yaxune nxu magelema.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">i mɔn xa nxu sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">i nɔrɔn nagodo nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">alogo nxu xa kisi!<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>I fa nɛn wudi binla ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">sa keli Misiran yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">I siyaan bonne kedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">i yi na wudi binla si e bɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>I yi yirena nde yitɔn a rasoliden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">A salenne yi godo pon!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">A yi yamanan nafe.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>A nininna yi so geyane xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">A yiine yi so suman wudi gbeene xun na.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>A yiine yi sigama han fɔxɔ igen xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">e mɔn yi sigaxi han baan xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Nanfera i a langan kalaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">I tin dangu muxune birin yi a bogine muɲa?<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Segune yi keli fɔtɔnni, e a kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">burunna subene yi a don.<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna Ala, i mɔn xa fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">I yɛɛ ragodo nxu ma keli ariyanna yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">i yi nxu mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">I ya yamaan nakisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">naxan findixi na wudi binla ra!<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>I tan yɛtɛɛn naxan sixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">i xa na ratanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">A luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">alo i tan yɛtɛɛn diin naxan nagboxi.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>E bata a sɛgɛ, e a gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">i ya yamaan kalama i ya xɔlɔn bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>I yengi lu mangan xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">i tan yɛtɛɛn naxan dɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">i tan yɛtɛɛn diin naxan nagboxi.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Nxu mi fa nxu xun xanbi soma i yi sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">Nxu rakisi nanara nxu i tantunɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 80:20"/>Alatala, Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:20">i mɔn xa nxu sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:20">i nɔrɔn nagodo nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:20">alogo nxu xa kisi!<verse eid="PSA 80:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan en malima</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Asafi gbeena, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba Gati kaane kondenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Sɔnxɔ sɛwani en ma Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">en sɛnbɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">Ɛ xuini te Yaxubaa Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>Ɛ bɛti baan fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">ɛ tanbanne maxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">e nun bɔlɔnna nun kondenna.<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Kike nɛnɛn na te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">e nun kiken na kɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">ɛ xɔtaan fe en ma sali lɔxɔne yi.<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Sariyan nan ito ra Isirayila xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">Yaxubaa Alaa yamarin nan ito ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>A a so Yusufu a denbayaan yii nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">a Misiran yamanan yɛngɛ waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">En yi xuina nde mɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">en mi yi naxan kolon,<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>A naxa, “N bata goronne ba ɛ xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">Ɛ bata goron binyen dɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Ɛ yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">ɛ yi n xili n yi ɛ xunba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">N yi ɛ yabi foye gbeeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">N yi ɛ kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ Meriba igene yi.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 81:8">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>“N ma yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">ɛ ɛ tuli mati n ma maxadi xuine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">Isirayila, xa ɛ yi n xuiin namɛ nun!<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Ɛ nama Ala gbɛtɛ batu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">Ɛ nama ɛ xinbi sin ala gbɛtɛ yo xa!<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>Alatala nan n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">ɛ Ala naxan faxi ɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">sa keli Misiran yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Ɛ ɛ dɛɛne yibi, n xa ɛ ralugo.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Koni n ma yamaan mi e tuli matixi n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">Isirayila mi tin n na.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Nayi, n yi e lu e tengbesenyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">e yi bira e waxɔn feene fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>Xa n ma yamaan yi n xuiin namɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">xa Isirayila yi birɛ n ma kirane fɔxɔ ra nun,<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>n yi e yaxune yarabima nɛn nun mafurɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">N yi e yɛngɛfane halagima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Naxanye Alatala raɲaxuxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">ne gaxuxine yi e felenma nɛn a bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">E tɔrɔn mi yi ɲanma habadan!<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 81:17"/>N yi ɛ baloma nɛn malo faɲin nun kumin na.”<verse eid="PSA 81:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan mangan na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Asafi a bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">Ala dɔxi a manga gbɛdɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">a tan nan kitin sama sɛnbɛmane tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">A yi a fala, a naxa,<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>“Ɛ luma kitin sɛ tinxintareyani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">han waxatin mundun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">ɛ yi lu muxu ɲaxine rafisɛ bonne xa?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 82:2">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Ɛ xa sɛnbɛtarene nun kiridine xun mayɛngɛ kitin sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">ɛ yi tinxin yiigelitɔne nun muxu ɲaxankataxine xa.<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Ɛ xa sɛnbɛtarene nun tɔrɔ muxune ratanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">ɛ e xunba muxu ɲaxine yii.”<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>“Ɛ mi fe kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">ɛ xaxili mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">ɛ sigan tima dimin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">bɔxɔn bunne birin xuruxurunma.<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>N bata yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">‘Alane nan ɛ tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">Kore Xɔnna Alaa diine nan ɛ birin na.’<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Koni ɛ faxama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">alo adamadiin bonne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">ɛ bira alo kuntigin bonne.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Ala, keli, i fa dunuɲa makiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">bayo i tan nan gbee siyane birin na.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayilaa Ala maxandina e yaxune to yi e tɔrɔma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Sigi sariɲanxina. Asafi a bɛtina.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Ala, i nama i dundu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">Ala, falan ti, i nama i raxara!<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>A mato, i yaxune bata keli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">Naxanye i raɲaxuxi, ne bata murutɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>E feene yitɔnma wundoni i ya yamaan xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">I naxanye ratangaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">e sama e bode fari ne xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>E naxa, “En sa e raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">alogo Isirayila xinla xa tunun dunuɲa yi.”<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>E bata lan a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">e xa e malan i xili ma,<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>Edɔn kaane nun Sumayila bɔnsɔnna muxune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">nun Moyaba kaane nun Hagari kaane<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>nun Gebala kaane nun Amonine nun Amalɛkine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">nun Filisitine e nun Tire kaane.<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Asiriya yamanan fan bata sa e fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">alogo e xa Loti bɔnsɔnna muxune mali.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 83:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>A liga e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">alo i a liga Midiyan kaane ra kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">alo i a liga Sisera nun Yabin na Kison xudeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>E faxa nɛn En-Dɔri yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">e yi kun bɔxɔn fari.<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>A liga e kuntigine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">alo i Orebi nun Sebi liga kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">E mangane birin xa lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">alo Sebaxa nun Salamuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>naxanye yi a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">“Nxu xa Alaa bɔxɔne tongo nxu gbeen na.”<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Ala, e liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">alo wuluwunla na sɛxɛ xarene tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">alo foyen na se dagin xali,<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>alo tɛɛn fɔtɔnna ganma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">alo tɛɛn tema geyane ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>E kedi i ya tule gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">E magaxu i ya foye gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Alatala, e rayagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">han e yi i xinla fen.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>E xa lu yagin nun kuisanni habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">E xa yigitɛgɛ, e raxɔri.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 83:19"/>E xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:19">fa fala i tan Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:19">i tan keden peen nan Kore Xɔnna Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:19">naxan mangayaan ligama dunuɲa birin xun na.<verse eid="PSA 83:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s">Ala Batu Banxini siga bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Koraa diine tantun bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba Gati kaane kondenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">i luden nayabu n yi han!<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Alatalaa banxin xɔnla n na han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">N bɔɲɛn nun n fati bɛndɛn sɛwa bɛtin bama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">Habadan Ala xinla nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Hali tuntunne bata e tɛɛne sa i ya banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">debelenne fan bata na findi e konna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">alogo e diine xa maso i ya saraxa ganden na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">n ma mangan nun n ma Ala.<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">naxanye luma i ya banxini!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">E i matɔxɔma nɛn waxatin birin!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 84:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">naxanye sɛnbɛn kelima i tan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">naxanye xun tixi Ala Batu Banxin na.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>E nɛma danguma Baka lanbanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">mɛnna yi lu e xa alo tigi yirene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">Tule singen na fa, darane yi fe.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>E sɛnbɛn yi siga fari sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">han e yi ti Ala yɛtagi Siyon yi.<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Alatala, Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">n ma maxandi xuiin namɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">Yaxubaa Ala, i tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 84:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Ala, nxɔ mangan mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">nxu yɛ masansan wure lefana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">I ya muxu sugandixin nasuxu!<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Soge kedenna i Batu Banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">na dangu xii wuli keden na yire gbɛtɛ yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">A fisa n xa lu tixi i ya banxin so dɛɛn na gbansan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">benun n xa sabati muxu ɲaxine konne yi.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Marigina Alatala luxi nɛn en xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">alo en ma sogen nun en yɛ masansan wure lefana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">Alatala nan hinanna nun binyen fima en ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">Naxanye sigati kii kamalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">a hɛrin fima nɛn ne ma.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 84:13"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:13">sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:13">naxanye e yigin sama i tan yi.<verse eid="PSA 84:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi en ma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Koraa diine tantun bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Alatala, i bata yi hinan i ya yamanan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">I bata yi Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>I bata yi i ya muxune hakɛne mafelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">i yi e yulubine xafari.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 85:3">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>I bata yi i ya xɔlɔn ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">i yi xɛtɛ i ya xɔlɔ gbeen fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Ala, nxu rakisi muxuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">i mɔn xa nxu sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">I nama fa lu xɔlɛ nxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>I luma xɔlɔxi nxu ma nɛn ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">han habadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">I ya xɔlɔn luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">han mayixɛtɛ nun mayixɛtɛ?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>I mi fa nxu rakisima ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">alogo i ya yamaan mɔn xa sɛwa i ya fe ra?<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Alatala, hinan nxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">i yi nxu rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>N waxi n tuli mati feni Ala ra, Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">A bɔɲɛ xunbenla nan ma fe falama a yamaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">a muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">xa e mi fa xɛtɛ e xaxilitareyaan ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>A fama a yɛɛragaxu muxune rakisideni iki sa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">A binyen yi lu en ma yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Hinanna nun lannayana e bode xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">Tinxinyaan nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla yi rakafu.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Lannayaan sabatima nɛn bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">tinxinna yi godo keli kore.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Alatala hɛrin fima nɛn en ma yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">en ma bɔxɔn sansine yi sabati.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 85:14"/>Tinxinyaan tima nɛn Marigin yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:14">a kirani tɔn a xa.<verse eid="PSA 85:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Dawudaa Ala maxandina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">Alatala, i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">i yi n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">Amasɔtɔ yiigelitɔɔn nun tɔrɔ muxun nan n na.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>N niin natanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">amasɔtɔ n tɔgɔndiyaxi i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">I tan n ma Ala, i ya walikɛɛn nakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">naxan a yigi saxi i tan yi.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>N Marigina, kininkinin n ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">N fɛriɲɛnma i tan nan maxandɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Marigina, i ya walikɛɛn nasɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">amasɔtɔ n na n niin taxuxi i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Marigina, i tan fan! I diɲa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">Naxan na i maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">i hinanma nɛn na ra han!<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Alatala, i tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">n ma mawuga xuiin namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>N nɛma tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">n yi i maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">amasɔtɔ i yabin tima.<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Marigina, ala yo mi luxi alo i tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">I ya wanle ɲɔxɔn mi na.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Marigina, i siyaan naxanye birin daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">ne fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">e yi e xinbi sin i yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">e yi i xinla binya.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Amasɔtɔ i tan gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">i kabanako feene rabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">I tan keden peen nan Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Alatala, i ya kiraan yita n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">alogo n xa sigan ti i ya ɲɔndini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">Na fe keden peen sa n bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">alogo n xa i xinla binya.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Marigina, n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">n ni i tantunma nɛn n bɔɲɛn ma feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">N yi i xinla binya habadan!<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>I bata hinan n na han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">I yi n niin natanga sayaan ma.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Ala, wasodene bata keli n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">gbalotɔ ganla waxi n faxa feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">e miriya yo mi sigama i tan ma.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Koni Marigina, i tan nan Ala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">naxan kininkinin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">i diɲa, i mi xɔlɔn xulɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">i ya hinanna nun i ya lannayaan gbo.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>I yɛɛ rafindi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">i yi hinan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">Sɛnbɛn fi n ma, n tan i ya walikɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">N nakisi, n tan i ya walikɛ ɲaxanla diina.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>A yita n na, a i fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">alogo naxanye n naɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">ne xa a to, e yagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">Amasɔtɔ i tan Alatala bata n mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">i yi n madɛndɛn.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s">Siyane birin yigin Yerusalɛn nin</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Koraa diine tantun bɛtina. Sigi sariɲanxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:1">Ala bata a taan ti Geya Sariɲanxin fari.<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Siyon taan nafan Alatala ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna taane birin xa.<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Muxune Alaa taan matɔxɔma han!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 87:3">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>Ala naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">“N Misiran kaane nun Babilɔn kaane sama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">n kolon muxune fari e nun Filisiti kaane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">nun Tire kaane nun Kusi kaane.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">N yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">“Itoe fan barixi Siyon taan nin.”<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>E a falama nɛn Siyon taan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">fa fala siyani itoe fan barixi mɛnna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">Kore Xɔnna Ala yɛtɛɛn yi a rasabati.<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Alatala na siyane xinle sɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">a a falama nɛn ndee ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">“Itoe fan barixi Siyon taan nin.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 87:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>E bodonma nɛn, e bɛtin ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">E naxa, “Nxu yigin birin i tan nin.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s">Mawugana malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Sigi sariɲanxina. Koraa diine tantun bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa. A xa ba xulenna ra. Esira yixɛtɛna nde Heman ma fala ɲaxumɛna.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Alatala, Ala naxan n nakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">n gbelegbelema i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>N ma maxandi xuiin xa i li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">I tuli mati n ma mawuga xuiin na!<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Tɔrɔ wuyaxi bata n niini li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">sayaan bata maso n na.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>E n yatɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">alo naxanye sigama gaburun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">N fangan birin bata ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>E bata n nabeɲin faxa muxune yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">alo muxu faxaxine gaburun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">alo i bata ɲinan naxanye xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">i mi fa sese ligama naxanye xa.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>I bata n woli ayi bilingan tilinxin na dimi gbeeni.<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>I ya xɔlɔn bata gbo ayi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">i n yigbɛtɛnma i sɛnbɛn na.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 88:8">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>I bata n xɔyine makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">i bata n findi se ɲaxin na e yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">N balanxi, n mi nɔɛ minɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>N yɛɛne bata wasa tɔrɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">n ni i xilima lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Alatala, n na n yiine yibandunma i tan nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>I kabanako feen ligɛ faxa muxune xa ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">Faxa muxune kelɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">e yi i tantun?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 88:11">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Muxuna i ya hinanna fe falɛ gaburun kui ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">I ya lannayana fe falɛ halagi yireni ba?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>I ya kabanako feene toɛ dimini ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">Ɲinan tima binbine xɔn dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">i ya tinxinyaan kolonɲɛ mɛnni ba?<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Alatala, n bata i xili, n mali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">N ni i maxandima xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn.<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Alatala, nanfera i i mɛxi n na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">Nanfera i i yɛtagi luxunxi n ma?<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Xabu n dii ɲɔrɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">n yi tɔrɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">N yi masoxi sayaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">Gaxun bata n yili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">n yigitɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>I ya xɔlɔ gbeen bata godo n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">I n kuisan gbeen naxan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">na bata n halagi.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Kuisanne n nabilinxi waxatin birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">alo fufana, e bata n nabilin yiren birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 88:19"/>I bata n lanfane nun n xɔyine makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:19">N fa dimin nan tun kolon.<verse eid="PSA 88:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nun Dawudaa layirina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Esira yixɛtɛna nde Etani a fala ɲaxumɛna.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>N bɛtin bama nɛn waxatin birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">Alatala hinanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">n yi i ya tinxinna fe fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">mayixɛtɛne nun mayixɛtɛne xa.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>N yi a fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">a i ya hinanna luma nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">a i ya tinxinyaan buma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">alo kore xɔnna.<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>I naxa, “N bata layirin xidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">n ma muxu sugandixin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">n bata n kɔlɔ n ma walikɛɛn Dawuda xa,<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>n naxa, ‘N ni i yixɛtɛne findima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">mangane ra waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">n yi e mangayaan lu han habadan.’ ”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:5">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Alatala, malekan naxanye ariyanna yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">ne tantun bɛtin bama i ya kabanakone fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">e nun i ya tinxinyana fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Alatala, i tan ɲɔxɔn mi na kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">Nde luxi alo Alatala, alane yɛ?<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>Ala magaxu maleka sariɲanxine malanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">naxanye a rabilinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">a makabɛ ne birin yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Alatala, Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">nde luxi alo i tan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">I sɛnbɛn nun i ya tinxinyana i rabilinxi.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>I tan nan fɔxɔ igen sɛnbɛn natima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">a walanne na te, i tan nan e ragodoma.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>I tan nan Misiran halagixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">i tan nan i yaxune raxuya ayi i sɛnbɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>I tan nan gbee kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">I tan nan dunuɲa daxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">e nun a yi seene birin.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>I tan nan kɔmɛn fɔxɔ nun yiifari fɔxɔn daxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">Taboro nun Xerimon geyane sɔnxɔma sɛwani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">i ya fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>I sɛnbɛn gbo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">I fangan magaxu han!<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>I ya mangayaan sɛnbɛ soxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">tinxinyaan nun sariya kɛndɛn nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">Hinanna nun ɲɔndina i kɛwanle birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">naxanye i batuma bɛtini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">e sigan ti kɛnɛnni i yɛtagi, Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>E ɲaxanma nɛn i xinli waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">e i ya tinxinyaan binya.<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>I tan nan findixi e binyen nun e sɛnbɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">i yi nxu xunna keli i ya fanni.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan nxu xun mayɛngɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">nxɔ mangan nan Isirayilaa Ala Sariɲanxin na.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Lɔxɔna nde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">i ya tɔgɔndiya muxune fe toon ti nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">alo xiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">i yi a fala e xa, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">“N bata sɛnbɛn fi sofana nde ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">n bata banxulanna nde sugandi yamaan yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>N bata Dawuda to, n ma walikɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">N yi n ma ture sariɲanxin susan a ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>N ma fangan luma a yi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">n yi a sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>A yaxune mi a nɔɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">tinxintaren mi a rayarabɛ mumɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>N na a yɛngɛfane halagima nɛn a yɛɛ xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">naxanye a raɲaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">n yi ne yɛngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>N ma tinxinna nun n ma hinanna luma nɛn a xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">a sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ n xinli.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>N na a mangayaan nasigama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">han fɔxɔ igena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">a yi nɔɔn ti baane xun na.”<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>“A n xilima nɛn, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">‘I tan nan n Fafe ra, n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">n kantan fanyen naxan n nakisima.’<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>N na a findima nɛn n ma dii singen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">naxan gbo mangane birin xa bɔxɔ xɔnna fari.<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>N hinan a ra habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">N layirin naxan xidi nxu tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">na mi kalɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>N na a yixɛtɛna nde luma nɛn mangayani habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">Fanni kuyen daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">a mangayaan daxi.”<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>“Xa a yixɛtɛne mi tin n ma sariyan suxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">xa e mi bira n ma sariyane fɔxɔ ra,<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>e yi n ma tɔnne kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">e tondi n ma yamarine suxɛ,<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>nayi, n na e murutɛ feene saranma e ra nɛn dunganna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">n yi e ɲaxankata e hakɛne fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>Koni n ma hinanna luma nɛn Dawuda xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">n mi n ma tinxinyaan kalama.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>N mi n ma layirin kalɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">N na a tuli saxi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">n mi na maxɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>N bata n kɔlɔ n ma sariɲanni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">n mi wulen falama Dawuda xa,<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>a yixɛtɛne luma nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">a mangayaan buma nɛn n yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">alo sogena.<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>A buma nɛn mangayani habadan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">alo kikena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">naxan kore xɔnna ma taxamasenna ra waxatin birin.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:38">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Koni i bata i mɛ a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">i yi a masiga i ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">I bata xɔlɔ i ya manga sugandixin ma han!<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>I bata i ya layirin kala i naxan xidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">ɛ nun i ya walikɛɛn tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">I bata a mangaya taxamasenna rabira bɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>I bata a taan yinne birin nabira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">I yi a yire makantanxine findi taa xɔnne ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Dangu muxune birin a muɲama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">a dɔxɔ bodene bata a raɲaxu.<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>I bata a yɛngɛfane sɛnbɛn gbo ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">I yi a yaxune birin nasɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>I bata a yɛngɛ so seene sɛnbɛn ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">I tondi a maliyɛ yɛngɛni.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>I bata a nɔrɔn ba a yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">i yi a mangaya gbɛdɛn nabira bɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>I bata a banxulanyaan waxatini kala a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">i yi a rayagi han!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:46">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Alatala, i mɔn i luxunma nɛn nxu ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">han waxatin mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">I ya xɔlɔn luma gbo ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">alo tɛɛna han waxatin mundun?<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>A xa rabira i ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">a n ma siimayaan mi fa xunkuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">I adamadiine birin daxi nɛn tun ba?<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Nde luma a faxataren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">a yi a yɛtɛ ratanga sayaan ma?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:49">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Marigina, i ya hinanna minɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">naxan yi na nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">i i kɔlɔ naxan na Dawuda xa i ya tinxinni?<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Marigina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">i miri i ya walikɛne yagin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">e nun yamaan naxanye birin goron n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Alatala, i yaxune bata nxu rayagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">e biraxi i ya muxu sugandixin fɔxɔ ra yiren birin.<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 89:53"/>Barikan xa bira Alatala xa habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:53">Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 89:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="ms">Yaburin Yire Naanindena: Keli Sora 90 ma han 106</para>
  <para style="s">Nabi Musaa bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>Nabi Musa, Alaa xɛrana maxandina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">Marigina, i tan nan findixi nxu yigiyaden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">keli waxati danguxine ma han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Benun geyane xa da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">benun bɔxɔ xɔnna nun dunuɲa yɛtɛɛn xa da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">xabu a fɔlɔni, han to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">han habadan i tan nan Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>I tan nan muxune raxɛtɛma bɛndɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">i yi a fala, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">“Adamadiine, ɛ xɛtɛ ɛ kelideni.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Bayo ɲɛɛ wuli kedenna luxi nɛn i yɛɛ ra yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">alo xii keden danguxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">alo kɔɛ kedenna.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>I tan nan muxun niin bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">a dangu alo xɔtɔn ma xixɔnla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">alo sɛxɛn naxan solima.<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>Xɔtɔnni, a ɲingi, a sabati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">ɲinbanna na maso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">a lisi a ra, a xara.<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>I ya xɔlɔna nxu yigitɛgɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">a yi nxu ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>I bata nxu hakɛne sa i yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">I bata nxɔ wundo yulubine birin sa kɛnɛnni.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Nxu siin ɲanma nɛn i ya xɔlɔn bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">Nxu nxɔ siimayaan toon ɲanɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">alo kutunna.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Yanyina nde nxɔ siimayana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ɲɛɛ tonge solofere nan tun a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">Xa a xunkuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">Koni lanbaranna nun tɔrɔn nan ne birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">A ɲanma nɛn xulɛn, nxu faxa.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Nde nɔɛ i ya xɔlɔn sɛnbɛn kolonɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">a yi i binya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">lan i ya xɔlɔn yatɛn ma?<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>Nxu xaran nxɔ siimayaan tɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">alogo nxu xa sigan ti fe kolonni.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Alatala, i ya xɔlɔn ɲanma waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Kininkinin nxu tan i ya konyine ma.<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Nxu ralugo i ya hinanni xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">Nanara, nxu bɛtin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">nxu sɛwa nxu siin birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Nxu bata lu yagini waxati xunkuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">Awa, iki sɛwa ɲɛɛne fi nxu ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">nxu naxan xasabi ligaxi tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Nxu tan i ya konyine xa i ya wali gbeene to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">Nxɔ diine xa i ya binye magaxuxin to.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Marigina nxɔ Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">i ya fanna xa lu nxu xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">Nxɔ wanle rasɔnɔya nxu xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">yandi nxɔ wanle rasɔnɔya nxu xa.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan en yigiya kɛndɛn na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>Naxan na yigiya Kore Xɔnna Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">na bata lu Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna makantanna bun.<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>N na a falama Alatala xa nɛn, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">“N yigiyaden nun n kantan yinna nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">N ma Ala nan i tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">n yigin saxi naxan yi.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>A i ratangama nɛn luti ratixine birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">e nun faxa furene.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>A i ratangama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">i yi i luxun a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">alo tɔxɛ ngana a gabutɛne soma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">a diine xun na kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">A lannayaan yi findi i yɛ masansan wure lefaan na.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>I mi gaxun kɔɛɛn gbalon yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">hanma xalimakunla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">naxanye wolima yanyin na.<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>I mi gaxuɛ fitina furene yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">naxanye i lima dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">hanma fure ɲaxin naxanye faxan tima yanyin na.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Muxu wuli kedenna faxama nɛn i dɛxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">muxu wuli fu yi bira i rabilinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">koni fefe mi ligɛ i tan na.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>I i yɛɛn tima nɛn tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">i yi muxu ɲaxine saranna to.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>N bata n yigiya i tan ma Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">I na Kore Xɔnna Ala findi i luxunden na,<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>fe ɲaxi yo mi i liyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">Gbalo yo mi masoɛ i konna ra.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Ala yamarin fima nɛn a malekane ma i ya fe yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">alogo e xa i kantan i ya sigatiin birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>E yi i tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">alogo i nama i sanna din gɛmɛ yo ra.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>I tima yatane nun saɲine fari nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">I yi yata sɛnbɛmane nun saɲi ɲaxine yibodon.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Ala naxa, “N na kanna rakisima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">bayo a n xanuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">N na ratangama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">bayo a n kolon Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>A na n xili, n na a yabima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">N luma a xɔn ma nɛn tɔrɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">N na a xunbama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">n yi binyen sa a ma.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>N yi siimaya xunkuye faɲin fi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">n yi a yita a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">a n tan nan a rakisima.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Tantun bɛtina. Sigi sariɲanxina. A xa ba Matabu Lɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>A lan Alatala yi tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">Kore Xɔnna Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">a lan bɛtin xa ba i xa,<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>i ya hinanna fe yi fala xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">i ya tinxinna fe yi fala kɔɛ yo kɔɛ,<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>bɛtine yi ba i xa kondenna nun bɔlɔn xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Alatala, i kɛwanle bata n nasɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">N sɛwa bɛtin bama nɛn i ya wanle fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Alatala, i ya wanle gbo de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">I miriyane tilin han!<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>Xaxilitaren mi ito kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">Daxun mi ito famuma.<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Fa fala, muxu ɲaxin kelima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">alo sɛxɛ ɲaxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">fe ɲaxi rabane birin sabatima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">koni habadan halagin nan e yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Amasɔtɔ i tan Alatala nan feen birin xun na habadan.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>I yaxune ni i ra, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">i yaxune ni i ra, e halagima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">Fe ɲaxi rabane birin xuyama ayi nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>I bata n sɛnbɛn gbo ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">alo burunna ɲingena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">i yi ture faɲin susan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>N na n yɛngɛfane yarabixin toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">N na n yaxune wuga xuiin mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Koni tinxin muxune sabatima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">alo tugu binla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">E sɛnbɛn gboma ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">alo suman binle Liban yamanani<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>alo wudin naxanye sixi Alatalaa banxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">E sabatima nɛn en ma Alaa banxini.<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>E mɔn bogima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">hali e to bata kɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">E rafexi igen na, e xinde.<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 92:16"/>Na bata Alatalaa tinxinna yita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:16">A tan nan n kantan fanyen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:16">fe ɲaxi yo mi a tan yi.<verse eid="PSA 92:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan mangan na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Alatala nan mangan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">a rabilinxi nɔrɔn nun fangan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Nanara, bɔxɔn dɔxi ken,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">a mi yigisanma.<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Ala, xabu a fɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">i ya mangayaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">I na yi habadan!<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Alatala, baane e xuini tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">baane e xuini tema han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">Baane bata walanɲɛ ayi.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>Alatala sɛnbɛn gbo kore xɔnna ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">A gbo fɔxɔ igen mɔrɔnne xa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">93.4</char> <char style="fk">Igen mɔrɔnne:</char> alo foyen na so igeni.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">A dangu fɔxɔ igen xunfan gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Alatala, i ya maxadi xuine luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">Sariɲanna lanxi i ya banxin nan ma, han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan birin ma kitisaan na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>Ala naxan gbeeɲɔxɔ tiin na, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">i tan Ala naxan gbeeɲɔxɔ tiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">i xa i yɛtɛ makɛnɛn.<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Dunuɲa kitisana, keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">i yi wasodene saran e kɛwanle ra.<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Alatala, muxu ɲaxine luma ɲaxanɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">han waxatin mundun yi?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Fe ɲaxi rabane e yɛtɛ matɔxɔma kanba falane yi.<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Alatala, e bata i ya muxune yigbɛtɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">E bata i ya yamaan nayarabi.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>E kaɲa gilɛne nun kiridine nun xɔɲɛne faxama.<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>E yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">“Alatala mi nxu toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Yaxubaa Ala mi a ɲɔxɔ luxi a xɔn.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">ɛ tan xaxilitarene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">ɛ tan daxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">ɛ xaxili sɔtɔma waxatin mundun?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>Ala naxan en tunle rafalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">a tan mi fala xuiin mɛma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Ala naxan en yɛɛne rafalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">a tan mi toon tiin ba?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>A tan naxan siyane birin xuruma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">a mi e fe saranma e ra ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">a tan naxan muxune xaranma fe kolonna ma?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Alatala muxune miriyane kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">a sese mi ne ra.<verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Alatala, sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">i naxan xuruma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">i naxan xaranma i ya sariyan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>I matabun fi a ma tɔrɔ lɔxɔne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">han yinli ge muxu ɲaxine yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Alatala mi a muxune rabeɲinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">a mi a mɛma a kɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Kitine mɔn sama nɛn tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">sɔndɔmɛ faɲi kanne birin tinma nɛn na ma.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Nde tiyɛ n xɔn muxu ɲaxine xili ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Nde kelɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">a ti n xɔn fe ɲaxi rabane xili ma?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Xa Alatala mi yi n mali nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">n niin yi bama nɛn mafurɛn!<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>N to yi a falama, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">“N birama nɛn!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">Alatala, i yi n mali i ya hinanni.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>N na kuisan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">i ya hinanna n niin lugoma nɛn sɛwan na.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>I mako mi kitisa tinxintarene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">naxanye muxune ɲaxankatama e tɔnne yi.<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>E e malanma tinxin muxune xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">e yi sɔntarene yalagi, e faxa.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Koni Alatala bata findi n ma faran makantanxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">N ma Ala nan n kantan fanyen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">n nan n luxunma naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>A e hakɛne saranma e ra nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Alatala en ma Ala e raxɔrima nɛn e fe ɲaxine ma.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Ɛ fa, en xa fa sɛwa bɛtin ba Alatala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">En sɔnxɔ sɛwani Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">en kantan fanyena, en nakisimana.<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>En fa a yɛtagi, en barikan bira a xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">En yi a tantun sɛwa bɛtine yi.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan Ala gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">A tan nan manga gbeena alane birin xun na.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>A tan nan gbee bɔxɔn bunne nun geyane xuntagine ra.<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>A tan nan gbee fɔxɔ igen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">bayo a tan nan a daxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">A tan nan bɔxɔ xɔnna rafalaxi.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Ɛ fa, en fa en xinbi sin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">en yi Ala batu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">En xa en xinbi sin Alatala bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">naxan en daxi.<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Amasɔtɔ a tan nan en ma Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">En findixi a yamaan nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">alo a xuruse kurun naxan nabama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Xa ɛ Ala fala xuiin mɛ to,<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>ɛ nama ɛ bɔɲɛni xɔdɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">alo ɛ benbane Meriba yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">alo e naxanye liga na waxatini Masa yi tonbonni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">95.8</char> Na fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 17.7 kui.</note><verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>E n matandi nɛn mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">e yi n mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">hali e to bata yi n kɛwanle to.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>N xɔlɔ na waxati muxune ma ɲɛɛ tonge naanin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">n yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">“Yamani ito bɔɲɛn makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">e mi biraxi n ma kiraan fɔxɔ ra.”<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Nayi, n yi n kɔlɔ n ma xɔlɔni n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">“E mi soɛ n ma matabudeni mumɛ!”<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan mangane birin xun na</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 16.12-33</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Bɛti nɛnɛn xa ba Alatala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Dunuɲa muxune birin xa bɛtin ba Alatala xa.<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Bɛtin xa ba Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">a xinla yi tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">Ɛ yi lu a raliyɛ waxatin birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">fa fala a bata en nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Ɛ a binyena fe fala siyane birin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">ɛ yi a kabanako feene rali muxune birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Alatala gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">a lan a xa matɔxɔ han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">A lan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">a xa binya dangu alane birin na.<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Siyane alane birin findixi ala fuune nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">koni Alatala tan bata koren da.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>A rabilinxi nɔrɔn nun gboon nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">A yire sariɲanxin nafexi sɛnbɛn nun binyen nan na.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Ɛ tan dunuɲa siyane birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">ɛ fa Alatala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">ɛ yi a tantun a binyen nun a sɛnbɛna fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Ɛ fa Alatala tantun a xili binyena fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">Ɛ fa kiseene ra a Batu Banxini.<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>Ɛ Alatala batu a nɔrɔ sariɲanxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">Dunuɲa muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">ɛ xuruxurun a yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>Ɛ yi a fala siyane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">a Alatala nan mangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Nanara, dunuɲa a kiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">a mi yigisanma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Ala siyane makitima tinxinna nin.<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna xa sɛwa han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">Fɔxɔ igen xa a xuini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">e nun seen naxanye a xɔrɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Burunna xa sɛwa e nun a yi seene birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">Fɔtɔnna wudine birin xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani,<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>e sɔnxɔ Alatala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">amasɔtɔ a fama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">A fama nɛn a kitin sa dunuɲa yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">A dunuɲa muxune makitima nɛn tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">a siyane kiti a ɲɔndini.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan keden pe mangan na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Alatala nan mangan na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">Dunuɲa xa ɲaxan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">Ɛ sɛwa ɛ tan fɔxɔ ige tagi bɔxɔne!<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>A rabilinxi kundaan nun dimin nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">A mangayaan sɛnbɛ soxi tinxinyaan nun sariya kɛndɛn nan na.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Tɛɛna a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">naxan a yaxune ganma a rabilinni.<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>A kuyen na a ɲinna masɔxɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">dunuɲa birin yi yalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">Bɔxɔn yi a to a xuruxurun.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Geyane xuyama ayi Alatala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">dunuɲa birin Marigina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">alo kumi dolen na xulun.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Koren xɔnna a tinxinyaan nalima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">siyane birin yi a binyen to.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Suxure batune yagima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">naxanye suxurene matɔxɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">Alane birin e xinbi sinma nɛn a bun.<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Siyon kaane a mɛma nɛn e sɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">Yuda taane yi ɲaxan i ya kiti saxine fe ra, Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Alatala, i tan nan Kore Xɔnna Ala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">dunuɲa birin xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">I tan gbo dangu alane birin na.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Alatala rafan naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">fe ɲaxin xa raɲaxu ne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">A tɔgɔndiya muxune kantanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">a yi e xunba muxu ɲaxine yii.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Kɛnɛnna minima nɛn tinxin muxune xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">muxu sɔndɔmɛ faɲine sɛwama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Ɛ tan naxanye birin tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">ɛ sɛwa Alatala a fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">ɛ a xili sariɲanxin tantun.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan mangan na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Tantun bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">Ɛ bɛti nɛnɛn ba Alatala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">A bata kabanako feene liga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">A en nakisima a sɛnbɛn nun a sariɲanna nan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Alatala bata a marakisin nun tinxinna yita siyane ra.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>A mi ɲinanxi a hinanna nun a tinxinna xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Isirayila yamaan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Bɔxɔn danne birin bata a to</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">a en ma Ala bata en nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Dunuɲa muxune birin xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani Alatala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">Ɛ sɛwaxin yi sɔnxɔ han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">ɛ yi a tantun bɛtini!<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Ɛ tantun bɛtine ba Alatala xa bɔlɔnna ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">Ɛ bɔlɔnna nun tantun bɛti xuini te!<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Ɛ xɔtane nun fenne fe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">Ɛ sɔnxɔ sɛwani mangan xa, Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Fɔxɔ igen xa a xuini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">e nun seen naxanye birin a xɔrɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">Dunuɲa muxune birin xa e xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Baane xa e xuini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">alo yii bɔnbɔ xuina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">Geyane xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani e bode xɔn!<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>E sɛwa Alatala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">amasɔtɔ a fama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">A fama nɛn, a kitine sa dunuɲa yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">A dunuɲa muxune makitima nɛn tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">a siyane kiti a ɲɔndini.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan mangane birin xun na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Alatala nan mangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">Siyane xuruxurunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">A mangaya gbɛdɛn maleka gubugubu kanne tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">Bɔxɔn xuruxurunma.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Alatala gbo Siyon yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">A tan nan siyane birin xun na.<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Birin xa i xinla tantun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">naxan gbo, a magaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">Ala sariɲan han!<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Mangan Ala sɛnbɛn gbo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">Sariya kɛndɛn nafan a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">I tan nan tinxinyaan daxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">I tan nan sariya kɛndɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">nun tinxinna saxi Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Ɛ Alatala batu, en ma Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">Ɛ yi ɛ xinbi sin a manga gbɛdɛn san bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">A sariɲan!<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Nabi Musa nun Haruna yi a saraxaraline yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Samuyɛli yi a maxandi muxune yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">E yi Alatala maxandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">a yi e yabi.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>A yi falan tima e xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">keli kundani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">E yi na maxadi xuine nun tɔnne suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">a yi naxanye soma e yii.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Alatala nxɔ Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">i tan yɛtɛɛn nan yi e yabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">i findi Ala diɲaxin nan na e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">koni i e fe ɲaxine saran e ra nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>Ɛ Alatala en ma Ala batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">ɛ xinbi sin a geya sariɲanxin bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">Amasɔtɔ Alatala en ma Ala sariɲan.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun Bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Tantun bɛtina, barika birana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:1">Dunuɲa muxune birin xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani Alatala xa.<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Ɛ Alatala batu sɛwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">Ɛ fa a yɛtagi, ɛ sɛwa bɛtine ba a xa!<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>Ɛ a kolon a Alatala nan Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">A tan nan en daxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">A tan nan gbee en na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">A yamaan nan en tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">alo a xuruseen naxanye rabama.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>Ɛ nɛma soma a Batu Banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">ɛ barikan bira a xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">Ɛ a tantun a tanden ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">Ɛ a tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">ɛ barikan bira a xa.<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">a hinanna luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">A tinxinyaan luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">habadan han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s">Mangana dɛ xui tongona Ala xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">N bɛtini ito bama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">i ya hinanna nun i ya sariya kɛndɛn nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">Alatala, n tantun bɛtin bama i tan nan xa.<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>N katama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">n xa lu kira kamalixin xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">I fama n fɛma waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">N sigan ti tinxinni n ma banxini.<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>N mi tinɲɛ fe ɲaxin ma mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">N dɛnkɛlɛyatarene kɛwanle raɲaxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">Nxu mi sese malanɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>N mi findɛ tinxintaren na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">N mi fe ɲaxi yo rabɛ.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Naxanye muxune mafalan wundoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">n ne dɛɛn suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">Naxanye muxune matoma a ɲaxin na wasoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">n mi diɲɛ ne ma mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>N na n yɛɛn tima nɛn muxu tɔgɔndiyaxine ra yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">alogo e xa lu n fɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">Naxan na sigan ti tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">na luma nɛn n ma wanla ra.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Yanfanten yo mi luyɛ n konni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">Wule fala yo mi luyɛ n yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">n muxu ɲaxine bama nɛn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">n fe ɲaxi rabane birin kedima nɛn Alatalaa taani.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔ muxuna Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Tɔrɔ muxuna Ala maxandina sɔxɔlɛni, a a mawuga Alatala xa.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Alatala, i tuli mati n ma maxandin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">I n ma mawuga xuiin namɛ!<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>I nama i yɛtagin luxun n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">n nɛma tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">I tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">N na i xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">n yabi mafurɛn!<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Amasɔtɔ, n siin ɲanmatɔɔn ni i ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">alo tutina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">N fatin ganma alo tɛɛ wolonna.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>N bɔɲɛn xaraxi alo sɛxɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">Donse xɔli mi fa n na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Kutunna bata n doyen.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>N bata liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">alo toxorona tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">alo kutunxunban taa xɔnni.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>N mi xima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">N bata lu yɛɛ radunduni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">alo xɔliin banxin fari.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>N yaxune n konbima fɛriɲɛn gbɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">e fala xɔlɛn ti n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">e n xinla findi danga ti seen na.<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>N xube fuɲin nan donma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">N yɛɛgen bata basan n min igen na.<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Amasɔtɔ i ya xɔlɔna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">i bata n tongo i yi n woli ayi.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>N siin ɲanmatɔɔn ni i ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">alo nininna ɲinbanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">N bata liga alo sɛxɛ xarena.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Koni Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">i tan nan mangan na habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">Mayixɛtɛne nun mayixɛtɛne i ya fe falama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>I kelima nɛn i kininkinin Siyon taan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">I diɲa waxatin bata a li a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">Waxati saxi yɛtɛɛn ni ito ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Hali taani ito gɛmɛne rafan nxu tan i ya walikɛne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">A gbangbanna yɛtɛɛn kininkininna nxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Siyane birin gaxuma Alatala yɛɛ ra nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">Dunuɲa mangane birin yi gaxu i ya binyen yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>Alatala mɔn na Siyon ti waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">a yi a yɛtɛ makɛnɛn a binyeni.<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>A a yɛɛ ra findi muxu ramɛxine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">a yi a tuli mati e maxandi xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Na xa sɛbɛ mayixɛtɛ famatɔne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">alogo yama famatɔɔn xa Alatala matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>Alatala bata a yɛɛ ragodo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">keli a yire sariɲanxini kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">A bata a yɛɛ ragodo dunuɲa ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">keli ariyanna yi.<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>Muxun naxanye kasoon na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">a bata ne kutun xuine mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">A bata na muxu yalagixine xɔrɔya,<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>alogo e xa Alatala xinla fala Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">e yi a tantun Yerusalɛn taani,<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>siyane nun yamanane birin na e malan waxatin naxan yi Alatala batudeni.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>Marigin bata n sɛnbɛn ɲan n ma siimayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">a yi n siin ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>N yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">“N ma Ala, i nama n faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">N munma fori. I tan luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>I bɔxɔ xɔnna da nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">xabu a fɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">I yii fɔxɔn nan kore xɔnna ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>Ne birin danguma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">koni i tan luma nɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">Ne birin forima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">e kala alo dugina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">i yi e masara.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Koni i tan luma nɛn i kiini waxatin birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">I ya siimayaan mi ɲanɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 102:29"/>Nxu tan i ya walikɛne diine luma nɛn i fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:29">e yixɛtɛne fan yi sabati i yɛtagi.”<verse eid="PSA 102:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa hinanna</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">N xa Alatala tantun n niin birin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">N xa a xili sariɲanxin tantun n bɔɲɛn ma feu!<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>N xa Alatala tantun n niin birin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">N nama ɲinan a wali faɲi yo xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>A tan nan n mafeluma n hakɛn birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">A tan nan n nakɛndɛyama furen birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>A tan nan n natangama sayaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">a yi n nakamali hinanna nun kininkininni.<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>A tan nan siimaya faɲin fima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">alogo n mɔn xa fangan sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">alo singbinna.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Alatala tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">a tan nan kiti kɛndɛn sama muxu ɲaxankataxine xa.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>A bata a feene yita Nabi Musa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">a yi a kɛwanle yita Isirayila yamaan na.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Alatala kininkinin, a diɲa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">A mi xɔlɔn xulɛn. A hinanna gbo.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>A xɔlɔxin mi en mafalɛ yɛyɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">A mi luyɛ xɔlɔxi han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>A mi en suxuma en yulubine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">A mi en saranma en hakɛne ra.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>A hinanna gbo a yɛɛragaxu muxune yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">alo kore xɔnna makuya bɔxɔ xɔnna ra kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>A bata en yulubine ba en ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">a yi e makuya en na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">alo sogeteden nun sogegododen tagi kuya kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Alatala kininkininma a yɛɛragaxu muxune ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">alo fafan kininkininma a diine ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>A en da kiin kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">a kolon fa fala en kelixi bɛndɛn nin.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Muxuna siimayaan luxi nɛn alo sɛxɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">a sabatima nɛn alo sɛxɛ fugena,<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>koni foye wolonna na sa a ma a xara ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">a yi ɲan hali a funfuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">a mi luma na.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Koni Alatalaa hinanna luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">a yɛɛragaxu muxune xa habadan han habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">A tinxinna yi lu e diine diine xa,<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>xa e a layirin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">e yi e miri a fe ragidixine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">alogo e xa e rakamali.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Alatala bata a mangaya gbɛdɛn nafala kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">A tan nan mangayani seene birin xunna.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun, ɛ tan malekane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">Ɛ tan naxanye sɛnbɛ kanne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">naxanye a falane ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">naxanye a fala xuine suxuma.<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">ɛ tan a ganle kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">ɛ tan, a walikɛɛn naxanye a sagoon ligama.<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">ɛ tan a dali seene birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">ɛ na lu dɛdɛ a mangayaan bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">N xa Alatala tantun n niin birin na!<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s">Daala Mangan tantun fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>N xa Alatala tantun n niin birin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Alatala n ma Ala, i tan gbo de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">I tan marabɛri baxi nɔrɔn nun gboon nan na.<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>A bata a yɛtɛ rabilin kɛnɛnna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">alo doma gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">A yi kore xɔnna yifulun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">alo sɛnkɛna.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>A bata a banxin ti igene fari kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">a yi kundane findi a masiga ti wontoron na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">a sigan tiin foyen nin.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>A foyen findi a xɛraan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">a tɛɛn findi a walikɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>A bɔxɔn bɛtɛn sa ki faɲi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">A mi yigisanɲɛ mumɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>I bata tilinna radin bɔxɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">alo domana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">igene yi te han geyane xuntagi.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Koni e yi e gi i ya xɔlɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">e yi e gi i ya galanna xuiin ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>E yi godo lanbanne yi keli geyane ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">han i yiren naxan yitɔnxi e xa.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>I yi naninna sa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">e mi danguɛ naxan na mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">alogo e nama fa sa bɔxɔn xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>I tigi igene ragima xude wunle xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">dangu geya longonne ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>Burunna subene birin fa e minma mɛnna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">burunna sofanle fan yi fa min xɔnla ba na yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Xɔline e tɛɛne sama xude dɛɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">e yi sɔnxɔɛ wudine kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>A yi tulen nafa geyane fari keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">i kɛwanle yi bɔxɔni li.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>A yi sɛxɛn namini xuruseene xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">e nun sansine muxune xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">alogo e xa balon sɔtɔ bɔxɔni,<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>e nun manpaan naxan e rasɛwama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">e nun turen naxanye e fatin nayabuma ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">e nun donseen naxanye e sɛnbɛ soma.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Hali Alatalaa wudi binle fan igen sɔtɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">e makoon naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">Liban yamanan suman wudine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">Ala naxanye sixi.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Xɔlidine e tɛɛne sama mɛnna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">Xɔli xungbene fan yi e tɛɛne sa na fɔfɔ binle yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Xɛnle fan luma geya matexine fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">fanye ra siine yi e luxun gɛmɛ yinle ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>I bata kiken da waxatine yatɛ feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">Sogena a godo waxatin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>I dimin da alogo kɔɛɛn xa so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">burunna subene birin e masiga tima waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Yata sɛnbɛmane wurundunma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">e balon fendeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">e e balon maxɔdinma Ala ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Sogen na te waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">e mɔn yi xɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">e sa e sa e yinle ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Nayi, muxune yi mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">e siga e wanle ra han ɲinbanna ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Alatala, i kɛwanle gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">I ne birin daxi fe kolonna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Bɔxɔn nafexi i ya dali seene nan na.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Fɔxɔ igen mato, a gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">Niimaseen sifan birin a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">a xurin nun a xungbena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">naxanye mi nɔɛ yatɛ kɔnin.<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>Kunkine sigama a tan nan xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">E nun ige yi sube magaxuxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">i naxan daxi alogo e xa sabaan so a yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>E birin yengi i tan nan ma donse feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">e makoon na bira a ma waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>I donseen soma e yii nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">e yi a don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">I donseen so e yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">han e yi wasa.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>I na i xun xanbi so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">e yigitɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">I na e niin ba, e yi faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">E xɛtɛ bɛndɛni e kelixi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Koni i na niin bira e yi waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">e da, seen birin yi findi a nɛnɛn na bɔxɔn fari.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Alatalaa binyen xa lu habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Alatala xa sɛwa a kɛwanle fe ra!<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>Ala na bɔxɔn mato, a xuruxurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">A na a yiin din geyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">e tutin yi mini.<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Fanni n nan n nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">n bɛtin bama nɛn Alatala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">N tantun bɛtin bama n ma Ala xa nɛn n siin birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>N ma bɛtin xa a kɛnɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">Amasɔtɔ n ma sɛwan kelima Alatala nin.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Ala xa yulubi kanne ɲan bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Ala xa muxu ɲaxine ratunu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">N xa Alatala tantun n niin birin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Tantunna Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nun a yamana fe</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 16.8-22</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun. Ɛ yi a maxandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">A bata naxan liga, ɛ na fala siyane xa.<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>Ɛ bɛtin ba a xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">ɛ yi a tantun bɛtine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">ɛ yi a kabanako feene birin fala.<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Ɛ ɛ kanba a xili sariɲanxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">Naxanye birin Alatala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">ne xa sɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>Ɛ ɛ yɛɛ rafindi Alatala nun a sɛnbɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">ɛ lu a fenɲɛ waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5"/>A wali faɲin naxanye ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">e nun a kabanako feene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">nun a kitin naxanye saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">ne fe xa rabira ɛ ma,<verse eid="PSA 105:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6"/>ɛ tan Iburahima bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">a walikɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">ɛ tan Yaxubaa diine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">Ala naxanye sugandixi.<verse eid="PSA 105:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>A tan nan Alatala ra, en ma Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">A tan nan bɔxɔn birin kitisaan na.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>A ɲɔxɔ luma a layirin xɔn ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">han habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">e nun a falane fe han mayixɛtɛ wuli keden,<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>e nun a layirin naxan xidi e nun Iburahima tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">a yi a kɔlɔ Isiyaga xa.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>A mɔn yi a ragidi Yaxuba ma sariyan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">a findi habadan layirin na Isirayila kaane xa.<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>A naxa, “N Kanan yamanan soma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">ɛ nun i yixɛtɛne yii ɛ kɛɛn na.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>E mi yi wuya nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">Xɔɲɛ dando nan tun yi e ra na yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>E yi kelima nɛn siyana nde yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">e siga nde gbɛtɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">e keli yamanana nde yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">e siga nde gbɛtɛ yi.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Koni a mi tinɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">muxu yo xa e ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">A mangane rakolon nɛn e fe yi, a naxa,<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>“Ɛ nama fefe liga n ma muxu sugandixine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">Ɛ nama fefe ɲaxi liga n ma nabine ra.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>Ala yi fitina kamɛn naso e yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">a yi e donseen birin ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>Koni Ala yi xɛmɛna nde rasiga a yamaan yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Yusufu nan yi na ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">naxan mati konyiyani.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>E yi yɔlɔnxɔnna sa a sanne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">e wuren bira a kɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>Han na waliyiya falane yi kamali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">a naxanye ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">Alatalaa falan yi a yita</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">a a ɲɔndi.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Nanara, mangan yi a beɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">naxan yi siyane xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">na yi a xɔrɔya.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>A yi Yusufu lu a yamanan xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">A yi lu mangan yii seene birin xun na,<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>alogo a xa a kuntigine matinxin a waxɔnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">a yi na fonne xaran fe kolonna ma.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Nayi, Isirayila yi fa Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Yaxuba yi dɔxɔ Xami bɔnsɔnna yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>Ala yi dii wuyaxi fi a muxune ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">E sɛnbɛn yi gbo ayi dangu e yaxune ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>A yi Misiran muxune bɔɲɛn masara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">Isirayila yamaan yi raɲaxu e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">E yi a walikɛne ɲaxankata feni tɔn.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>A yi a walikɛɛn Musa rasiga e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">e nun Haruna, a naxan sugandixi.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>E yi Alaa taxamaseri magaxuxine liga e yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">e a kabanako fe wanle kɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">Xami bɔnsɔnna yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>Ala yi dimin naso na yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">E mi yi nɔɛ na yamarin matandɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>A yi e igene findi wunla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">e yɛxɛne birin yi faxa.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>E yamanan birin yi findi xunɲɛne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">Mangana banxin birin yi rafe xunɲɛne ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>Ala yi xɛnne nun sosone yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">e yi mini yamanan birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>A yi balabalan kɛsɛne ragodo e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">Galanna yi godo a yamanan birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>Ala yi e manpa binle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">105.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">a yi yamanan wudine birin magira.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>A yi tuguminne fan yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">e yi fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">suɲɛn naxanye mi yi nɔɛ yatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>E yi yamanan se ɲingine birin don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">E yi e donseen birin don.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Ala yi e dii singene birin faxa yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">naxanye findixi e yixɛtɛ sɛnbɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>A yi Isirayila yamaan namini Misiran yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">e gbetin nun xɛmaan xali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">muxu yo mi bira e bɔnsɔnne yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Misiran kaane yi sɛwa e keli feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">bayo e yi gaxuxi e yɛɛ ra han!<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Ala yi kundaan so a muxune xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">N yi tɛɛ dɛgɛn ti e yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">alogo a xa e lu kɛnɛnni.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>E Ala maxɔdin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">a yi dɔmɛne nun donseene ragodo e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">keli kore, e lugo.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>A yi fanyen bɔ, igen yi mini a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">a yi godo tonbonni alo xude wunla,<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>bayo a fala sariɲanxina fe rabira nɛn a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">a naxan ti Iburahima xa, a walikɛna.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>A yi a yama sugandixin namini Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">e ɲaxan, e sɔnxɔ sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>A yi siya gbɛtɛne bɔxɔn so e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">e yama gbɛtɛne wali xɔnna sɔtɔ e kɛɛn na,<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>alogo e xa a tɔnne suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">e yi a sariyan birin suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa fanna a muxune xa</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 16.34-36</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">Ɛ Alatala tantun amasɔtɔ a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Nde nɔɛ Alatalaa wali gbeene birin ma fe falɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Nde nɔɛ tantunna birin fiyɛ a ma?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">naxanye a sariyane suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">naxanye fe tinxinxin ligama waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Alatala, i nɛma i ya yamaan maliyɛ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">i xaxili lu n xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">I yi n fan mali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">i nɛma e rakisɛ waxatin naxan yi,<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>alogo n xa i ya yama sugandixin sabatixin to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">alogo nxu nun i ya muxune xa sɛwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">nxu bode xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">nxu birin yi nxu yɛtɛ matɔxɔ sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Nxu bata yulubin liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">alo nxu benbane a liga kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">Nxu bata hakɛne nun fe ɲaxine raba.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Nxu benbane to yi Misiran yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">ne mi yi i ya kabanako fe wanle yatɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">E ɲinan nɛn na waxatine birin xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">i yi hinanma e ra waxatin naxanye yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">E yi murutɛ Gbala Baan dɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Koni a yi e rakisi a xili binyena fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">alogo a sɛnbɛ gbeena fe xa kolon.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>A yi falan ti Gbala Baan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">a yi xara ken!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">A yi e ragidi igen tilinxi yire xareni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">alo tonbonna.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>Ala yi e rakisi na muxune ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">naxanye yi e raɲaxuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">A yi e xunba e yaxune yii.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>E yɛngɛ faane yi faxa igeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">Muxu yo mi lu.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Nayi, e yi la a fala xuine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">e yi tantun bɛtine ba a xa.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Koni Ala naxan ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">e ɲinan na xɔn mafurɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">e mi a mamɛ a yi feene rakamali,<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>Xɔɔyin yi e suxu tonbonni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">e yi Ala bunba bɔxɔ xareni.<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>E naxan maxɔdin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">Ala yi na so e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">koni a yi furen fan nafa e ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>E yi Nabi Musa maxɔxɔlɔn fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">e nun Haruna naxan nasariɲanxi Alatala xa.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Bɔxɔn dɛɛn yi rabi a Datan gerun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">A yi Abirami nun a muxune yɛ maluxun.<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Tɛɛn yi e ganla gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">a yi muxu ɲaxine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>E yi xɛmaan nafala ɲinge dii sawura suxuren na Horebe Geyaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">e yi seen batu naxan nafalaxi wuren na.<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>E yi Ala binyen masara ɲinge dii sawuran na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">naxan sɛxɛn donma.<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>E ɲinan Ala xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">naxan e rakisixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">naxan wali gbeene kɛ Misiran yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>A kabanako feene liga Xami bɔnsɔnna yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">e nun fe magaxuxine Gbala baani.<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>Ala yi a fala a e raxɔrima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">fɔ a muxu sugandixin Musa a ti a yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">alogo a xa xɛtɛ a xɔlɔn fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">alogo a nama e birin halagi.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Awa, e yi e mɛ na bɔxɔ faɲin fan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">amasɔtɔ e mi yi laxi a falan na.<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>E yi lu a mafalɛ e bubune kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">E mi Alatalaa falan namɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Nanara, a yi a kɔlɔ e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">a e luma nɛn tonbonni e faxa,<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>a yi e yixɛtɛne raxuya ayi siyane yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">a yi e raxuya ayi yamanane yi.<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Alaa yamaan Baali-Peyori li waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">e yi saraxane don</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">naxanye yi bama ala fuune xa.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>E kɛwanle yi Ala raxɔlɔ e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">fure ɲaxin yi godo e ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Koni Finexasi yi keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">a yi na feen dan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">na furen yi dangu.<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Ala yi na yatɛ tinxinna ra a xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">waxati famatɔne yi han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>E yi Ala raxɔlɔ Meriba igene dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">Musa yi tɔrɔn sɔtɔ e fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>E yi a liga Musa xɔlɔxin yi falan ti xaxilitareyani.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>E mɔn mi siya gbɛtɛne faxa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">Alatala tɔnna sa naxanye fe yi.<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>E yi basan siyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">e yi lu e namunne ligɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>E yi e suxurene batu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">Na nan findi e rabira xunna ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>E yi e dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne ba saraxane ra ɲinanne xa.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>E diidine faxa naxanye mi fefe kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">E ne ba saraxane ra Kanan suxure kidene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">bɔxɔn yi xɔsi na faxane fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>E yi e yɛtɛ xɔsi e kɛwanle xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">E suxure feene yi lu alo yalunyana Ala mabinni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">106.39 </char>Na luxi nɛn alo yalunyana Ala yɛɛ ra yi bayo Ala waxi a yamaan xa tinxin a xa alo ɲaxanla lan a xa tinxin a xɛmɛn xa kii naxan yi. </note><verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>Nanara, Alatala yi xɔlɔ a yamaan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">E yi raɲaxu a ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>A yi e rabeɲin siyane yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">e yi raɲaxu naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">ne yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ e xun na.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>E yaxune yi e ɲaxankata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">e yi e rayarabi e sɛnbɛni.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>A yi a muxune xunba sanɲa ma wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">koni e yi lu murutɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">e lu kankanɲɛ e hakɛne ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Koni, a to e wuga xuiin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">a yi e tɔrɔyaan to.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>A yi a miri a layirina fe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">A yi diɲa a hinanna a fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>Ala yi a liga a naxanye a yamaan suxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:46">ne yi kininkinin e ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Alatala nxɔ Ala, nxu rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">I mɔn xa fa nxu ra keli siya gbɛtɛne yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">alogo nxu xa i xili sariɲanxin tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na yi findi nxu kanba xunna ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Barikan xa bira Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Isirayilaa Ala habadan han habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Yamaan birin xa a ratin “Amina.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Tantunna Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="ms">Yaburin Yire Suulundena: Keli Sora 107 ma han 150</para>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun bayo a fan</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun bayo a fan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Alatala ɛ tan naxanye birin xunbaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">ɛ a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">a ɛ tan naxanye xunbaxi ɛ yaxune yii,<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>a faxi ɛ tan naxanye ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">sa keli yamana gbɛtɛne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">sa keli sogeteden nun sogegododen binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">e nun kɔmɛn fɔxɔn nun yiifari fɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Ndee bata yi lɔ ayi tonbon magaxuxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">e mi yi fa kiraan toma siga taani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">muxune dɔxi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Kamɛn nun min xɔnla yi e suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">e yigitɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Awa, e yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">e yi e xui ramini Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">a yi e xunba e tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>A yi ti e yɛɛ ra siga kira tinxinxin xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">A siga e ra taani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">muxune dɔxi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>E xa Alatala tantun a hinanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">e nun a kabanako feen naxanye ligaxi e xa.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>A min xɔnla bama muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">a yi kamɛtɔne ralugo donse faɲine ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Ndee yi dimin nun bɔɲɛ rafɔrɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">e ɲaxankataxin xidixi yɔlɔnxɔnna ra kasoon kui.<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>Amasɔtɔ e bata yi murutɛ Alaa falane ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">e mi yi Kore Xɔnna Alaa maxadi xuine suxi.<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>Tɔrɔn yi e xadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">e dagalanɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">muxu yo mi e mali.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Awa, e yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">e yi e xui ramini Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">a yi e rakisi tɔrɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>A yi e ba dimin nun bɔɲɛ rafɔrɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">A yi e yɔlɔnxɔnne yibolon.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>E xa Alatala tantun a hinanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">e nun a kabanako feen naxanye ligaxi e xa.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>A wure dɛɛne gira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">a yi wure gbelemɛne kala.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Xaxilitaren nan yi ndee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">E yi tɔrɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">e matandine nun e hakɛne nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>E na donseen to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">e bɔɲɛ masiga ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">E yi maso sayaan na.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Awa, e yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">e yi e xui ramini Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">a yi e rakisi tɔrɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>A yi falan ti, a e rakɛndɛya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">A yi e ratanga gaburun ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>E xa Alatala tantun a hinanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">e nun a kabanako feen naxanye ligaxi e xa.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>E xa barika bira saraxane ba Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">e yi a wali faɲine fe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">e sɔnxɔ sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Ndee yi siga fɔxɔ igen xun ma kunkin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">e yulayaan naba fɔxɔ igen xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>E yi Alatalaa wanle to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">a kabanako feene liga tilinna xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>A yi foye gbeen yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">a yi fa fɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">Fɔxɔ igen yi walanɲɛ ayi.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Igen mɔrɔnne yi lu kunkini tɛ pon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">a mɔn yi lu a ragodɛ tilinna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">E bata yi kɔntɔfili, e yigitɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>E xun yi magi e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">e dagalanɲɛ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">alo muxun na a min.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">E kɔtɛn birin yi findi fe fuun na.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Awa, e yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">e yi e xui ramini Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">A yi e ba e tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>A yi a liga foye gbeen yi a raxara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">Walanna yi a raxara fɔlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Fɔxɔ igen to a raxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">e yi sɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">A yi fa e ra e sodeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">e yi waxi dɛnaxan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>E xa Alatala tantun a hinanna fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">e nun a kabanako feen naxanye ligaxi e xa.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>E xa a batu yamaan malanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">E mɔn xa a matɔxɔ fonne malanni.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>A tan nan baane masarama tonbonna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">a yi tigine findi bɔxɔ xaren na.<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>A bɔxɔ faɲin findi bɔxɔ kalaxin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">fɔxɔn dɛnaxan yi na kaane ɲaxuyana fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>A mɔn yi tonbonna maxɛtɛ daraan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">a yi bɔxɔ xaren findi tigi yiren na.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>A yi fa kamɛtɔne ra, e dɔxɔ na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">e taan ti e luyɛ dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>E yi xɛɛne bi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">e manpa binle si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">e yi tɔnɔ gbeen sɔtɔ e yi.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>A yi a yamaan baraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">e yi wuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">a mi tin se yi ba e ɲingene ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>A yamaan yatɛn to xurun fɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">e rayarabin nun tɔrɔn nun ɲaxankatan bun,<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>a yi na kuntigine raɲaxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">naxanye a yamaan lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">e siga wulaan xun xɔn kira mi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Koni a yi tɔrɔ muxune ba e tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">a yi e denbayane rawuya ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">alo e xuruseene.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Tinxin muxune yi na to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">e sɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">koni muxu ɲaxine yi e dundu.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Naxan na findi xaxilimaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">a xa a yengi lu feni itoe birin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">a yi Alatalaa hinanna kolon.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra lan yaxune fe ma</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 57.8-12 nun Yaburin 60.7-14</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina. Sigi sariɲanxina.<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Ala, n ma binyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">n xaxili ragidixi yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">N bɛtin bama nɛn, n yi i tantun!<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>N xulunma nɛn sinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">n yi n ma bɔlɔnna nun kondenna maxa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">N kurunma bɛtin bɛ nɛn subaxa!<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Alatala, n ni i tantunma nɛn siyane yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">N bɛtin bama i xa nɛn bɔnsɔnne tagi.<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>I ya hinanna gbo han ariyanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">I ya lannayaan texi han kore xɔnna.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">i ya binyen xa mayita kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">a yi bɔxɔn nafe!<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>I xanuntenne xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">i yi e rakisi i sɛnbɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">I yi n yabi.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Ala bata falan ti a yire sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">a naxa, “N nɔɔn tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">n Siken taani taxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">n yi Sukɔti lanbanna danne sa.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>N tan nan gbee Galadi bɔxɔn nun Manase ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Efirami kaane findixi n ma yɛngɛsone nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Yuda luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">alo n ma mangaya dunganna.<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Koni n ma konyin nan Moyaba yamanan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">N tan nan Edɔn yamanan kanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">N yɛngɛ sɔnxɔni tema Filisiti yamanani.”<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Ala, nde sigama n na na taa makantanxini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Nde tima n yɛɛ ra siga Edɔn yi?<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Ala, i tan xa mi i mɛxi nxu ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">I mi fa nxɔ ganla fɔxɔ ra sɔnɔn ba?<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Nxu mali yaxune yɛngɛdeni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">Sese mi adamana maliin na.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 108:14"/>Koni Ala na lu en xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:14">en nɔɔn sɔtɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:14">A tan nan en yaxune halagima.<verse eid="PSA 108:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔ muxuna mawugana</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:1">Ala, n naxan tantunma, i nama lu dunduxi!<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>Amasɔtɔ muxu ɲaxine nun wuledene n mafalama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">E wulene sama n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>E mɔn fala ɲaxine tima lan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">E n yɛngɛma na kiini fuu!<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>N tan e xanuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">e tan n tɔɲɛgɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">Koni n tan Ala maxandima.<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>E n ma fe faɲin saranma fe ɲaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">e n ma xanuntenyaan saran xɔnnantenyaan na.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>E a falama n ma e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">“Gbalo feen xa sa a xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">muxuna nde yi a tɔɲɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>A na makiti, a yi yalagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">A Ala maxandi xuine yi yatɛ hakɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Ala xa a siin ɲan mafurɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">muxu gbɛtɛ yi a tiden tongo.<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Ala xa a diine findi kiridine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">a ɲaxanla yi findi kaɲa gilɛn na!<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Ala xa a diine findi sigatine nun xandi tiine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">e yi makuya e banxi xɔnne ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Ala xa a doli faan siga a yii seene birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">xɔɲɛne yi a wali xɔnne birin tongo.<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Ala xa muxe nama fa hinan a ra sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">hanma muxe yi e yengi dɔxɔ a kiridine xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Ala xa a yixɛtɛne birin halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">e xinle yi lɔ ayi habadan.<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Alatala xa a xaxili lu a benbane hakɛne xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">Alatala nama a nga yulubine xafari mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Alatala xa a yengi lu e hakɛne xɔn ma waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">koni Ala xa ɲinan xa ti e fe xɔn ma fefe!<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Bayo xɛmɛni ito mi findixi hinanten na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">a yi yiigelitɔne nun tɔrɔ muxune ɲaxankatama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">han a yi muxu sunuxin faxa.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Danga tiin yi rafan a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">Ala xa ne raxɛtɛ a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">A mi yi rafan a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">a xa duba muxe xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">Ala xa duban masiga a ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>A yi rabilinxi a danga xuine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">alo a dugina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">Ala xa a gbee dangana a li</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">alo igena a fatin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">e nun alo turena a xɔnne yi.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>A dangane xa lu a fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">alo a dugina a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">E lu a ma waxatin birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">alo a tagi xidina.”<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Alatala xa n tɔɲɛgɛ muxune saran na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">e nun naxanye n mafalama.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Awa, Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">n mali i xili binyena fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">Amasɔtɔ i ya hinanna gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">n xunba.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Yiigelitɔɔn nun tɔrɔ muxun nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">n niin sunuxi.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>N tununmaan ni i ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">alo nininna ɲinbanna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">E n kedima alo suɲɛna.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>N xinbi xudine bata tuyɛ ayi sun suxuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">N bata doyen, n xɔsi.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>E na n to, e yi e xunni maxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">e n magele.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Alatala n ma Ala, n mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">i n nakisi i ya hinanni,<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>alogo e xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">a i tan Alatala nan na ligaxi i sɛnbɛni.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>E tan n dangama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">i tan yi barakan sa n ma fe yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">E na keli n xili ma, e yagima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">n tan, i ya walikɛɛn yi sɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Ala xa n tɔɲɛgɛ muxune yalagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">Ala xa yagin so e xunna alo dugina.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>N nan n xuini tema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">n na Alatala tantun han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">N yi a matɔxɔ yamani.<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Amasɔtɔ a keli nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">a ti tɔrɔ muxun xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">a yi a rakisi a yalagi muxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa manga sugandixina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">Alatalaa falan ni ito ra n marigin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">a naxa, “Dɔxɔ n yiifanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">han n yi i yaxune sa i sanna bun ma.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Alatala xa i ya mangayaan sɛnbɛn gbo ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">fɔlɔ Siyon ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">i yi i yaxune nɔ i rabilinni.<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>I na i ya ganla xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">i ya yamana a sɔbɛ soma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">I ya banxulanne yi fa i ma xunna kenla nun sariɲanni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">alo xiila subaxani.<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Alatala bata a kɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">a mi a xuiin maxɛtɛma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">“Saraxaraliin nan i ra habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">alo Mɛlikisedeki yi kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Marigina i xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">Xa a xɔlɔ lɔxɔn naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">a mangane halagima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>A siyane makitima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">binbine yi lu yiren birin yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">A dunuɲa mangane birin nɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Mangana a minma nɛn xudeni kira yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">a xunna keli.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">N na Alatala tantunma nɛn n bɔɲɛn ma feu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">muxu faɲine nun yamaan yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Alatala kɛwanle gbo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">E rafan naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">ne maɲɔxɔnma e ma.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>A kɛwanle magaxu, e gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">A tinxinyaan luma nɛn habadan.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>A bata a kabanako feene rabira en ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Alatala diɲa, a kininkinin.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>A balon fima nɛn a yɛɛragaxu muxune ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">A mi ɲinanma a layirin xɔn mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>A bata a sɛnbɛn yita a muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">a yi xɔɲɛne bɔxɔn so e yii.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Ɲɔndin nun sariya kɛndɛna a kɛwanle yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">Lannayana a fe ragidixine birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>E na waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">lannayaan nun tinxinna nan e ra.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>A bata a muxune xɔrɔya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">a yi habadan layirin xidi e xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">A xinla sariɲan, a magaxu.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Fe kolonna fɔlɔma Alatala yɛɛragaxun nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Xaxilimaan nan ne ra naxanye na ligama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Tantunna a xa habadan!<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s">Muxu faɲina sɛwana fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">naxan gaxuma Alatala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">a yamarine yi rafan a ma.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>A diine sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma nɛn yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">Muxu faɲine yixɛtɛne duban sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>E hɛrin nun nafunla sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">e sabatima nɛn tinxinyani habadan.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Kɛnɛnna tima nɛn muxu faɲine ma dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">naxanye kininkinin e mɔn tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>A lan muxune xa donla so fonisireyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">a yi a feene raba tinxinni.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Bayo tinxin muxun mi tantanɲɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">Yamaan mi ɲinanɲɛ a fe xɔn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>A mi gaxun xibaru ɲaxina fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">A xaxili ragidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">a yigi saxi Alatala nan fari.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>A bɔɲɛn mi xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">a mi gaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">Dɔnxɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">a a yaxune biraxin toma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>A tan nan tɔrɔ muxune kima fonisireyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">A tinxinyaan luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">A sɛnbɛn xun masama nɛn binyeni.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Muxu ɲaxin na na to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">a xɔlɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">a sunu, a yi a ɲinna raxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">Muxu ɲaxin waxɔn feene kalama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan tɔrɔ muxune malima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Ɛ tan Alatalaa walikɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">ɛ a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">ɛ Alatala xinla matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Alatala xinla xa tantun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">fɔlɔ iki ma han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>Sa fɔlɔ sogeteden mabinna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">han sa dɔxɔ sogegododen binna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">birin xa Alatala xinla matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Alatala nan siyane birin xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">A binyen tema han kore xɔnna.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Nde luxi alo Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">a tan naxan dɔxi ariyanna yi,<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>a tan naxan a yigodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:6">a kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna mato?<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>A sɛnbɛtarene rakelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">a tɔrɔ muxune ba e tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>A yi e radɔxɔ muxu gbeene fɛma a yamani.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>A gbantan findi dii barin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">a yi a findi dii nga sɛwaxin na.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Isirayila to mini Misiran yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">Yaxuba yixɛtɛne to keli yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">e yi xɔɲɛyani dɛnaxan yi,<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Yuda yi findi Alaa yama sariɲanxin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Isirayila yi findi a gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Fɔxɔ igen to a to, a yi a gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">Yurudɛn Baan yi xɛtɛ a xanbi ra.<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Geyane yi tugan alo kontonne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">yire matexine fan yi tugan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">alo yɛxɛɛ diine.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Fɔxɔ igena, nanfera i i gima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Yurudɛn baana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">nanfera i xɛtɛma i xanbi ra?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Ɛ tan geyane, nanfera ɛ tuganma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">alo kontonne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">ɛ tan yire matexine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">nanfera ɛ tuganma alo yɛxɛɛ diine?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Bɔxɔn xa xuruxurun Marigin yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">Yaxubaa Ala.<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>A tan naxan fanyene findi darane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">a yi gɛmɛ gbeen findi tigin na.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s">Binyen xa fi Ala nan keden ma</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 135.15-20</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Alatala, nxu tan mi a ra de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">I tan nan xili xa binya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">i ya hinanna nun lannayana fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">Nxu tan mi a ra!<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Nanfera siyane maxɔdinna tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">e naxa, “E Ala go?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>En ma Ala ariyanna yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">Naxan nafan a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">a na nan ligama.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Gbetin nun xɛmaan nan tun e tan ma suxurene ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">Muxune nan ne rafalaxi.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>E dɛ na, koni e mi fala tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">E yɛɛne na, koni e mi sese toma.<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>E tunle na, koni e mi fefe mɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">E ɲɔɛɛn na, koni e mi sese xiri mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>E yiine na, koni e mi nɔɛ seen suxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">E sanne na, koni e mi nɔɛ sigan tiyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">E mi nɔɛ xui yo raminɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Naxan na e rafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">a a yigin sa e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">na fan luma nɛn alo e tan.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Ɛ tan Isirayila yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">ɛ yigin sa Alatala nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">a tan nan ɛ malima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">alo yɛ masansan wure lefana.<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Ɛ tan saraxaraline,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">ɛ yigin sa Alatala nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">a tan nan ɛ malima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">alo yɛ masansan wure lefana.<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Ɛ tan a yɛɛ ra gaxu muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">ɛ yigin sa Alatala nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">a tan nan ɛ malima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">alo yɛ masansan wure lefana.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Alatala a ɲɔxɔ luma en xɔn ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">a en baraka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">A Isirayila yamaan barakama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">e nun a saraxaraline.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Alatala a yɛɛ ra gaxu muxune birin barakama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">muxudine nun muxu gbeene.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Alatala xa diine fi ɛ nun ɛ diine ma.<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Alatala xa ɛ baraka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">naxan koren nun bɔxɔn daxi!<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Alatala nan gbee ariyanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">koni a bata bɔxɔn taxu adamadiine ra.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Faxa muxune xa mi Alatala tantunma de!<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Koni en tan nan barikan birama a xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">iki e nun habadan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s">Muxu rakisixina Ala tantunna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>N bata Alatala xanu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">amasɔtɔ a n ma maxandi xuiin namɛma.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>N na a xili waxati yo yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">a a tuli matiyɛ n na.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Sayaan gbalon bata yi n nabilin nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">n bata yi maso gaburun na nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">gaxun nun kuisanna bata yi n li nun,<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>n yi Alatala maxandi a xinla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">n naxa, “Alatala, n nakisi!”<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Alatala diɲa, a tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">En ma Ala kininkinin han!<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Alatala muxu bɔɲɛ fixɛne nan natangama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">N sɛnbɛn bata yi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">a yi n nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>N bɔɲɛn xa xunbeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">amasɔtɔ Alatala bata fe faɲin liga n xa.<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Ala bata n niin natanga sayaan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">A bata n yɛɛgen fitan n yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">A mi tinxi n bira.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>N sigan tima nɛn Alatala yɛtagi dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>N dɛnkɛlɛyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">nanara n yi falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">n naxa, “N tɔrɔxi ki faɲi!”<verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>N yi gaxuni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">n yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Adamadiine birin wule!”<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>N fa nanse soma Alatala yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">lan na fe faɲine birin ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">a bata naxanye liga n xa?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>N minse saraxan bama nɛn a xa a marakisina fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">n yi Alatala maxandi a xinla ra.<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>N nan n dɛ xuine rakamalima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">yamaan birin yɛɛ xɔri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">n naxanye tongo Alatala xa.<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>Alatalaa tɔgɔndiya muxuna nde na faxa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:15">na a tɔrɔma nɛn han!<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>Alatala, i ya walikɛɛn nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">i ya walikɛ ɲaxanla naxan barixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">I bata n naxɔrɔya.<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>N barika bira saraxan bama i xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">n yi Alatala maxandi a xinla ra.<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>N nan n dɛ xuine rakamalima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">yamaan birin yɛɛ xɔri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">n naxanye tongo Alatala xa,<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>Alatalaa banxin tanden ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Yerusalɛn taani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Siyane birin xa Alatala tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">Yamane birin xa a batu!<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Amasɔtɔ a hinanna gbo han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Alatalaa lannayaan mi ɲanma habadan!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s">Barika birana Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>Alatala xa tantun amasɔtɔ a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Isirayila muxune xa a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">“A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!”<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Alaa saraxaraline xa a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">“A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!”<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Alatala yɛɛ ra gaxu muxune xa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">e naxa, “A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!”<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>N yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">n yi n xui ramini Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">A yi n yabi, a n xɔrɔya.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Alatala n xɔn, n mi gaxuɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">Adamadiine nɔɛ nanse ligɛ n na?<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Alatala n xɔn, a tan nan n malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">N na n yaxune biraxin toma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>A fisa muxun yi a yigin sa Alatala yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">benun a xa a yigin sa adamadiine yi.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>A fisa muxun yi a yigin sa Alatala yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">benun a xa a yigin sa mangane yi.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Siyane birin bata yi n nabilin yɛngɛni nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">koni n na e birin halagi nɛn Alatala barakani!<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>E yi n nabilinxi yiren birin yi nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">koni n na e birin halagi nɛn Alatala barakani!<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>E so nɛn n xun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">alo kumi ɲɛɲɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">koni e raxɔri nɛn mafurɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">alo tɛɛn na sɛxɛ xaren gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">n yi e halagi Alatala barakani.<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>E yi n nadinma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">alogo n xa bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">koni Alatala yi n mali.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Alatala nan n sɛnbɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">n ma bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">A tan nan n nakisixi.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Muxu tinxinxine bata e sɛwa xuini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">kisina fe ra, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">“Alatala sɛnbɛn gbo!<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Marigin bata nɔɔn ti a sɛnbɛni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">Alatala sɛnbɛn gbo!”<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Nayi, n mi faxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">n luma nɛn n nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">n yi a fala Alatala naxan ligaxi n xa.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Alatala bata yi n saran n hakɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">koni a mi tinxi n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Alaa banxin dɛɛne xa rabi n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">N xa so, n yi Alatala tantun.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Alatalaa banxin dɛɛn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">tinxin muxune soon dɛɛn naxan na.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Ala, n ni i tantunma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">amasɔtɔ i bata n yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">bayo i bata n nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Banxi tiine e mɛ gɛmɛn naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">na bata findi banxin gɛmɛ fisamantenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Alatala nan na ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">kabanako feen nan na ra en yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Alatala toon lɔxɔn nan nagidixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">en ɲaxan, en sɛwa a fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Alatala, fa nxu rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">Alatala, tin, nxu xa nɔɔn ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Naxan fama Alatala xinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Ala xa na baraka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Nxu dubama ɛ xa Alatalaa banxini.<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Alatala nan Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">a bata en lu a kɛnɛnyani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">Ɛ ɲɔxɔnde dɛɛne suxu ɛ yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">ɛ fa sanla raba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">siga han saraxa ganden nabilinni.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>I tan nan n ma Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">n ni i tantunma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">I tan nan n ma Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">n ni i batuma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun, bayo a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s">Sɛwana Alaa sariyana fe ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">fɛ mi naxanye kɛwanle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">naxanye sigan tima Alatalaa sariyan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">naxanye birama a maxadi xuine fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">naxanye a fenma e bɔɲɛn ma feu!<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>E mi fe ɲaxin ligan mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">E sigan tima Alaa kiraan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Ala, i bata i ya fe ragidixine so nxu yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">alogo e xa suxu ki faɲi.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>A yi lan nun, n sigati kiin xa tinxinɲɛ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">alogo n xa i ya tɔnne suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>N na n xaxili lu i ya yamarine birin xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">n mi yagɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>N na i tantunma nɛn n bɔɲɛ fixɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">n nɛma i ya kiti tinxinxine fe xaranɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>N na i ya tɔnne suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">I nama n nabeɲin mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Banxulanna a kɛwanle rasariɲanma di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Fɔ a xa i ya falan nan suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>N kataxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">n xa i fen n bɔɲɛn ma feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">I nama tin n yi i ya yamarine beɲin.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>N bata i dɛ xuiin namara n bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">alogo n nama yulubin liga i tan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Alatala, n barikan birama i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">N xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>N nan n xuini tema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">n xɛtɛ i ya kiti saxine ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>N sɛwaxin nan i ya maxadi xuine suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">alo n na nafulu gbeen sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>N na n mirima i ya fe ragidixine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">n yi i ya xaranne fɛsɛfɛsɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>I ya tɔnne n kɛnɛnxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">N mi ɲinanɲɛ i ya falan xɔn ma mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Fe faɲin liga i ya walikɛɛn xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">alogo n xa lu n nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">n yi i ya falan suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>N yɛɛne rabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">alogo n xa i ya sariyan magaxune to.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Xɔɲɛn nan n na dunuɲa ito yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">I nama i ya yamarine luxun n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>A rafan n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">n xa lu i ya kiti saxine bun waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>I falan tima nɛn muxu dangaxi wasoxine xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">naxanye e masigama i ya yamarine ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Marayagin nun maraɲaxun ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">bayo n bata i ya maxadi xuine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Mangane bata e malan n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">koni n tan i ya walikɛna a mirima i ya tɔnne nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>I ya maxadi xuine n kɛnɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">e tan nan n maxadima.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>N saxi burunburunni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">Siimayaan fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">alo i a falaxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>N bata n ti n kɛwanle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">i yi n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">N xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>N mali n xa i ya fe ragidixine kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">alogo n xa n miri i ya kabanako feene ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>N niin wugama sɔxɔlɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">N nakeli alo i a falaxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Wulen masiga n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">i yi n xaran i ya sariyan ma i ya hinanni.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>N bata wa a xɔn, n xa tɔgɔndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">n yi tin i ya kiti saxine ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Alatala, n bata bira i ya maxadi xuine fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">I nama tin, n yi yagi.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>N biraxi i ya yamarin kiraan fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">Amasɔtɔ i bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Alatala, n xaran i ya tɔnne bunne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">alogo n xa e suxu waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Xaxinla fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">alogo n xa i ya sariyan suxu n bɔɲɛn ma feu!<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>N ti i ya yamarine kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">amasɔtɔ na n kɛnɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>I ya maxadi xuine sa n bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">alogo n nama bira nafunla fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>N xun xanbi so fe kobine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">alogo n xa siimayaan sɔtɔ i ya kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>I dɛ xuiin naxan tongoxi i yɛɛragaxu muxune xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">na rakamali n tan i ya walikɛɛn xa.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>N natanga yagine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">n gaxuma naxanye yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">Amasɔtɔ i ya kiti saxine fan.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>N waxi i ya fe ragidixine suxu feni han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">N xa siimayaan sɔtɔ i ya tinxinni.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Alatala, i ya hinanna xa n li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">N nakisi alo i dɛ xui tongoxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>N xa nɔ n konbi muxune yabideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">bayo n na n yigi saxi i ya falan nin.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Tin n xa lu ɲɔndin falɛ waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">amasɔtɔ n xaxili tixi i ya kitin nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>N ni i ya sariyan suxuma nɛn waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">habadan han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>N luma nɛn xɔrɔyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">Amasɔtɔ n ni i ya fe ragidixine suxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>N ni i ya maxadi xuine fe falama mangane xa nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">N mi yagɛ na ra mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>I ya yamarine n kɛnɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">e rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>N na n yiine tima i ya yamarine bun ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">e rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">N yi lu n mirɛ i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>I xaxili lu i ya falan xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">n tan i ya walikɛna fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">bayo i bata yigin fi n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>N yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">i n madɛndɛn nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">amasɔtɔ n bata kisi i dɛ xuiin ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Wasodene n magelema han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">koni n mi i ya sariyan fataxi mumɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Alatala, n na n mirima i ya kiti saxine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">Waxati danguxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">ne nan yi n madɛndɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>N na muxu ɲaxine to</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">naxanye e mɛma i ya sariyan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">n xɔlɔma nɛn han.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>I ya tɔnne findixi bɛti ba xunna nan na n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">n xɔɲɛyani dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Alatala, n na n mirima i ma kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">alogo n xa i ya sariyan suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>N gbeen findixi i ya fe ragidixine suxu feen nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Alatala, n gbeen findixi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">na ni ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">i ya falan suxu feen na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>N ni i maxandima n bɔɲɛn ma feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">Kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">alo i bata dɛ xuiin tongo kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>N bata n miri n yɛtɛ kɛɲaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">n waxi bira feni i ya maxadi xuine fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>N ni i ya yamarine suxuma nɛn mafurɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">n mi buma.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Muxu ɲaxine bata lutin nati n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">koni n mi ɲinanma i ya sariyan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>N kelima nɛn kɔɛ tagini i tantundeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">i ya kiti tinxinxine fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>N xɔyine nan i yɛɛragaxu muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">e nun naxanye i ya fe ragidixine suxuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Alatala, dunuɲa rafexi i ya hinanna nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">n xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Alatala, i bata i ya falan nakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">i fe faɲin naba n tan i ya walikɛɛn xa.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>N xaran xaxilimayaan nun fe kolonna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">amasɔtɔ n laxi i ya yamarine ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Benun n xa tɔrɔ waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">n bata yi tantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">koni iki, n bata i ya falan suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>I fan, i kɛwanle fan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">N xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Muxu wasoxine bata wulen sa n xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">Koni i ya fe ragidixine suxi n xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">n bɔɲɛn ma feu!<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>E bɔɲɛne mi fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">koni i ya sariyana n tan kɛnɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>A rafan n ma, n tɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">alogo n xa nɔ i ya tɔnne kolonɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>I ya sariyan nafan n tan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">dangu xɛmaan nun gbetin wuli wuyaxin xa.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>I tan nan n daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">i yi n namara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">nayi xaxinla fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">alogo n xa i ya yamarine xaran.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>I yɛɛragaxu muxune sɛwama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">e na n to waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">a n laxi i ya falan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Alatala, n na a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">a i tinxin kiti sadeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">I n nayagi nɛn amasɔtɔ i tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>I ya hinanna xa n nii yifan n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">alo i dɛ xuiin tongoxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">n tan i ya walikɛɛn xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Kininkinin n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">alogo n xa lu n nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">amasɔtɔ i ya sariyana n kɛnɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Ala xa muxu wasoxine rayagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">yo mi naxanye xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">naxanye n tɔrɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">Koni n na n mirima i ya fe ragidixine nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Ala xa a yɛɛragaxu muxune maso n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">naxanye birin i ya maxadi xuine kolon.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>N xa i ya tɔnne suxu n bɔɲɛn ma feu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">alogo n nama yagi.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Ala, n bata xadan i mamɛdeni n nakisi feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">N bata n yigi sa i ya falani.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>N yɛɛne bata bu i yɛɛ ra kira yitoɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">i dɛ xuina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">n yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">“I n malima waxatin mundun yi?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>N bata liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">alo manpaan sa labana tɛɛn xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">naxan xaraxi ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">Koni hali na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">n mi ɲinanxi i ya tɔnne xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>N mɔn xa i legeden han waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">I na muxune makitima waxatin mundun yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">naxanye n bɛsɛnxɔnyama?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Muxu wasoxin naxanye mi i ya sariyan suxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">ne bata yinla ge n yɛɛ ra n suxu feen na.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>I ya yamarine birin tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">Muxune n tɔɲɛgɛma, n mali.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>A yi fa luxi ndedi n xa faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">koni n mi i ya fe ragidixine rabeɲinɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>N nakisi i ya hinanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">alogo n xa i ya maxadi xuine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Alatala, i ya falan luma nɛn habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">A luma nɛn ariyanna yi habadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>I ya tinxinyaan luma nɛn mayixɛtɛne birin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">I bata bɔxɔn dɔxɔ a dɔxɔdeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">A mɔn luma mɛnna nin.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Seene birin mɔn daxi i ya maragidini han to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">bayo e birin walima i xa.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Xa i ya sariyan mi yi n kɛnɛnxi nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">n yi faxama nɛn n ma tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>N mi ɲinanɲɛ i ya fe ragidixine xɔn mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">amasɔtɔ i n nakisixi e tan nan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Bayo n ni i ya fe ragidixine fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">i tan nan gbee n na, n nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Muxu ɲaxine n legedenma n faxa feen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">Koni n na n ɲɔxɔ luma nɛn i ya maxadi xuine xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>N bata a kolon danna feen birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">koni i ya yamarin tan dan mi na.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>I ya sariyan nafan n ma han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">N na n mirima a ma fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>I ya yamarina n findima xaxilimaan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">dangu n yaxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">bayo a n yii waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>N dangu n karamɔxɔne birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">amasɔtɔ n luma n mirɛ i ya maxadi xuine ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Xaxinla naxan n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">na gbo xɛmɛ fonne gbeen xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">amasɔtɔ n ni i ya fe ragidixine suxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>N bata tondi sigɛ kira ɲaxin birin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">alogo n xa i ya falan suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>N mi n masigama i ya kiti saxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">amasɔtɔ i tan yɛtɛɛn nan n xaranma.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>I dɛ xuine ɲaxun kumin xa.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>N xaxinla sɔtɔma i ya fe ragidixine nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">nanara mayifu fe yo mi fa rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>I ya falan findixi kɛnɛnna nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">n sanna bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">naxan n siga kirani yalanma.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>N dɛ xuiin naxanye tongoxi i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">n bata n kɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">n ne rakamalima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">n yi i ya kiti tinxinxine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Alatala n ma mantɔrɔne bata gbo ayi han.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">N nakisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">alo i a fala n xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Alatala, n ma tantun xuiin nasuxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">i yi n xaran i ya kiti saxine ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>N niin gbalon dɛ waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">koni n mi ɲinanma i ya sariyan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Muxu ɲaxine bata lutin nati n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">koni n mi n masigama i ya fe ragidixine ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>I ya maxadi xuine nan n kɛɛn na habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">e tan nan n bɔɲɛn nasɛwama.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>N bata a ragidi n bɔɲɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">n xa i ya tɔnne suxu, han n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Nafigine mi rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">koni i ya sariyan tan nafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>N yɛ masansan wure lefaan nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">N bata n yigi sa i ya falani.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Ɛ tan fe ɲaxi rabane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">ɛ ɛ masiga n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">alogo n xa n ma Alaa yamarine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>N sɛnbɛ so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">alo i bata a fala kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">i nama n yigitɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Findi n yigin na alogo n xa kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">n yi i ya tɔnne binya waxatin birin.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Naxanye e masigama i ya tɔnne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">i ne makuyama i ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">bayo e yanfan nan tun tima.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>I muxu ɲaxine birin wolima ayi nɛn kurun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">nanara i ya maxadi xuine rafanxi n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>N bata gaxu i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">n xuruxurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">I ya kiti saxine bata n magaxu han!<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>N tinxinna nun sariya kɛndɛn ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">i nama n nabeɲin n yaxune yii.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>I ya walikɛɛn xaxili ragidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">a i fe faɲin ligama a xa nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">i nama tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">wasodene xa n ɲaxankata sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>N yɛɛne bata bu i yɛɛ ra kira yitoɛ n nakisi feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">alo i dɛ xui tinxinxin naxan tongo n ma fe yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>N suxu i ya hinanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">i yi n xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Xaxinla fi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">amasɔtɔ i ya walikɛɛn nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">alogo n xa i ya maxadi xuine kolon ki faɲi.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Alatala, i ya wanla kɛ waxatin nan ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">amasɔtɔ yamana i ya sariyan kalama.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Nanara, i ya yamarine rafan n ma xɛma faɲin xa.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Nanara, n biraxi i ya fe ragidixi tinxinxine fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">Mayifu feene mi rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Kabanako feen nan i ya maxadi xuine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">Nanara, n na e suxuma n niin birin na.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>I ya falane nan kɛnɛnna fima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">e tan nan xaxinla fima xaxilitaren ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>I ya yamarine xɔnla n suxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">alo min xɔli gbeen naxan n dɛɛn naxarama.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>I yɛɛ rafindi n ma, i yi kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">alo i darixi a ligɛ kii naxan yi muxune xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">i xinla rafan naxanye ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>N sigati kiin sɛnbɛ so i dɛ xui tongoxine xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">i nama tin fe ɲaxi yo xa n nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>N xunba ɲaxankatatiine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">alogo n xa i ya fe ragidixine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>I nɔrɔn xa godo i ya walikɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">i yi n xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>N yɛɛgen minima alo baana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">amasɔtɔ yamaan mi i ya sariyan suxuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Alatala, i tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">i ya kiti saxine fan tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>I ya maxadi xuine fixi tinxinna nun lannayaan nin.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>N na a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">n yaxune ɲinanma i fala xuiin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">na xɔlɔma n ma nɛn han!<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>I mi i dɛ xuiin kalɛ mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">E rafan n tan i ya walikɛɛn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>N mi yatɛxi bonne yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">e bata n naɲaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">koni n mi ɲinanma i ya fe ragidixine xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>I ya tinxinyaan luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">Ɲɔndin nan i ya sariyan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Tɔrɔn nun kuisanna bata n yili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">koni i ya yamarine n kɛnɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>I ya maxadi xuine tinxin waxatin birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">Xaxinla fi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">alogo n xa siimayaan sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>N bata n xui ramini i ma n bɔɲɛn birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">Alatala n yabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">alogo n xa i ya tɔnne suxu!<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>N bata n xui ramini i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">N nakisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">alogo n xa i ya maxadi xuine suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>N kurunma i maxandɛ, n mali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">N yigi saxi i ya falan nin.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>N xima n mirɛ i dɛ xui tongoxine ma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Alatala, i hinan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">N xuiin namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">alogo n xa siimayaan sɔtɔ i ya kiti saxin xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>N nabilinna muxune biraxi fe ɲaxine fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">e yi e masiga i ya sariyan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Koni i tan Alatala, i maso n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">Ɲɔndin nan i ya yamarine birin na.<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>N na a kolon xabu waxati xunkuye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">a i ya maxadi xuine luma nɛn habadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Ala, n ma tɔrɔn mato i yi n xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">amasɔtɔ n mi ɲinanxi i ya sariyan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>N xun mayɛngɛ kitin sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">i yi n xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">n yi siimayaan sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">alo i a falaxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Muxu ɲaxine tan mi kisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">amasɔtɔ e mi biraxi i ya tɔnne fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Koni Alatala, i ya kininkininna gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">n xa siimayaan sɔtɔ i ya kiti saxine xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>N yaxune wuya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">naxanye n bɛsɛnxɔnyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">koni n mi i ya maxadi xuine beɲinma.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>N na i ya fala suxutarene to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">na n xɔlɔma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Alatala, a mato i ya fe ragidixine rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">n xa siimayaan sɔtɔ i ya hinanni.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>Ɲɔndin nan i ya falan birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">I ya kiti tinxinxine luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Mangane bata n ɲaxankata fu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">koni n gaxuma i tan nan keden ma fala yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>N sɛwaxi i dɛ xui tongoxine fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">alo n na nafulu gbeen sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Wulen mi rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">koni i ya sariyan nafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>N ni i tantunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">dɔxɔɲa ma solofere lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">i ya kiti tinxinxine fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbeli gbeen na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">i ya sariyan nafan naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">sese mi na kanne ratantanɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Alatala, n yigi saxi i tan nan ma marakisi yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">n luma nɛn i ya yamarine suxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>N na i ya maxadi xuine suxuma nɛn n niin birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">bayo e rafan n ma ki faɲi.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>N bata i ya fe ragidixine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">nun i ya maxadi xuine suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">i n kɛwanle birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Alatala, n ma mawuga xuiin xa i li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">Xaxinla fi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">alo i a falaxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>I tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">i yi n nakisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">alo i bata dɛ xuiin tongo kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>N ni i tantunma nɛn waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">amasɔtɔ i bata n xaran i ya tɔnne ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>N bɛtin bama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">lan i dɛ xui tongoxina fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">amasɔtɔ i ya yamarine birin tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>N mali i sɛnbɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">amasɔtɔ n bata i ya fe ragidixine nan sugandi.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Alatala, i ya marakisin xɔnla n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">I ya sariyana n kɛnɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>N xa siimayaan sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">alogo n xa i matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">i ya kiti saxine yi n mali.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>N bata tantan kiraan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">alo yɛxɛɛn naxan lɔxi ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">Fa n tan i ya walikɛɛn fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">amasɔtɔ n mi ɲinanxi i ya yamarine xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">N yi tɔrɔni waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">n yi n xui ramini Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">a yi n yabi.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Alatala n nakisi wuledene nun yanfantenne ma.<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Ɛ tan wuledene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">Ala nanse ligama ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">a ɛ saranma nanse ra?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>A lan a xa ɛ tɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">sofane xalimakunle nun tɛɛ wolonne nan na.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Tɔrɔn na a ra n tan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">n lu ɛ tagi, ɛ tan Mesɛki kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">n dɔxɔ ɛ yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">alo Kedari bɔnsɔnna muxune wulaan kui.<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>N bata bu muxune tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">bɔɲɛ xunbenla mi rafan naxanye ma!<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>N na bɔɲɛ xunbenla fe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">e tan yi yɛngɛn so.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan en natanga muxun na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">N bata n yɛɛ rate geyane ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">n naxa, “N ma maliin kelima minɛn yi?”<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>N ma maliin kelima Alatala nan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">naxan ariyanna nun dunuɲa daxi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>A mi tinɲɛ, i yi bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">I kantanmaan mi xiyɛ mumɛ.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Isirayila kantanmaan mi kinsanɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">a mi xiyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Alatala i kantanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">a i dɛxɔn ma alo i nininna.<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>Sogen mi fefe ligɛ i ra yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">kiken fan mi fefe ligɛ i ra kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Alatala i kantanma nɛn fe ɲaxin birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">a yi i niin natanga.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Alatala i kantanma nɛn i ya sigan nun xɛtɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">fɔlɔ iki ma han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn matɔxɔ bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina, Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">Sɛwan na a ra n xa, e na a fala n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“En siga Alatalaa banxini!”<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Iki, en tixi Yerusalɛn so dɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Yerusalɛn tixi ki faɲi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">a banxine tugunxi e bode ra.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Alatalaa yamaan sigama mɛnna nin bɔnsɔn yɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">alo a sariyana a falaxi Isirayila xa kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">alogo e xa sa a xinla tantun.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Mangane kitin sama mɛnna nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">Dawudaa manga gbɛdɛn ma.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>Ɛ Ala maxandi bɔɲɛ xunbenla fe ra Yerusalɛn xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi a rafan muxune ma.<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla lu taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">Ala xa hɛrin fi taa yi kaane ma.<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Ngaxakedenne nun n xɔyine fe ra, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">“Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi Yerusalɛn ma.”<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>N taana bɔɲɛ xunbenla nan fenma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">Alatalaa banxina fe ra, en ma Ala.<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s">Ala xa hinan en na</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">I tan naxan dɔxi kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">n na n yɛɛ ratema i tan nan ma,<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>alo konyine e yɛɛn tima e kanna ra kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">alo walikɛ ɲaxanla yɛɛne luma tixi a kanna ra kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">En na en yɛɛne tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">en ma Ala ra na kii nin, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">en yi a hinanna mamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Hinan nxu ra, Alatala, hinan nxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">amasɔtɔ e nxu raɲaxuxi han!<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Nxu niin bata wasa fɛrɛ kanne nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">wasodene magele xuine ra.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan a muxune ratangama</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina, Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Xa Alatala mi yi ti en xɔn nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Isirayila muxune fan xa a fala, e naxa,<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>“Xa Alatala mi yi ti en xɔn nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">yaxune yi en yɛngɛma waxatin naxan yi,”<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>e yi en ɲɛɲɛn gerunma nɛn nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">e xɔlɔ en xili ma waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>Nayi, walanna yi sigama en na nɛn nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">fufaan yi en mamin,<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>ige xunfan gbeen yi sa en xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>En barikan bira Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">a mi tinxi en yaxune yi en ɲan.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Nxu bata nxu sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">alo xɔlina a sɔtɔma xɔli suxuna lutin na kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">Lutin bata bolon, nxu xɔrɔya!<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>En ma maliin kelima Alatala nan yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">naxan ariyanna nun dunuɲa daxi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa muxune rakisi fena</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">Naxanye e yigi sama Alatala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">na kanne ligaxi nɛn alo Siyon Geyana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">naxan luma a funfuni habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">a mi mamaxɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Yerusalɛn rabilinxi geyane ra kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">Alatala fan a muxune rabilinma na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">keli to ma han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Amasɔtɔ tinxintarene mi luyɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">tinxin muxune yamanan xun na mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">alogo tinxin muxune fan nama fe ɲaxin liga.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Alatala, fe faɲin naba na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">naxanye fan e nun naxanye sɔndɔmɛn fan.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Koni, naxanye kira tinxintarene fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Alatala xa ne nun fe ɲaxi rabane ɲan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">e bode xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi Isirayila ma.<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina xunbana fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">Alatala mɔn faxina en tan muxu suxine ra Siyon taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">a liga nɛn en yɛɛ ra yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">alo xiyen na a ra!<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>En gele nɛn han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">en yi sɛwa bɛtine ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Siyaan bonne yi a falama nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“Alatala bata fe gbeene liga e xa.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Alatala bata fe gbeene liga en xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">en birin bata sɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Alatala, i mɔn xa nxɔ yamanan sɛnbɛ so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">alo tulen fama igen na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">xude wuli yixaren na kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Naxanye sansiin wolima e wugama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">ne sɔnxɔma nɛn sɛwani se xabadeni.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Naxanye sigama wugɛ sansi wolideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">ne xɛtɛma gelɛ nɛn malo xidine ra e xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s">Ala wali faɲi kolonna</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina, Sulemani gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Xa Alatala xa mi banxin tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">banxi tiine wali fuun nan kɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Xa Alatala xa mi taan makantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">taa kantanne fe fuun nan xun na.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Ɛ kurunma walideni fuyan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">ɛ kɔɛ rasoma fuyan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">ɛ balon sɔtɔma tɔrɔn nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Anu, Ala balon soma a xanuntenne yii nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">e saxi.<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Alatala diine fima muxune ma nɛn e kɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">E findixi kɔntɔnna nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">Alatala naxan fima.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Xɛmɛn dii xɛmɛn naxanye sɔtɔma banxulanyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">ne ligaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">alo xalimakunla sofaan yii kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Sɛwan na xɛmɛn xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">xalimakuli wuyaxin naxan yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">E nun a yaxune na kiti, a mi yagima.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s">Duban Ala yɛɛragaxu muxune xa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">Sɛwan na kanne xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">naxanye gaxuma Alatala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">naxanye birama a kiraan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>I wali xɔnna i makone fanma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">I sɛwama nɛn i mɔn yi sabati.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>I ya ɲaxanla diine barima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">alo wudi bili bogilana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">I ya dii xɛmɛne i ya tabanla rabilinma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">alo oliwi wudi binle.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Muxun naxan gaxuma Alatala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">na kanna dubani itoe nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Alatala xa barakan sa i ya fe yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">keli Siyon yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">Ala xa i Yerusalɛn sabatixin to</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">i siin birin yi!<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Ala xa i i mamandenne to!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi Isirayila ma.<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina Isirayila yaxune xili ma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">E n yɛngɛma xabu n dii ɲɔrɛ waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Isirayila kaane fan xa a fala, e naxa,<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>“E en yɛngɛma xabu en dii ɲɔrɛ waxatini,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">koni e mi en nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>E bata n fanna makorondon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">alo xɛɛn bi daxina.<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Koni Alatala tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">a bata nxu nun muxu ɲaxine tagi bolon.<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Muxun naxanye Siyon naɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">Ala xa ne yagixin naxɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>E xa liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">alo sɛxɛn naxan solima banxin fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">sogen yi a xara ayi.<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>Muxun naxan a xabama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">hali yii fe kedenna a mi a sɔtɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">hali xidi kedenna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">a raxidi muxun fan mi a sɔtɔma.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Dangu muxune mi a falama e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">e naxa, “Alatala xa barakan sa ɛ fe yi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Hanma e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“Nxu dubama ɛ xa Alatala xinli.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">Alatala, n bata n xui ramini i ma tɔrɔni.<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Marigina, n xuiin namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">i yi i tuli mati n ma maxandi xuiin na.<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Alatala, xa i nxu suxu nxu hakɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">Marigina, nde luma a yalagitaren na?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Koni i tan nan nxu mafeluma nxu hakɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">nxu yi gaxu i yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>N yengi saxi Alatala nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">n niin taxuxi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">n xaxili tixi a falan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>N yengi tixi Marigin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">alo taa kantanne yengi kuye yibaan ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Isirayila, i yengi ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">amasɔtɔ a hinan, a nɔɛ i xunbɛ nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>A tan nan Isirayila rakisima a hakɛn birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina limaniyani</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina, Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">Alatala, n mi fa waso, n mi kanba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">N mi fa n xaxinla rasigama feene ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">naxanye gbo dangu n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">naxanye magaxu n yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Koni n bata n xaxinla raxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">n yi n sabari, n nii yifanxi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">alo dii ɲɔrɛna a nga fɛma.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Isirayila, i yengi ti Alatala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">fɔlɔ to ma han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s">Dawudaa taan nan Alatala dɔxɔden na</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Firinden 6.41-42</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">Alatala, Dawudaa fe xa rabira i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">e nun a tɔrɔne birin.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>A tan nan a kɔlɔ Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">a yi a dɛ ti Yaxubaa Ala Sɛnbɛmaan xa.<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>A naxa, “N mi soma n konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">n mi n sama n ma saden ma,<verse eid="PSA 132:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>n mi tinɲɛ n yi kinsan hanma n yi xi,<verse eid="PSA 132:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>han n yiren fen Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">Yaxubaa Ala Sɛnbɛmaan luma dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Nxu bata a fe mɛ Efarata yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">nxu bata a to Yaari taan nabilinni.<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>E naxa, “En siga Alaa banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">en yi en xinbi sin a san bun.”<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Alatala, keli, i fa i dɔxɔdeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">i tan nun i ya kankirana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">i sɛnbɛn naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Ala xa i ya saraxaraline findi tinxin muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">i ya tɔgɔndiya muxune yi sɔnxɔ sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>I nama i ya manga sugandixin nabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">i ya walikɛɛn Dawuda fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Alatala bata a kɔlɔ Dawuda xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">a mi a kalɛ mumɛ! A naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“N ni i ya dii xɛmɛna nde nan sugandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">a ti i funfuni mangan na.<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Xa i ya dii xɛmɛne n ma layirin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">e nun n ma maxadi xuine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">n na e xaranma naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">e diine fan dɔxɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">i ya mangaya gbɛdɛni han habadan.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Alatala bata Siyon sugandi a dɔxɔden na.<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>A bata a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">“N luma be nin habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">N waxi mangayaan liga feni be nin.<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>N baraka gbeen sama nɛn Siyon ma baloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">n donseen so a tɔrɔ muxune birin yii.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>N kisin fima nɛn a saraxaraline birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">a tɔgɔndiya muxune yi sɔnxɔ sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>N mangana nde raminima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">Dawuda yixɛtɛne yɛ mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">na yi lu n ma manga sugandixin funfuni.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>N na a yaxune rayagima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">koni a mangayaan taxamasenna nɔrɔma nɛn han!”<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s">Ngaxakedenyana fe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina, Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">Fe faɲin na a ra e nun sɛwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">ngaxakedenne na lu e bode xɔn bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>A luxi nɛn alo ture xiri ɲaxumɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">naxan sama Haruna xunni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">a godo a dɛ xaben ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">han a domaan kɔɛɛn xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>A luxi nɛn alo xiila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">naxan kelin Xerimon geyaan fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">godo Siyon geyaan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">Amasɔtɔ Alatala habadan nii rakisin duban nagodoma mɛnna nin.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun fena</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Ala Batu Banxi yisiga bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">Alatalaa walikɛne birin xa a tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">naxanye birin xima a batuɛ a banxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">ɛ fa a tantun.<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Ɛ ɛ yiine yite yire sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">ɛ Alatala tantun!<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Alatala xa i baraka keli Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">a tan naxan kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna daxi.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 115.4-11</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Ɛ Alatala xinla tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Ɛ tan Alatalaa walikɛne, ɛ a tantun.<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Ɛ tan naxanye tixi Alatalaa banxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">naxanye en ma Alaa banxin tanden ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Tantunna Ala xa! Amasɔtɔ Alatala fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">Ɛ a tantun bɛtine yi, amasɔtɔ a diɲa.<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Alatala nan Yaxuba sugandixi a yɛtɛ xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">a yi Isirayila findi a gbeen na.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>N na a kolon fa fala Alatala gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">en Marigin gbo alane birin xa.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">fɔxɔ igene nun yire tilinxine birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">naxan na rafan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">a na nan ligama.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>A bata foyen nun tulen nakeli bɔxɔn danna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">a kuye sarinna ramini e nun tulena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">a foyen nakeli a ramaradeni.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>A yi dii singene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">nun xuruse dii singene faxa Misiran yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>A yi kabanako feene liga ɛ tan Misiran kaane tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">Firawona nun a kuntigine birin xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>A siya wuyaxine halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">a yi manga sɛnbɛmane faxa,<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>sa fɔlɔ Amorine Manga Sixɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">e nun Basan Manga Ogo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">e nun mangan naxanye birin Kanan yamanani.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>A yi e bɔxɔne so Isirayila yii e kɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">a findi a yamaan kɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Alatala, i xinla fe luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">Mayixɛtɛne nun mayixɛtɛne e xaxili luma i xɔn ma nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Alatala a muxune xun mayɛngɛ kitin sama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">A kininkinin a walikɛne ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Gbetin nun xɛmaan nan tun siyane suxurene ra!<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>E dɛɛn na, koni e mi fala tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">E yɛɛne na, koni e mi sese toma.<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>E tunle na, koni e mi fefe mɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">Niiraxili yo mi e yi.<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Naxan na e rafala, a a yigin sa e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">na fan luma nɛn alo e tan.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Ɛ tan Isirayila yamana, ɛ Alatala tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">Ɛ tan saraxaraline, ɛ Alatala tantun.<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Ɛ tan Lewi bɔnsɔnna, ɛ Alatala tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">Ɛ tan a yɛɛragaxu muxune, ɛ Alatala tantun.<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Barikan bira Alatala xa Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">a tan naxan luma Yerusalɛn taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Tantunna Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s">Barika birana Isirayilaa Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun amasɔtɔ a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Ɛ alane Ala tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Ɛ marigine birin Marigin tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>A tan nan keden pe kabanako feene ligama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>A bata ariyanna rafala a xaxilimayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>A bata bɔxɔn ti tilinne fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>A bata yanban seene da kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>Sogen mangayaan ligama yanyin nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>Kiken nun sarene mangayaan ligan kɔɛɛn nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>A yi Misiran kaane dii singene faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>A ti Isirayila muxune yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">keli Misiran yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>A na liga a sɛnbɛ gbeen nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>A yi Gbala Baani taxun a tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>A yi a muxune ragidi a tagi, Isirayila kaane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>A yi Firawona nun a sofane radin Gbala Baani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>A ti a muxune yɛɛ ra tonbonni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>A yi manga gbeene faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>A yi manga sɛnbɛmane faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>A yi Amorine manga Sixɔn faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>A yi Basan kaane manga Ogo faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>A yi e bɔxɔn so a yamaan yii e kɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>A yi findi Isirayila kɛɛn na, a walikɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>A ɲɔxɔ lu nɛn en tan yiigelitɔne xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>A yi en xɔrɔya en yaxune ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>A tan nan donseen soma niimaseen birin yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Ɛ Ala tantun naxan kore!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila muxu suxine fe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Nxu yi dɔxi Babilɔn xude dɛɛne yi waxatin naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">nxu wugama, nxu yi lu nxu mirɛ Siyon ma.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Nxu yi nxɔ bɔlɔnne singan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">na yamanan wudi tofaɲine ra.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Muxun naxanye nxu suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">ne yi bɛtine maxɔdin nxu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">Nxu ɲaxankata muxune yi sɛwa bɛtine maxɔdin nxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">e naxa, “Ɛ Siyon bɛtina nde ba nxu xa.”<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Nxu tan bɛtin bama Alatala xa di xɔɲɛ taani?<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Xa n ɲinan i xɔn Yerusalɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">Ala xa n yiifanna faxa n ma.<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Xa n ɲinan i tan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">xa n mi lu Yerusalɛn yatɛ n ma sɛwan birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">Ala xa n dɛɛn suxu!<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Alatala, Edɔn kaane fe xa rabira i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">e yi naxan falama Yerusalɛn suxu lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">e naxa, “Ɛ a kala, ɛ taan naxɔri fefe!”<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>I tan Babilɔn taana, i halagima nɛn fefe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">Sɛwan na kanna xa naxan i ya donla saranma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">alo i a ligaxi nxu ra kii naxan yi,<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>naxanye ɛ dii futene tongoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">e yi e yigɔlɔn fanyen ma.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun fena</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">Ala, n bata i tantun n bɔɲɛni fefe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">N bɛtin bama Ala yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>N na n xinbi sinma i ya Banxi Sariɲanxin yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">n yi i xinla tantun i ya hinanna nun i ya lannayana fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">Amasɔtɔ i bata i dɛ xuiin nafisa i xinla yɛtɛɛn xa.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>N ni i xili waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">i n yabi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">i yi n sɛnbɛ so, i n xaxili ragidi.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Alatala, dunuɲa mangane birin i tantunma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">e na i ya falane mɛ waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Alatala, e i kɛwanle matɔxɔma nɛn bɛtini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">amasɔtɔ i ya binyen gbo.<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Hali Alatala to mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">a yengi dɔxi muxu diɲaxine xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">koni a yɛɛn tixi wasodene ra wulani.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Xa n sigan tima tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">i n nakisima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">i yi n yaxune yɛngɛ i sɛnbɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">n kisi i sɛnbɛn xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Alatala feene raɲanma a faɲin nan ma n xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Alatala i ya hinanna luma nɛn habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">I nama i wali xɔnne rabeɲin.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s">Ala ɲɔxɔ luxi adamadiine xɔn</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">Alatala, i bata n fɛsɛfɛsɛ, i n kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>I n sa waxatin nun n keli waxatin birin kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">Hali i makuya n na, i n ma miriyane birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>I a kolon n nɛma sigatini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">hanma n nɛma saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">i n kɛwanle birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Alatala, benun n xa falan ti waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">n naxan falama i na kolon ki faɲi.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>I n nabilinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">n yɛɛ ra e nun n xanbi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">N ni i tan nan yii.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Na fe kolonna magaxu n tan yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">A dangu n na, n mi nɔɛ a yigbɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>N nɔɛ sigɛ minɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">n yi n luxun i ya Nii Sariɲanxin ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">N sigan minɛn yi, n keli i tan yɛtagi?<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Xa n te ariyanna yi, i na yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">N na siga laxira yi, i na yi.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Hali n siga han sogetedeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">hanma n sa dɔxɔ fɔxɔ igen xanbi ra,<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>i tima nɛn n yɛɛ ra mɛnna fan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">i mi n nabeɲinɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Xa n na a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">“N xa n luxun dimini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">Kɛnɛnna xa findi kɔɛɛn na n nabilinni.”<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>Koni sese mi dimin na i tan yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kɔɛni yalan alo yanyina i tan yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">Dimin nun yanyin birin lan i tan xa.<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>I tan nan n sɔndɔmɛn daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">i tan nan n saxi nga fatini.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Ala, n ni i tantunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">amasɔtɔ n da kiin magaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">i kɛwanle magaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">N na a kolon n niini ki faɲi.<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>N fati bɛndɛn mi yi luxunxi i tan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">i to yi n nafalama suturani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">i yi n dama nga kui waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>I yi n toma benun n fatin xa yelin nafalɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">I bata yi n ma siimayaan xasabin sɛbɛ i ya kitabun kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">benun a xa fɔlɔ waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Ala, i ya miriyane famu raxɔlɔ n xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">E xasabin wuya!<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Xa n na e yatɛ, e wuya mɛɲɛnsinna xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">N na xulun waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">n mɔn luma i tan nan fɛma.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Ala, a yi lan nun i xa muxu ɲaxine faxa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">Faxa tiine, ɛ masiga n na.<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>E fala ɲaxine tima, e i xili kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">I yɛngɛfane i xinla falama fuun nin.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Alatala, n mi muxune raɲaxuɛ ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">naxanye i raɲaxuma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">N bata n mɛ na muxune ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">naxanye murutɛxi i xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>E mi rafan n ma mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">N bata e yatɛ yaxune ra.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Ala, n fɛsɛfɛsɛ i yi n bɔɲɛni feen kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">N mato, i yi n ma miriyane kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>A mato, xa n kira ɲaxin nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">i siga n na habadan kira faɲin xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina xunbana fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina, bɛti baane kuntigin xa.<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Alatala, n xunba muxu ɲaxine yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">N natanga gbalotɔne ma.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>E fe ɲaxi yitɔnna nin waxatin birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">E yɛngɛ ralanna nin lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Fala xɔlɛne nan e lɛnne ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">alo saɲina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">E fala xuine xɔlɔ alo koson xɔlɛna.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:4">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Alatala, n natanga muxu ɲaxine sɛnbɛn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">N nakisi gbalotɔne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">naxanye kataxi n nabira feen na.<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Muxu wasoxine bata lutin nati n yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">E bata e gbatune rati kiraan xɔn ma n suxu xinla ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>N bata a fala Alatala xa n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">“N ma Ala nan i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">Alatala n ma maxandi xuiin namɛ!”<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Marigina Alatala, n nakisi sɛnbɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">i n xun mayɛngɛma yɛngɛ so waxatini.<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Alatala, i nama tin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">muxu ɲaxine waxɔn feen yi liga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">I nama tin e fe nataxine yi kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">e yi waso ayi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:9">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>I nama tin n yaxune yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">Ala xa n yaxune gbalo falane so e xun na.<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Ala xa tɛɛ wolonne bɔxɔn e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">Ala xa e woli ayi tɛɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">Ala xa e woli yinla kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">e mi nɔɛ tɛ naxan na.<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Nafigine mi luma yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">Ala xa yihadin so gbalotɔne xun na.<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>N na a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">a Alatala kiti kɛndɛn sama tɔrɔ muxune xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">a yi yiigelitɔne xun mayɛngɛ kitin sa.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 140:14"/>Tinxin muxune i tantunma nɛn yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:14">Muxu faɲine yi lu i yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 140:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina ɲinbanna ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Alatala, n bata n xui ramini i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">fa n mali mafurɛn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">N na i xili, i tuli mati n na.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>N ma maxandin xa lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">alo wusulanna i yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">N yiine yitexin xa liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">alo ɲinbari ra saraxana.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Alatala i yengi dɔxɔ n fala xuiin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">i yi n dɛɛn kantan.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>I nama tin n bɔɲɛn yi lu fe ɲaxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">n nama fe ɲaxine liga nxu nun fe ɲaxi rabane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">Nxu nama nxu dɛge nxu bode xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>N tinma nɛn tinxin muxun yi n bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">bayo hinanna na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">A rafan n ma, a yi n kawandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Na luxi nɛn alo turen na susan n xunni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">N mi tondɛ na ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Koni n na Ala maxandima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">fe ɲaxi rabane wanle xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>E mangane radinma nɛn geyaan san bun fanyene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">muxu ɲaxine yi a kolon nayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">a ɲɔndin nan n ma falane ra.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Xɛɛn bima kiin de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">bɔxɔn yi buxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">nxu xɔnne xuyama ayi na kiini laxira so dɛɛn na.<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">n yɛɛn tixi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">N na n luxunma i tan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">i nama tin n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>N natanga na lutine ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">e naxanye ratixi n yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">e nun fe ɲaxi rabane wosone.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Ala xa muxu ɲaxine suxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">e yɛtɛna luti ratixine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">koni n tan xa dangu bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Dawudaa fala ɲaxumɛna, a yi faranna ra waxatin naxan yi. Ala maxandina.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>N na n xui raminima Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">n yi a mafan.<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>N na n kɔntɔfili feene birin fala a xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">n yi n ma tɔrɔne birin yita a ra.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Wɛkilɛn na ɲan n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">i tan n sigaden kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">N sigan tima kiraan naxan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">e bata woson nati n yɛɛ ra na xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>N dɛxɔn to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">muxune mi e ɲɔxɔ luma n tan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">Luxunde yo mi fa n tan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">Muxu yo mi kɔntɔfilixi n ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Alatala, n ni i tan nan mafanma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">N naxa, “I tan nan n luxunden na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">I tan nan findixi n gbeen na bɔxɔ xɔnna fari.”<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>I tuli mati n ma mawuga xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Amasɔtɔ n bata xadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">N xunba n sagatan muxune yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Amasɔtɔ e sɛnbɛn gbo n xa.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 142:8"/>N namini kasoon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">alogo n xa i xinla tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">Tinxin muxune yi n nabilin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">bayo i bata fe faɲin naba n xa.<verse eid="PSA 142:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandina malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Dawudaa bɛtina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">Alatala, n ma maxandi xuiin namɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">I tuli mati n xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">N yabi i ya tinxinna nun i ya hinanna nin.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>I nama n tan i ya walikɛɛn makiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">bayo muxu yo mi tinxin i tan yɛtagi.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>N yaxuna n sagatanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">a yi n nabira bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">a yi n lu dimini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">alo muxu singe faxaxine.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Wɛkilɛn bata ɲan n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">n sɛnbɛ mi fa na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>N na n mirima waxati danguxine ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">I feen naxanye birin nabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">n na n mirima ne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">n na n mirima i kɛwanle ma.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>N na n yiine tima i tan nan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">N niin xaraxi i yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">alo bɔxɔ xarena.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 143:6">Bɛti xuini te.<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Alatala, n yabi iki sa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">N niin ɲanmatɔɔn na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">I nama i yɛtagin luxun n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Xanamu n sama faxa muxune fari nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Benun xɔtɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">i xa n yabi i ya hinanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">Amasɔtɔ n na n yigi saxi i tan nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">A yita n na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">n lan n xa sigan ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kiraan naxan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">Amasɔtɔ n na n niin taxuxi i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Alatala, n xunba n yaxune yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">N na n luxunxi i tan nan fɛma.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>N xaran i sagoon ligan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">bayo n ma Ala nan i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">I ya Nii faɲin xa n xali bɔxɔ faɲini.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Alatala siimayaan fi n ma i xinla fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">I xa n ba tɔrɔni i ya tinxinni.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>N yaxune dɛ xidi i ya hinanni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">N yɛngɛfane halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">amasɔtɔ i ya walikɛɛn nan n na.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s">Mangana Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Dawuda gbeena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">Barikan bira Alatala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">n kantan muxuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">naxan n maxaranma yɛngɛ sodeni.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>A tan nan hinanma n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">n ma yinna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">n ma faran makantanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">n xunba muxuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">e nun n yɛ masansan wure lefana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">N na n luxunma a tan nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">A tan nan siyane luma n sanna bun.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Alatala, nanse muxun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">alogo i xa i ɲɔxɔ lu a xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Nanse adamadiin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">alogo i xa i miri a ma?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>Adamadiin luxi nɛn alo foyedina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">A siimayaan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">alo nininna naxan danguma.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Alatala, kuyen tintin, i godo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">I yiin din geyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">e tutin xa te.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Kuye sarinne rasiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">i yi yaxune raxuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">I ya xalimakunle woli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">i yi e kedi.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>I yiin nagodo keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">i yi n ba tilinna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">N ba xɔɲɛne sɛnbɛn bun<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>naxanye wulen falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">naxanye mi e fala xuine rakamalima.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Ala, n bɛti nɛnɛn bama nɛn i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">n yi i tantun kondenna ra.<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>A tan nan mangane rakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">A tan nan a walikɛɛn Dawuda rakisima silanfanna ma.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>N xunba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">i n ba xɔɲɛne sɛnbɛn bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">naxanye wulen falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">naxanye mi e fala xuine rakamalima.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Ala xa en ma dii xɛmɛne rasabati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">alo wudi binle.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">Ala xa en ma dii tɛmɛne xa tofanɲɛ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">alo gɛmɛ sɛnbɛtɛn nayabuxin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">naxanye manga banxine bun.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Ala xa en ma sagane rafe donseen sifan birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">Ala xa en ma xuruseene rawuya ayi xɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">dɔxɔɲa ma wuli keden han wuli fu.<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>Ala xa en ma ɲingene rasabati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">Ala xa en tanga yɛngɛn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">alogo muxe nama suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">wuga xuiin yi te taani.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Sɛwan na yamaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">na feene ligama naxanye xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">Sɛwan na yamaan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">naxanye Ala findixi Alatala ra.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Dawuda Ala tantunna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">N ma Ala, n ma mangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">n ni i batuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">N barikan birama i xa nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">habadan han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ n barikan birɛ i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">N ni i xinla tantunma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">habadan han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Alatala gbo, a lan a yi tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">A gboon dan mi na.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Mayixɛtɛne birin xa i ya wanle fe fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">mayixɛtɛ famatɔne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">e yi i kɛwanle fe yɛba e xa.<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>E i ya binye gbeen nun nɔrɔna fe fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">N luma nɛn n mirɛ i ya kabanako wanle ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>E xa i sɛnbɛ magaxuxina fe fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">N tan i ya gbona fe falama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>E xa i ya nɛmana fe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">e yi i ya tinxinna fe rali sɛwani.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Alatala diɲa, a kininkinin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">a mi xɔlɔn xulɛn, a hinanna gbo.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Alatala fe faɲin nabama muxun birin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">A kininkininma a daala birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Alatala, i ya dali seene birin i tantunma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">I ya tɔgɔndiya muxune birin barikan birama i xa nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>E i ya mangayaan binyena fe falama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">E mɔn yi i sɛnbɛna fe yɛba<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>alogo muxun birin xa i kɛwanle kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">e nun i ya mangayaan binye gbeena.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>I ya mangayaan findixi habadan mangayaan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">I sɛnbɛn luma nɛn mayixɛtɛne nun mayixɛtɛne xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Ala a dɛ xuine birin nakamalima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">a hinan a daala birin na.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Alatala ne malima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">naxanye biraxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">a yi muxune rakeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">naxanye felenxi.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Birin yɛɛn tixi i tan nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">alogo i xa donseen so e yii a waxatini.<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>I tan nan i yiin nabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">i yi donseen so niimaseene birin yii.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Alatala feen birin ligama tinxinna nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">A hinan a kɛwanle birin yi.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Alatala maso na muxune ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">naxanye a xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">naxanye birin a xilima ɲɔndini.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>A a yɛɛragaxu muxune rafan feene ligama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">a e xuiin mɛ, a yi e rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Alatala muxune kantanma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">a rafan naxanye birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">Koni a muxu ɲaxine birin halagima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>N na Alatala tantunma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">Dali seene birin xa a xili sariɲanxin tantun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">habadan han habadan!<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan sɛnbɛtarene kantanma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">N xa Alatala tantun n niini fefe!<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Fanni n na n nii ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">n na Alatala tantunma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">Fanni n daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">n na n ma Ala tantunma nɛn bɛtini.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Ɛ nama ɛ yigi sa mangane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">adamadiine nan ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">Ɛ rakisi fɛrɛ yo mi ne xa.<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>E na faxa, e xɛtɛma nɛn bɛndɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">E fe yitɔnxine birin kalama na lɔxɔn yɛtɛɛn nin.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Sɛwan na kanna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">Yaxubaa Ala muxun naxan malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">naxan a yigin sama Alatala yi, a Ala.<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>A tan nan ariyanna nun dunuɲa daxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">e nun e yi seene birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">A tinxinyaan luma nɛn han habadan.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>A tan nan kiti kɛndɛn sama muxu ɲaxankataxine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">a donseen so kamɛtɔne yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Alatala nan kasorasane xunbama.<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>Alatala nan danxutɔne yɛɛne rabama ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">A tan nan muxu mafelenxine rakelima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Tinxin muxune rafan Alatala ma.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Alatala nan xɔɲɛne kantanma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">A kaɲa gilɛne nun kiridine mali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">Koni a muxu ɲaxine fe yitɔnxine kalama nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Alatala nan habadan mangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Siyon, a tan nan i ya Ala ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">habadan han habadan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Tantunna Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s">Ala tantun fena</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>Tantunna Alatala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">A lan tantun bɛtin xa ba en ma Ala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Fe faɲin nan a tantunna ra e nun sɛwana.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Alatala mɔn Yerusalɛn tima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">A mɔn fama na muxu suxine ra nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">Isirayila kaan naxanye bata yi xuya ayi nun.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>A muxune dandan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">naxanye bɔɲɛye kalaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">A yi e maxɔlɔdene maxidi.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>A tan nan sarene xasabin nagidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">a yi e birin xili sa.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Nxu Marigin gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">a sɛnbɛn magaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">A xaxilimayaan dan mi na.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Alatala muxu limaniyaxine malima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">Koni a muxu ɲaxine rabirama nɛn bɔxɔni.<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Ɛ barika bira bɛtin ba Alatala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">Ɛ tantun bɛtin ba en ma Ala xa bɔlɔnna ra.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>A tan nan kundani fulunxi kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">A yi tulen nafa bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">A yi sɛxɛn nasoli geyane ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>A xuruseene balon nagidi e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">A xɔline dɛge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">e na e xui ramini a ma waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Soo kɛndɛne xa mi a kɛnɛnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">A mi sɛwama muxun sɛnbɛn fan na.<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>Koni naxanye gaxuxi Alatala yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">e xaxili tixi a hinanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">ne nan a rasɛwama.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Yerusalɛn kaane, ɛ Alatala binya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Siyon kaane, ɛ Ala tantun.<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Amasɔtɔ a bata taan so dɛɛn sɛnbɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">a yi taa yi kaane baraka.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>A tan nan bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima ɛ yamanan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">a balo faɲin fi ɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>A yi a dɛ xui tongoxine rafa bɔxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">a falan yi siga ayi mafurɛn.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>A kundani fulun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">alo dugi fixɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">a ige xundin xuya bɔxɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">alo xubena,<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>a balabalan kɛsɛn nagodo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">Nde nɔɛ a xunbenla raxanɲɛ?<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Koni a falan ti nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">ige xundin yi xuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">A foyen nafa, igene yi godo.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>A yi a falane makɛnɛn Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">A bata tɔnne nun sariyane sɛbɛ Isirayila xa.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>A mi na ɲɔxɔnna ligaxi siya gbɛtɛ yo xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">E mi a sariyane kolon.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s">Daala birin xa Ala tantun</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Ɛ tan naxanye kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">ɛ Alatala tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Ɛ tan naxanye kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">ɛ a tantun.<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Ɛ tan a malekane birin xa a tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">Ɛ tan a ganla birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">ɛ a tantun.<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Sogen nun kikena, ɛ a tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">Ɛ tan saren naxanye yilenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">ɛ a tantun.<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Ɛ a tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">ɛ tan naxanye ariyanna yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">e nun ɛ tan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">igen naxanye kore walaxan fari.<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Ɛ Alatala xinla tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">Amasɔtɔ e daxi a yamarin nan bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>A yi e ti e funfuni habadan han habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">A yi yamarin fi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">naxan mi matandɛ mumɛ.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun bɔxɔ xɔnna fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">ɛ tan ige yi sube magaxuxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">ɛ tan fɔxɔ igen tilinne,<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>kuye sarinna, balabalan kɛsɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">kundaan nun ige xundina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">foye gbeen naxan a falan suxu,<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>ɛ tan geyane nun yire matexine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">wudi bogilane nun sumanne birin,<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>burunna subene nun xuruseene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">xɔline nun bubu seene,<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>bɔxɔn mangane nun siyane birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">ɛ tan kuntigine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">nun kitisaan naxanye birin bɔxɔn ma,<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>banxulanne nun sungutunne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">xɛmɛ fonne nun dii ɲɔrɛne,<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>ɛ birin xa Alatala xinla tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">A xili keden peen nan binyaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">A tan nan nɔɔn nabama bɔxɔn nun koren xun na.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>A bata a tɔgɔndiya muxune sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Isirayila muxune rafan a ma han!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s">Tantun bɛtina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Tantunna Ala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Ɛ bɛti nɛnɛn ba Alatala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Ɛ a tantun a tɔgɔndiya muxune malanni.<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Isirayila muxune, ɛ sɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">a tan nan ɛ daxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">Siyon muxune xa ɲaxan e mangan na.<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>E xa e bodon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">e yi Ala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">e tanbanna nun bɔlɔnna maxa a xa.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Alatalaa muxune a kɛnɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">naxanye limaniyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">a ne rakisima nɛn.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Tɔgɔndiya muxune xa ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">e binyen fi Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">e sɔnxɔ sɛwani e sadene ma.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>E xa lu Ala tantunɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">e yi silanfan dɛ firin kanna suxu e yii,<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>e e gbeen ɲɔxɔ siyane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">e siya gbɛtɛne ɲaxankata.<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>E yi yɔlɔnxɔnna sa e mangane ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">e yi e kuntigine xidi wuren na.<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>E yi e ɲaxankata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">alo e yalagi feen sɛbɛxi kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">A tɔgɔndiya muxune birin ma xunna kenla nan na ra.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Tantunna Alatala xa!<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛ Ala tantun</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>Tantunna Alatala xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Ɛ Ala tantun a yire sariɲanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">ɛ a sɛnbɛn tantun kore xɔnna ma.<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>Ɛ a tantun a wali gbeene fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">Ɛ a tantun bayo a gbo han!<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>Ɛ a tantun xɔta xuiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">Ɛ a tantun bɔlɔnna nun kondenni.<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>Ɛ a tantun tanbanni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">e nun sɛwa fare bodonni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">Ɛ a tantun maxa se luti kanne nun xulenne ra.<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>Ɛ a tantun kariɲanne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">Ɛ a tantun kariɲan xui gbeene ra.<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Niimaseene birin xa Alatala tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Tantunna Ala xa!<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
